window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 - No One Looked at Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 1401: No One Looked at Her","He left after receiving an affirmative answer after giving Qiao Nian a few more reminders and asking if she was going out to eat with them again. He even closed the door for her.","The girl took off her baseball cap and tied her hair into a refreshing ponytail after the room regained its silence.","She grabbed her phone, put on her headset, and headed out of the room.","It wasn’t easy for her to come back, so she definitely had to visit Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen.","Before Qiao Nian left, she called Aunt Chen and told her that she would be there in half an hour. She hung up and sent a message to a certain someone, telling him that she had gone to visit Aunt Chen’s family.","...","At the same time.","On a certain plane heading to Rao City from Beijing Airport.","The aircrew finished delivering the water and blankets and pushed the cart back to the work cabin.","She turned around and pulled the curtain. Immediately, a few flight attendants with similar looks and slender figures surrounded her.","“How is it? Did you see Young Master Ye?”","“Did Young Master Ye speak to you?”","“And Young Master Bo and the others... God, you’re really lucky. The purser picked you to deliver their food. I’m so envious. I’d definitely find a way to talk to them if I was picked. My death will be worth it as long as I can get any one of them!”","The most outstanding-looking flight attendant, who was surrounded by all the flight attendants, had not said a word since she returned. She looked like she had suffered a blow.","She looked at the group of envious little sisters around her, her eyes filled with bitterness. She couldn’t bring herself to tell them that she had just gone out with the same ambition and anticipation, thinking that she could impress the VIPs with her outstanding looks.","Who would have thought that the face she was so proud of seemed ordinary to them?","Not to mention her target, Master Wang of Beijing.","Even Young Master Bo and the others did not look at her. It was as if she was just a tool for delivering food. No one looked at her directly no matter how beautiful and sweet she was.","She was speechless and couldn’t say anything.","On the plane.","Qin Si and the others did not take her seriously and did not even look at her.","This plane was Bo Jingxing’s private jet.","The Bo family was in the aviation business and did not lack planes and flight attendants. This time, they were flying to Rao City at the last minute. Thus, Bo Jingxing specially arranged for his private plane.","Because it was a private plane, the aircraft’s supporting facilities were all top-notch.","The plane had a spacious leather sofa, television, bar, and Wi-Fi. Probably no one would think they were on a plane if it wasn’t for the thick clouds outside the window.","“Damn, I lost again!”","The flight had been quiet.","Ye Wangchuan was playing with his phone, Bo Jingxing was reading, and Gu San was looking at the clouds outside the window. No one knew what he was thinking.","Qin Si’s voice was loud. He threw his phone away angrily and complained gloomily, “Zhang Yang, do you f*cking know how to play? I’ve never won a game with you! I’m not playing anymore.”","Zhang Yang had no choice but to put down his phone. He was even more depressed than him. He said aggrievedly, “Young Master Qin, you can’t blame me if you lose. You don’t leave and insist on fighting them head-on every time I signal you to retreat. It’s not that I don’t want to save you, but I really can’t...”"]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 - It’s All Because of My Pig Teammates, Sister Nian’s Identity","paragraphs":["Chapter 1402: It’s All Because of My Pig Teammates, Sister Nian’s Identity","1437 Chs","ADD","1402 It’s All Because of My Pig Teammates, Sister Nian’s Identity","Translator: Atlas Studios","Editor: Atlas Studios","“You mean I’m lousy?” Qin Si clearly couldn’t accept this. He placed his hands on his hips self-righteously. “Then, how come Sister Qiao can carry me?”","Zhang Yang was speechless.","Of course, a hidden-level big shot like Miss Qiao could carry Young Master Qin, who was addicted to suicide. He, on the other hand, was not a big shot. Young Master Qin was like a suicide squad when he played games. Zhang Yang wasn’t a big shot in the game. How could he carry him?","“You still refuse to admit that you’re lousy...” Qin Si turned his attention to Ye Wangchuan after muttering.","He saw that the man was leaning lazily on the leather sofa and about to sink into it. His strong waist and long legs were especially eye-catching.","He couldn’t help but think of the flight attendant who had tried her best to speak to them. She looked average but was quite confident. She flirted with Master Wang like a comedian.","He clicked his tongue and thought of Qiao Nian, then asked, “Master Wang, has Sister Qiao arrived at the hotel?”","“Yeah.”","Ye Wangchuan put down his phone and looked at him with his dark eyes. He said lazily, “She went to visit Aunt Chen.”","Qin Si thought about who Aunt Chen was before remembering. “Oh, is that Aunt Chen who helped her when she was young?”","“Yes.” Ye Wangchuan straightened and bent to pick up the glass on the table. He swirled it and took a sip of water.","Then, he casually put it down again.","His action caused Qin Si to notice the paper bag on the table. He craned his neck curiously and asked, “By the way, Master Wang, I haven’t asked you yet. What’s in this paper bag? You specially brought it out in the morning. What’s in it? Sister Qiao’s things?”","“Her express delivery. She left the house before it arrived,” Ye Wangchuan answered casually.","Gu San turned around. His hesitant expression was simply suffocating.","He was the one who received the express delivery in the morning. He was also the one who asked Master Wang to sign for the delivery. Therefore, he remembered very clearly the name he had seen in the sender column—Jian Jin!","Recently, all the forces in Beijing who had been on guard against the big shot from the illegal district were extremely nervous.","The head of the JC Corporation was friends with the diamond big boss.","He hadn’t given much thought when he first saw the sender’s name. He then looked at the sender’s address.","The address was the Four Seasons where Jian Jin was staying.","Qiao Nian knew Jian Jin.","Gu San felt that his knowledge had been refreshed once more. He had been troubled since he boarded the plane. He wanted to ask Qiao Nian how she knew an illegal big shot like Jian Jin.","However, Master Wang did not seem to have noticed it. He had been holding it in and did not dare to remind Ye Wangchuan to take a look.","However, this secret was like ants crawling on his heart. It gnawed at his heart and caused an itch. He wanted to spill the beans but did not dare to.","Qin Si didn’t notice that he had suddenly turned around and was staring at them with a complicated expression. He immediately replied with “oh” when Ye Wangchuan said that the paper bag contained Qiao Nian’s express delivery, then muttered in confusion, “Does Sister Qiao know anyone else in Beijing? Who would send her an express delivery? Could it be her classmates from First High School?”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes flickered. The light outside the plane landed on his handsome face and reflected on his high nose bridge. He did not answer Qin Si’s question.","His phone vibrated at this moment.","Ye Wangchuan looked down and unlocked it. He saw that it was a text message from someone without a number."]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 - Found the Person Behind Madam Zhu","paragraphs":["Chapter 1403: Found the Person Behind Madam Zhu","He seemed to know who the number belonged to. He lowered his eyes and looked down coldly.","The message was very simple. It only said: [Hengfeng Corporation’s Qi family].","Hengfeng Corporation, Qi family.","The answer was more or less unexpected.","Ye Wangchuan rested his hand on his lap and casually raised his fingers. This was a common action when he was thinking about something.","He had gotten someone to investigate the person behind Madam Zhu. He didn’t expect that along the way, he would find the Qi family of Hengfeng Corporation.","Hengfeng Corporation?","The result was somewhat unexpected.","However, Hengfeng Corporation had always had some background in the illegal district. It was just that their background was ordinary and they were not considered one of the top forces in the illegal district.","The Qi family’s power was mainly overseas, in the Middle East.","After Ye Wangchuan finished reading the message, he turned off his phone and looked at Bo Jingxing, who had been reading a book. “Is there anyone related to Hengfeng Corporation in this competition?”","“Why are you suddenly asking this?” Bo Jingxing put down the book in surprise. He thought for a moment and frowned, then looked at him and said slowly, “I don’t think so...”","He was halfway through the sentence when he remembered something. He frowned again and corrected himself. “No, there’s someone.”","“Who is it?”","Ye Wangchuan’s face was thin, and his sitting posture was lazy and casual. However, his restrained black eyes were very sharp, as if they could see through people’s hearts.","Seeing that his expression was quite serious, Bo Jingxing even picked up the water on the table and took a sip. He was stunned for a moment before telling him what he knew.","“You’ve heard of that man. He’s from Country M. His name is Mas.”","Ye Wangchuan paused for a second and then returned to normal. His rose-colored lips pursed and he said meaningfully, “Mas?”","“That’s him.” Bo Jingxing massaged his eyebrows and said earnestly, “Have you forgotten that I once mentioned this person to you when the Ninth Branch was recruiting? He’s stronger than Zhou Wei in the computing field. At that time, I mentioned to you if you wanted to recruit him, but you rejected me. Mas entered the Hengfeng Corporation later on.”","Ye Wangchuan tapped the back of his hand with his slightly cold fingertips and narrowed his eyes.","Bo Jingxing didn’t know what he was thinking. He thought for a moment and said, “Mas can’t actually be considered to have entered Heng Feng Corporation. To be sure, Hengfeng Corporation has been privately funding him for the past two years. He’s mainly responsible for helping the Qi family in the chip research field.","“His research was considered a success in itself. Do you remember that Hengfeng Corporation even took the latest chip to the illegal district for the exhibition?”","Bo Jingxing raised his eyebrows and said with a faint smile, “Who knew that he and Hengfeng Corporation would be so unlucky? Our country has also developed a chip similar to theirs. Hengfeng Corporation spent a lot of money and energy researching this chip. Previously, they wanted to find the Red Alliance to adjudicate and rely on their power to pressure the IT Association and frame us for copying their things. In the end, the Red Alliance suddenly stopped helping them and even stood on our side.”","“I know about this!” Qin Si and Zhang Yang were listening to their conversation. Upon hearing this, he finally found a place to interrupt. As if he was suffocating, he quickly interrupted to find his presence. “I was also in the illegal district at that time.”","Unfortunately, Bo Jingxing ignored him and continued slowly in a calm tone, “Hengfeng Corporation suffered a huge blow after that incident. There was a problem with the company’s capital chain and it was on the verge of bankruptcy. Qi Rongguang used many connections, but it was useless... I don’t know what he did after that. In any case, Hengfeng Corporation narrowly survived that crisis and recently recovered.”"]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 - Isn’t Sister Qiao in Danger?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1404: Isn’t Sister Qiao in Danger?","“It’s a coincidence that the scientific expert leading our team is your father-in-law.”","Bo Jingxing smiled. “It’s Sister Qiao again... Tsk, it’s fate!”","Ye Wangchuan had been listening to him quietly. Only now did he say calmly, “I remember Country M changing participants once, right?”","“?”","Bo Jingxing thought for a moment and seemed to remember. He said calmly, “I think so. Mas is from the Middle East, not from M Nation. Besides, he’s arrogant and rarely participates in these competitions. He hasn’t even been on that honor roll for hackers, but in the field, everyone agrees that he’s as good as the top hacker, Sun.”","Ye Wangchuan laughed. “Huh. No less than Sun?”","Qin Si couldn’t help but interrupt again and curse. “F*ck, who is so strong?”","After all, Bo Jingxing was not a hacker. He shrugged. “I don’t know. I’m just telling you what I know.”","He pushed up his glasses and said with a burning gaze, “Miss Qiao’s opponents in this competition are all quite strong. Other than Mas, there’s another person, Aiden. This person is from Country D, and he’s not weak either. His status in the hacker world is comparable to Zhou Hengfeng’s status in the domestic hacker world. Everyone recognizes him as the number one hacker in his country. He’s ranked 18th on the hacker’s Heaven Leaderboard.”","Ye Wangchuan did not say anything.","Qin Si was silent. He muttered softly, “Where did these f*cking monsters come from? It’s just a software competition. Do they have to be so serious? These people have already joined. Damn, haven’t they won?”","“What else do you think?” Bo Jingxing glanced at him from the corner of his eye and said calmly, “This competition is impressive worldwide. This is not a competition. It also represents the computing power of the participating countries.”","There was some silence.","After being speechless for two seconds, Qin Si grabbed his hair, looked up, and said gloomily and worriedly, “Isn’t Sister Qiao in danger?”","Master Wang and the others were chatting, so Zhang Yang did not dare to interrupt like Qin Si. However, he had the same thoughts.","Qiao Nian was in trouble this time!","After so many incidents, Zhang Yang already admired Qiao Nian.","He would usually blindly believe that Qiao Nian could do anything.","But this time...","Zhang Yang thought of Qiao Nian’s injured right hand and his heart turned cold. He comforted her. “Miss Qiao’s hand is injured. This is inevitable...”","However, Qin Si was in a low mood and ignored him.","Zhang Yang couldn’t continue and closed his mouth gloomily.","Bo Jingxing glanced at the handsome man. Seeing that Ye Wangchuan seemed quite calm and not worried about Qiao Nian’s upcoming competition at all, he raised his eyebrows in surprise. “Young Master Ye, aren’t you worried?”","“Worried about what?” Ye Wangchuan was sending a message for someone to investigate Mas. Hearing this, he raised his chin slightly and glanced lazily at his good friend. After roughly understanding what the other party meant, he replied calmly, “I’m not worried, because she’s Qiao Nian.”"]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 - 5: Mas Is Indeed Related to the Qi Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 1405: Mas Is Indeed Related to the Qi Family","The entire cabin was stunned as soon as he finished speaking.","Everyone’s first reaction was that his answer was too wild.","What was wrong with Qiao Nian?","Just when they thought of this... Bo Jingxing and Qin Si crushed this thought.","They recalled what happened around Qiao Nian. The people around her fell silent, then collectively shut down.","That’s right. Before Qiao Nian came to the capital, everyone in the capital thought that she was just an ordinary person from Rao City.","And then?","Then, there was Wei Ying, Wei Ling, Jiang Xianrou, Liang Lu... Everyone who looked down on Qiao Nian was beaten up by the big boss.","Qiao Nian’s name wasn’t awesome. What was awesome was who called that name.","...","Intercontinental Hotel, 18th floor.","The people living on this floor were from Country M.","Mas and the assistant from Country M lived on this floor.","Suite 1808.","A slender man over 1.80 meters tall walked from the bar to the sofa with a bottle of champagne.","“Why have you come to see me?”","He had dark hair, tanned skin, and deep green eyes. His facial features were also relatively well defined, but his face was overly rough-featured, with a slightly longer chin. The shape of his face was closer to a horse’s, which was a poor match for his beautiful eyes.","He was wearing the hotel bathrobe.","He refused to wash the thin belt around his waist properly. A large area of his skin was exposed, making him look frivolous.","Mas carried the champagne to the sofa and sat down. Then, he placed his long legs on the coffee table and uncorked the champagne. He drank in big, rude gulps.","Sitting opposite him was an arrogant girl, Qi Lanyin. Qi Lanyin frowned and said in an unpleasant tone when she saw his unrestrained actions, “Why do you have to sit like this? Can’t you put on your clothes properly?”","Mas looked at her coldly and replied nonchalantly, “This is my room. You can get out if you don’t like it.”","“You!” Qi Lanyin’s face instantly turned red.","“Enough.”","Fortunately, a woman called out to her in a low voice at this moment.","Although Qi Lanyin was unhappy with the other party’s attitude, she was very afraid of the woman. She only clenched her fists and shouted unhappily, “Aunt!”","The middle-aged woman glanced at her. She didn’t say anything, but Qi Lanyin did not dare to say anything.","“Mas. We came over to see you to talk business.”","The woman was in her 40s and looked graceful. Her silver-white satin dress clung to her body, outlining her curvaceous and charming appearance. Her every move exuded a strong feminine aura.","Mas restrained himself and sat up straight, but he still sounded impatient. “What is it? Go ahead.”","The middle-aged woman smiled and took a cigarette from the pack. She lit it and held it between her fingers, then said flatly, “Aiden has dropped out.”","Mas looked at her, a little surprised. “He quit? How come?”","He hadn’t thought much of Aiden, but he hadn’t expected him to be so timid.","“You’re thinking too much. He didn’t withdraw from the competition because of you.” The middle-aged woman raised her eyelids and looked at him with a faint smile. Seeing that his expression had changed, she continued unhurriedly, “He bumped into that girl from Country Z downstairs and then immediately withdrew from the competition. Mas, it seems that the pressure you give off is inferior to that of an ordinary girl from Country Z.”"]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406: It’s Hard to Say Who Got Slapped","paragraphs":["Chapter 1406: It’s Hard to Say Who Got Slapped","Mas’ expression was no longer pleasant when he heard this. He slammed the champagne bottle on the table and wiped his mouth. He looked at her and sneered. “Don’t worry, I’ll definitely prove myself tomorrow!”","However, the middle-aged woman smiled noncommittally and took a puff of the cigarette. There was a hidden surge under her charming eyes...","Qiao Nian!","Qiao Nian had almost destroyed the Qi family. How could she tolerate this?!","She took a drag on her cigarette and flicked the ash off it with the tip of her finger. Her sultry eyes looked at the arrogant and confident Mas. “I’ll be waiting for your good news, Mas,” she said in her charming voice.","Mas sneered. He didn’t understand why she took a freshman from Country Z so seriously. He was very confident and said in a low voice, “Don’t worry, the first place in this competition will definitely be mine!”","Qi Lanyin interrupted at this moment. She clenched her fists so hard that she almost broke her nails. “You must embarrass Qiao Nian tomorrow.”","Previously, she had been crushed by Qiao Nian in front of the audience in the medical competition. Qiao Nian even posted their rankings on Instagram to humiliate her.","She still remembered the original grudge.","So what if Qiao Nian was Sun?","This time, they found Mas, who was as famous as her. Mas was publicly acknowledged as a top hacker who could compete with her.","Qiao Nian’s right hand was fractured, so she could only use one hand tomorrow.","Losing was almost inevitable!","She didn’t just want Qiao Nian to lose the competition. She wanted more!","Qi Lanyin gritted her teeth and said with a twisted expression, “I’ll also make her have a taste of being slapped in the face.”","...","Qiao Nian didn’t know that someone had racked their brains to humiliate her. They even wanted to see her embarrass herself in the competition.","Qiao Nian stuffed her earphones in her ears and carried a thermos in her hand after she returned from Aunt Chen’s place. She slowly walked into the lobby and prepared to go back to her room.","“Qiao Nian.”","To her surprise, she bumped into someone she didn’t want to bump into when she reached the elevator.","She turned around and narrowed her eyes lazily when she saw Fu Ge and the Fu family standing behind him. Qiao Chen and Shen Qiongzhi were also with them.","Qiao Chen and Shen Qiongzhi’s expressions were obviously uneasy when they saw her.","Qiao Chen’s face turned pale as she called out weakly, “Sister.”","Qiao Nian pretended not to hear her.","Qiao Chen’s expression turned ugly. She couldn’t flare up in front of everyone and could only silently endure it.","Shen Qiongzhi simply remained silent and stood there like a wooden stake.","Madam Fu reacted quickly and immediately pushed Shen Qiongzhi to the front. She raised her chin slightly and gestured for her to speak.","Shen Qiongzhi’s expression changed drastically. After a long while, she squeezed out, “Ah, you’re back in Rao City.”","She didn’t even call Qiao Nian’s name.","The word “ah” replaced her name.","That tone was as distant as a stranger’s. It was even more polite than a stranger’s.","Madam Fu glared at her as if she expected better from her. She hurriedly squeezed out a fawning smile and greeted Qiao Nian as if they were familiar with each other. “Qiao Nian, what a coincidence. I didn’t expect to meet you here. We’re really fated.”","“By the way, you haven’t had lunch, have you?” She invited warmly. “Since we all bumped into each other, would you like to come over and have lunch with us?”","Madam Fu tried not to look ingratiating, but the unconcealable ambition in her eyes betrayed her.","“I made a reservation at the banquet hall on the first floor for my birthday today. Let’s eat together.”"]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 It’s Not That I Don’t Have Time, It’s Just That I Don’t Have the Time to Care About Them","paragraphs":["1407 It’s Not That I Don’t Have Time, It’s Just That I Don’t Have the Time to Care About Them","Then, Madam Fu subtly tugged at her son, indicating for Fu Ge to invite Qiao Nian.","Stunned, a complicated expression appeared on Fu Ge’s handsome face. He invited her softly, “That’s right, Qiao Nian. It’s my mother’s birthday. Come and eat with us.”","Qiao Chen’s expression changed drastically. She was so shocked and angry that she almost broke her nails.","Shen Qiongzhi’s expression did not look good, either.","Qiao Nian pulled up the brim of her cap. Seeing the sudden change in their expressions, she curled her lips in disdain and said lazily, “I’m not free.”","Her refusal was concise and straightforward!","Fu Ge, Madam Fu, and the Fu family looked a little embarrassed.","Madam Fu refused to give up. She wanted to pester her some more.","Just then, a nimble figure pushed past them into the room.","“Miss Qiao.” Cai Gang shook off his assistant and welcomed her with a smile. “What a coincidence. I didn’t expect to meet you here.”","“What a coincidence.”","“Yes, what a coincidence.” Cai Gang was all smiles. His attitude towards Qiao Nian could only be described as respectful. He rubbed his hands together and he said with a smile, “I heard that you were coming to Rao City to participate in the competition. I wanted to pick you up at the airport, but I didn’t ask about your flight...”","“Have you eaten?” Cai Gang was much more natural than Madam Fu. He looked at Qiao Nian’s right hand, which was in plaster, and immediately looked away. He said brightly, “I happened to bump into you. If you haven’t eaten, I don’t know if I’ll have the honor to treat you to a meal.”","As he spoke, he carefully observed the girl’s reaction and added, “Old Madam Tang is also inside. We booked a private room.”","Madam Fu and the others turned green.","Cai Gang and Tang Wei were the people they had invited previously.","There was no need to talk about Cai Gang. Cai Gang could be said to be a man of his word in Rao City after Wei Dongshan’s downfall.","The Tang family was one of the top families in Rao City.","However, both Cai Gang and Tang Wei rejected their invitations and said in unison that they did not have time today.","From the looks of it, they had just made up their minds to ask Qiao Nian out for a meal and had no time for them!","Madam Fu felt ashamed, as if she had been slapped in the face. She saw stars and found it difficult to breathe.","She was paying attention to Qiao Nian’s reaction.","Qiao Nian raised her hand and glanced at the elevator that was still going down. Then, she looked at Cai Gang impatiently and said calmly, “I’ve eaten. Maybe next time.”","“You’ve eaten...” Cai Gang looked a little regretful, but he quickly perked up and bowed with a smile. “Alright. I’ll wait for you.”","“Hmm.” Qiao Nian’s voice was lazy as if in agreement.","Cai Gang had specially waited in the hotel to show his face to Qiao Nian and get to know her. This time, not only had he shown his face, but he had also received a promise from Qiao Nian. What could he be dissatisfied with?","Cai Gang revealed a satisfied smile and laughed loudly. “Then, Miss Qiao, I’ll wait for your news. Let me know when you have time. I’m free anytime.”","Ding.","Just then the elevator chimed and the doors opened.","Qiao Nian held the thermos and nodded at him. Then, she walked into the elevator without looking in Qiao Chen and Shen Qiongzhi’s direction.","They waited until the elevator doors closed.","Madam Fu and Fu Ge didn’t have a chance to speak to Qiao Nian."]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 The Attitude of the Entire Circle","paragraphs":["1408 The Attitude of the Entire Circle","Madam Fu watched as the elevator numbers continued to climb. She pressed between her eyebrows and opened her mouth. “Cai...”","She’d only called out one word and hadn’t had time to say the rest.","Cai Gang had already restrained his amiable attitude now that Qiao Nian wasn’t around. He glanced at Madam Fu and the others with his bright eyes. His smile paused for a moment before he interrupted her and said in a low voice, “Madam Fu, I still have something on. I won’t talk to you anymore.”","There was some silence.","!!","He had clearly said that he was free earlier!","But his attitude turned businesslike the next instant. It was obvious what he meant.","Madam Fu’s face burned with pain and her vision darkened. She could barely maintain her elegant expression and could only squeeze out a dry sentence. “Ah, it’s fine if Officer Cai has something to do. Go ahead. Your matters are more important.”","The Fu family had some reputation in Rao City, and Cai Gang did not want to fall out with them. However, he knew how to read the situation and knew how to treat this group of people.","He nodded at Madam Fu and said in a dignified voice, “Alright, I’ll leave first. Have fun.”","After saying that, he walked past the Fu family and brushed past Madam Fu and Fu Ge.","He always treated Madam Fu with that kind of indifference, let alone the others.","Cai Gang barely looked at Qiao Chen, Shen Qiongzhi, and the others. He didn’t even look at Fu Ge, the Fu family’s heir.","Madam Fu had been in Rao City for so long and was also a smart person. She knew that Cai Gang’s attitude represented the attitude of the people at the top of the pyramid—to ostracize the Fu family!","Her heart was bleeding. She turned around and glared at Fu Ge with hatred, then scolded him in a low voice. “Look at his attitude. If you had a pair of good eyes back then, our family wouldn’t have fallen to this state!”","“Mom.” Fu Ge looked embarrassed and awkward.","How could Madam Fu not regret it? Seeing him like this, she recalled that she didn’t have good eyes back then. Otherwise, why would she think that Qiao Chen could compare to Qiao Nian?","She turned her head again and glanced cynically at Shen Qiongzhi, who was still putting on airs and pretending to be uncomfortable. She didn’t hide her contempt.","“However, no matter how blind we are, it’s better than some people. We picked up a sesame seed and lost a watermelon. We could have relied on Qiao Nian to rise up the ranks, but she insisted on courting death. Now, she doesn’t even look at us. I wonder who they’re putting on an act for. It’s as if they’re rushing to call her mother! Why don’t you take a look at yourself? You’re already worlds apart from her!”","Shen Qiongzhi had never suffered such insults before. Moreover, Madam Fu mocked her in front of all the Fu family relatives. Her face turned pale and red. She wished she could leave immediately.","As for Qiao Chen, she didn’t even have the strength to leave.","Shen Qiongzhi could only stand there in humiliation.","Qiao Chen was beside her. Her mind went blank when Madam Fu called out her name. She paled and her lips trembled.","Probably because the stares were too ironic.","Qiao Chen didn’t know if she was really unconscious or not. She fainted the moment Madam Fu finished speaking."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 Waiting for Her at the Door","paragraphs":["1409 Waiting for Her at the Door","“Chen Chen!”","Fu Ge and Shen Qiongzhi’s expressions changed and they ran over.","This Qiao Chen!","Madam Fu was so angry that the tips of her fingers trembled. Her birthday party was ruined.","!!","...","The elevator reached the 16th floor and stopped automatically to open the doors.","Qiao Nian walked out of the elevator leisurely, still carrying the thermos she had brought back from Aunt Chen’s place.","The light in the hallway was slightly warm, casting a faint orange glow.","Qiao Nian walked along the carpeted corridor. Before she reached Room 1606, she saw the man leaning against her door.","She stopped in her tracks.","Ye Wangchuan heard footsteps and looked up. Seeing Qiao Nian, his eyes seemed to be filled with thousands of stars. He said in a gentle voice, “Nian Nian.”","This time, Qiao Nian not only stopped in her tracks but also felt as if her heart had been stabbed. An inexplicable emotion rose in her heart.","Ye Wangchuan walked over and took the thermos from her as if it was natural. He smiled and asked in a low voice when he saw the silver thermos, “Aunt Chen made you soup?”","Qiao Nian had already regained her senses. Seeing that he was sizing up the thermos, she replied as she walked forward, “She was worried that I wouldn’t be able to eat well in the hotel. Before I left, she insisted on filling a portion of pork ribs soup for me to drink before I went to bed tonight.”","Initially, she did not want to go through so much trouble, but Aunt Chen insisted that she take it. She said that if she drank more bone soup, her injured hand would recover faster.","Ye Wangchuan followed behind her casually. Seeing that the girl had found the room card and opened the door, he followed her in and smiled softly. “Aunt Chen is also concerned about you.”","Qiao Nian threw the room card on the cabinet table after she entered. She didn’t say anything and pressed the button. “I know.”","So, she eventually carried the thermos back to the hotel.","Qiao Nian was also staying in a suite. The room was spacious and well-lit. Overall, it felt pretty good.","Next, she walked straight to the refrigerator, opened it, took out a bottle of mineral water, and handed it to him. Then, she took a bottle of water for herself, glanced at the man who followed her in, and said, “Where’s Qin Si and the others? Why don’t I see them?”","Ye Wangchuan placed the thermos on the dining room table and took the mineral water from her. The cold water reduced the moist heat in his palm.","He raised his eyebrows slightly and looked at the girl. “They came to look for you when they arrived, but they went out to eat when they realized you weren’t here.”","“To eat?” Qiao Nian couldn’t unscrew the cap with one hand and stared at the mineral water in frustration. She still wasn’t used to not being able to use one hand. “You didn’t go with them?”","“I’m not hungry.”","Ye Wangchuan saw it and snatched the mineral water from her, then handed it back to her after unscrewing the cap.","Qiao Nian took the water from his hand and said politely, “Thank you.”","She tipped her head back and was just about to take a sip of water.","Ye Wangchuan suddenly asked in a sexy, low voice, “Do you know Jian Jin?”","“Ahem!”","Qiao Nian choked on a mouthful of water and coughed violently.","“Drink slowly.” Ye Wangchuan had only wanted to ask her, but he didn’t expect her to have such a big reaction. His expression changed and he immediately walked over. He patted her back to calm her down, his actions very gentle.","Qiao Nian managed to catch her breath, but she had a headache. She stopped drinking, put her hand down, and looked at the man calmly. “Why are you suddenly asking this?”"]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 Sister Nian, Fell Off the Horse","paragraphs":["1410 Sister Nian, Fell Off the Horse","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a shirt and black pants today. He was dressed very casually, but it couldn’t hide his superior figure. His casual clothes also made him look noble.","He stopped Qiao Nian by the refrigerator and lowered his eyes. He looked very easy to talk to. His rose-colored lips even curled up into an alluring smile. “Jian Jin sent you a package. Since you weren’t around, I signed for it.","“The address is Presidential Suite 6618 of the Four Seasons Hotel in Beijing. The suite has long since been booked by a big shot in the illegal district. Coincidentally, the person who booked that room is also named Jian Jin and also a member of the JC Corporation.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","She wanted to be left alone.","Then, she would send Jian Jin and Slim Waist Control to the independent continent to have their brains checked!","It was just a delivery. Did she have to use her real name??","Ye Wangchuan was calm and composed. He smiled faintly as he spoke. “Also...”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at him in surprise. She hadn’t expected there to be something else. “What?”","Ye Wangchuan blocked her inside. He lowered his beautiful eyes and looked at her with a burning gaze. His thin lips even curled up slightly. “That paper bag contains a handmade bracelet. The style... is very novel. It doesn’t look like it was designed by a girl.”","Qiao Nian was almost pierced by his gaze. The string in her head tightened another inch, and she had the urge to bring Jian Jin to take a look at her brain.","It was one thing for her to make a delivery with her real name, but she actually used a paper bag. She didn’t even put it into a box.","Seeing that she was silent, Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and said in a friendly tone, “God Qiao, aren’t you going to explain this gift to me?”","Qiao Nian’s lips twitched. She looked up and saw the determination in his deep eyes. Her head hurt even more. She pressed her hand against the man who was blocking her way but didn’t push him away. She could only put her hand down and say quickly, “A friend gave it to me.”","“Friend?”","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but remember that he had once been her ‘good friend’. He didn’t expect to be jealous over such a small matter, but his chest couldn’t help but ache.","Tsk, he did seem a little jealous.","“Just an ordinary friend.” Qiao Nian hadn’t realized that he was jealous. She had a high chance of guessing what he was thinking. She didn’t like to explain, but immediately added, “It’s not what you think.”","Ye Wangchuan saw her frown and lower her eyes. He explained to her uncomfortably, and the sourness in his chest subsided a little. His gaze was locked on the girl, and his eyes were deep. “Oh, what am I thinking?”","Qiao Nian was trapped, unable to get out or dodge. His chest was pressed against her, and his heartbeat was steady and strong. It beat against her ears like a drum.","Qiao Nian felt as if a prairie fire had ignited where her hand was pressed against him. It was very hot.","She moved quickly and bit the man’s thin lips. She kissed him, a little harder but quickly.","Qiao Nian moved away after she finished kissing him. Her long eyelashes fluttered, and she suddenly looked up at him. Flames were ignited in the depths of her beautiful black eyes.","Her voice was still very hoarse. “Just a normal friend!","“He came to Beijing recently and made a birthday present for me. It’s as simple as that.”","She calmed down a little and stepped around him again when she finished speaking, ready to walk away.","However, Ye Wangchuan suddenly grabbed her hand and pulled her back. He held her wrist and pressed her against the fridge again. His eyes were lowered and filled with possessiveness, as if he did not hear what she had just said. He only stared at her with a burning gaze and said in a low voice, “... Nian Nian, kissing should be like this.”"]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 Heartless Sister Nian, Closed Online","paragraphs":["1411 Heartless Sister Nian, Closed Online","10 minutes later.","Qiao Nian’s breathing quickened as she pushed him away. Her eyes were evasive and hot. She said vaguely, “I’m going to take a shower.”","Her footsteps were fast and erratic.","Ye Wangchuan watched as she walked towards the bathroom. His slender height leaned to the side and his eyes lowered. His sexy Adam’s apple bobbed as he chuckled.","His gaze was fixed firmly in the direction of the bathroom. His voice was hoarse and charming. “Nian Nian, do you want my help?”","His response was a callous slam of the door, causing a loud bang.","The bathroom door closed before his eyes.","Soon, the sound of running water came inside.","Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up, and his eyes were filled with mixed gentleness. Especially when he lowered his head, the orange light in the room shone warmly on his face. The intoxicating gentleness on his face was even more attractive...","He only smiled before walking back. At the same time, he took the thermos container that Qiao Nian had brought back and heated it in the microwave.","At this moment.","Qin Si and the others also called.","Ye Wangchuan first poured the soup from the thermos into the porcelain bowl, then opened the microwave, placed the porcelain bowl inside, adjusted the time, and pressed the Start button.","After doing all this, he leaned his long legs against the marble counter and unhurriedly took out his phone from his pocket. He picked up the call from Qin Si with one hand.","Qin Si pulled up a small group after he hung up.","Zhang Yang, Tang Ning, and the others were all pulled into the group.","[Qin Si: Who has been in a relationship before? Who has experience? Come out and show yourself.]","[Qin Si: I just want to know one thing. Can dating fill my stomach?]","[Zhang Yang: ?]","[Tang Ning: ?]","Bo Jingxing was sitting opposite him. He had just finished his meal and put down his chopsticks. He held a cup of tea in his hand and blew on it before lowering his head to take a sip.","He glanced sideways and saw Qin Si pulling him into the group.","He put down the teacup in his hand, raised his eyelids, and asked with a half smile, “What’s gotten into you now?”","“I asked Master Wang to come down for dinner, but he refused.” Qin Si looked like he was asking for confirmation. “I’m puzzled. Isn’t he hungry?”","Bo Jingxing thought he was going to say something constructive, but he didn’t expect this. Hence, he ridiculed him mercilessly. “Boring!”","Qin Si was about to retort when a notification sounded in the group.","His attention was drawn back to the phone.","[Tang Ning: That depends on who you’re dating.]","[Tang Ning: I think if I’m dating Miss Qiao or Master Wang... I can survive without eating for three days. I’m satisfied just by looking at their faces.]","[Qin Si: ...]","Only then did he send out the row of ellipses.","Tang Ning sent another message.","[Tang Ning: Young Master Qin, you’re jealous. Why don’t you find one for yourself? Otherwise, it’s not a good idea for you to be so envious of Master Wang and the others dating.]","“Damn!” Qin Si felt terrible. His eyes widened in disbelief and he looked at the three people opposite him. “She said that I’m envious? Why should I be envious? Which eye of hers saw that I’m envious of others being in love?”","Seeing his agitated reaction, Gu San added expressionlessly, “Young Master Qin, Tang Ning is right. If you’re envious of Miss Qiao and the others dating, why don’t you find one yourself?”","Qin Si was no different.","Gu San even added seriously, “Young Master Qin, don’t say that you’re not envious. It’s so obvious since you even created this group.”"]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 The Day of the Competition","paragraphs":["1412 The Day of the Competition","Qin Si was no different.","He was rendered speechless.","He didn’t bother to argue with them. He looked back at his phone and saw a private message from Tang Ning.","[Tang Ning: Young Master Qin, I heard Miss Jiang acknowledged a very powerful godmother. The Jiang family is preparing a filiation banquet. I’m worried that this matter is directed at Miss Qiao. Please help me tell Master Wang.]","Jiang Xianrou wanted to acknowledge a godmother?","Qin Si was a little stunned. He didn’t understand what Jiang Xianrou was up to again.","He shared Tang Ning’s thoughts.","Their first reaction was that Jiang Xianrou was targeting Qiao Nian.","He pondered for a moment without batting an eyelid. He first replied to Tang Ning’s message and asked her not to tell anyone. Then, he sent a screenshot of the WeChat message to Ye Wangchuan.","...","The next day.","On the day of the software competition.","The weather was clear around the city. The sky was as blue as a sheet. A few thin white clouds floated slowly in the wind, as if they had been melted by the sun.","Qiao Nian arrived at the competition venue at nine.","She left after greeting Ye Wangchuan and the others.","Qin Si and the others went to the audience stands.","Qiao Nian, Liang Conglin, and Du Mingwei went backstage to make preparations.","Every contestant from each country had their own lounge. Qiao Nian also had her own lounge.","Her lounge wasn’t large. Apart from a sofa, it contained only a dressing table for makeup and a water dispenser.","Du Mingwei came looking for her not long after Qiao Nian arrived at the lounge, saying that he wanted to introduce her to the International IT Association.","She temporarily left her things in the lounge, picked up her phone, and went out with the baseball cap.","...","A slender figure appeared backstage not long after she left.","After Qiao Chen communicated with the staff, they let her in.","She walked along the backstage corridor and searched room by room for Qiao Nian.","Finally, she saw Qiao Nian’s name pasted on the door of the second last room backstage.","Qiao Nian from Qing University.","Qiao Chen stood at the door and at the tightly-stitched name tag on the door. The words “Qing University” deeply hurt her eyes.","She lowered her lashes and clenched her hands into fists at her sides. After a few seconds of hesitation, she reached up and knocked.","“Knock knock.”","No one answered on her first knock.","Qiao Chen’s face turned pale, and her watery eyes couldn’t hide her humiliation.","She took a deep breath and raised her wrist to knock again.","She learned this time. She called out weakly, “Sister, are you there? It’s me.”","Qiao Chen knocked hard on the door. Firstly, she felt aggrieved. Secondly, she was afraid that Qiao Nian would continue to pretend to be deaf and ignore her.","To her surprise, she knocked hard and the lounge door creaked open in front of her.","Qiao Chen didn’t react for a moment.","It took her a moment to realize Qiao Nian hadn’t closed the door properly.","She didn’t know what was going on inside. After taking a deep breath, Qiao Chen opened the door and walked in.","“I need to talk to you about something.”","Qiao Chen walked in and realized that the lounge was empty.","Her voice trailed off. Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian wasn’t inside.","Qiao Chen had specially come over to talk to Qiao Nian about letting her off the hook, but her efforts were in vain.","Just as she was about to turn around and leave, she suddenly caught sight of Qiao Nian’s black backpack on the dressing table."]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 Sister Nian: Someone Touched My Things","paragraphs":["1413 Sister Nian: Someone Touched My Things","The backpack was unzipped.","She could just make out the contents from where she was.","Qiao Chen suddenly stopped in her tracks, her heart beating faster.","She had a brief moment of hesitation, but the unzipped backpack in front of her was too tempting. Her feet seemed to be nailed to the ground, unable to move.","There was no one here now. One more moment’s hesitation and she might be back.","Qiao Chen almost bit her lip. The pain from her lips stimulated her. Her eyes were slightly red from jealousy. After feeling extremely nervous and hesitant, she slowly walked towards Qiao Nian’s backpack in the lounge...","Three minutes later.","Qiao Chen left the lounge in a hurry.","She deliberately avoided the staff outside and slipped out quietly, afraid that someone would notice her.","She was in a hurry all the way back. The tension lasted until she returned to the stands. She didn’t feel at ease until she went to her seat.","“Chen Chen, what’s wrong?” Shen Qiongzhi saw that she didn’t look too good and was worried about her health. She placed her hand on her shoulder in concern.","Fu Ge came today.","As soon as Shen Qiongzhi spoke, he noticed that Qiao Chen’s face was pale. He touched her forehead and asked with concern, “Why is your forehead so cold? Didn’t you go to the washroom? So fast?”","Feeling guilty, Qiao Chen dodged his hand absent-mindedly and said in a hurry, “Ah, there were too many people in the queue, so I came back first.”","“I see.” Fu Ge didn’t think too much about it. He put down his hand and his handsome face stood out in the crowd. “Then, you can go later.”","Qiao Chen nodded obediently and sat down.","However, her heart was thumping non-stop. She grabbed the hem of her dress with both hands and gripped it tightly before letting go. Her knuckles were white from the force.","...","On the other side, Qiao Nian and Du Mingwei chatted with the people from the International IT Association for a while before returning to the lounge.","Once she was inside.","Glancing from afar at the shoulder bag she’d left on the makeup table before going out, her dark eyes immediately narrowed. “Someone touched my things,” she said coldly.","“Uh...” Du Mingwei immediately broke out in a cold sweat. He turned around to look at Qiao Nian, then followed her gaze and saw the bag on the dressing table. “Are you saying that someone came in?”","Qiao Nian adjusted her cap and walked in unhurriedly.","Du Mingwei couldn’t tell that her bag had been damaged. He frowned in disbelief. “We haven’t been out for long. 10 minutes at most. Who would come in?”","“The zipper was perfectly zipped up. How could you tell at a glance that someone had touched it?”","“... because when I went out, the zipper was open.”","Qiao Nian had already walked to the dressing table. Lowering her eyes, she nimbly opened her bag and checked the contents. Under Du Mingwei’s gaze, she said expressionlessly, “As expected, the hard drive is gone.”","Why was the hard drive gone again!","Du Mingwei was speechless. He didn’t know what he was getting into every day.","He’d had his first experience. This one was a lot calmer than the last.","“I’ll check the surveillance cameras immediately and see who came in!” Even though he was anxious, he immediately reacted and wanted to go out to look for the security personnel."]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 Qiao Nian Was Not Surprised at All","paragraphs":["1414 Qiao Nian Was Not Surprised at All","“It’s too late.”","Hearing the cheers outside, Qiao Nian rubbed her temples calmly.","“The competition is about to begin.”","Du Mingwei looked at the time on his watch. He hadn’t been in a hurry before, but now he was. “So, what do we do now?”","For a moment, he had no suspects. “Why don’t I ask somewhere else, see if they saw anyone enter the lounge?”","Qiao Nian tugged at the brim of her cap. There was a small cut on her lips today, and it was slightly red and swollen. Therefore, she had lowered her cap especially low today, revealing only her snow-white chin. No one would notice her red lips.","But her aura was no different from usual.","She was wild and unrestrained.","She was so arrogant!","And a devil-may-care aura exuded from her.","Yes, she was so carefree!","“There’s no need for that, Teacher Du.” She still had the cast on her right hand, and now that the hard drive was missing, there was no telling who had entered the lounge.","Du Mingwei felt that there was no situation worse than this!","There was some silence.","He didn’t understand why she was so calm.","Qiao Nian said, “They touched my things because they want to see me lose the competition. Go to the security room with Principal Liang and keep the surveillance video.”","“That’s for sure. I’d look for surveillance even if you didn’t tell me,” Du Mingwei whispered, his voice quick and nervous. “But the competition...”","“Heh.” Qiao Nian chuckled and raised her head slightly, revealing her exquisite oval face. Her eyes were flamboyant and bright. Without full confidence, she wouldn’t have such a sharp gaze. She casually put everything back into her bag, her slender fingers resting on the zipper of her shoulder bag. Then, she said cynically, “I’ll handle the competition. You don’t have to worry.”","Du Mingwei was speechless. How could he not worry when the hard drive was gone?","The unveiling ceremony outside was almost over. Du Mingwei heard the host calling the contestants on stage.","He understood the gravity of the situation. He had no choice but to trust the girl in front of him.","He steeled himself. “Fine. I’ll talk to the principal and have him pull up the surveillance footage.","“Hold the fort on the stage while I find the hard drive.”","The outside was urging again.","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids and glanced outside. Then, she said confidently, “Don’t worry, I know what to do.”","The weather in Rao City was good today, and this software competition was the first high-level competition being held in Rao City. It could be said that tickets to the competition were hard to find.","The stands were full.","The breeze sent a cool breeze to dispel the summer heat. The weather was comfortable. At least, it was not as hot as in the capital.","Qiao Chen, Fu Ge, and the others sat around the ninth row. The tickets to the competition were too rare. The ninth row was already relatively close to the front.","Ye Wangchuan, Qin Si, and the others sat in the inner hall. The first three rows were not for sale.","This position gave a better view.","In addition, the location of the inner court was more spacious than the one that Fu Ge and the others could get. They didn’t have to squeeze in with the others.","Zhang Yang had bought water in advance. At this moment, he was giving everyone a bottle.","When he handed it to Ye Wangchuan, he said respectfully, “Master Wang, your water.”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t pick up. Someone seemed to have sent him a message. He stood up from his seat and said to Qin Si and the others in a low voice, “Someone sneaked into the lounge and stole Qiao Nian’s stuff.”"]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 I Really Don’t Know Why Her Father Let Her to Play","paragraphs":["1415 I Really Don’t Know Why Her Father Let Her to Play","“?”","Qin Si was drinking water and subconsciously put it down. He asked in confusion, “Uh, what was stolen?”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes went cold. “Hard drive.”","At this moment, not only Qin Si, but Gu San, Bo Jingxing, and Zhang Yang also looked at him in shock.","Qin Si cursed, “Damn!”","“I’ll go over and take a look first.” Ye Wangchuan didn’t waste his breath on them. He pressed Bo Jingxing’s shoulder and nodded slightly before walking backstage.","Gu San put down his water bottle and immediately followed. “Master Wang, I’ll go with you.”","The two of them walked away from the inner court seats without looking back.","...","In the ninth row.","Fu Ge noticed the commotion in the inner court and frowned. He lowered his voice and said, “The competition is about to begin. Why did Young Master Ye suddenly leave?”","“What Young Master Ye?” Shen Qiongzhi followed his gaze blankly and saw nothing.","However, Qiao Chen saw it. Her beautiful eyes flickered, and she grabbed the hem of her clothes tightly before letting go. She said casually, “Something probably happened to Qiao Nian.”","Fu Ge suddenly turned to look at her, clearly puzzled, not understanding why she said that.","Qiao Chen was a little nervous under his questioning gaze. Not daring to look him in the eye, she lowered her eyelashes to hide her nervousness and guilt and said, “I heard a trace of wind on the way back.”","“?”","Fu Ge didn’t twist it any tighter. He looked sideways at her. “What wind?”","As the two of them spoke, exciting music sounded from the stage. The contestants from various countries had already appeared.","The three others besides Aidan, who had retired the day before.","Country M’s Mas was undoubtedly the most eye-catching presence on the field.","Next was Park Jangwoo from Country H, who was ranked 36th on the Heaven Leaderboard. The other was Qiao Nian, who represented her country.","Fu Ge’s attention was caught by the tsunami of applause and screams from the stands. He turned to stare at the arena.","The girl came out last.","It was still a familiar getup.","She was wearing a protective jacket under her black sweater, with black prints on the sleeves. They looked pretty cool.","The girl was wearing a baseball cap that only revealed her cold chin. Her skin was so fair that it dazzled the eyes.","The stands fell silent for a second as soon as Qiao Nian appeared.","It was mainly because her aura was too strong.","Compared to Mas, who came out coldly and ignored everyone, or the contestant from Country H, who came out second while smiling brightly, she did not deliberately maintain her image. She wasn’t as cold as Mas or the contestant from Country H who deliberately pretended to be amicable. She just walked out quite naturally.","Holding nothing, she pulled on her sweater and cap leisurely, seeming to be strolling leisurely, not paying attention to the dark crowd in the stands as she walked to her seat.","“Why is her hand in a cast?”","“Is Qiao Nian injured?”","“I saw the bandage on her hand, too. I think she used her left hand to pull on her cap. Don’t tell me she can’t use her right hand?”","“No. What about the competition!”","Someone in the eighth row started whispering.","Shen Qiongzhi also saw Qiao Nian’s right wrist in a cast. The burning discomfort in her heart felt much better.","“I really don’t understand why she’s participating in a competition when her hand is like this... I wonder what her father told her. If it were me, I definitely wouldn’t let her play. She’s representing the country, not being a hero for the people. We’ll be the ones who lose face if she loses...”"]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 Qiao Chen Was Tricked Like a Monkey","paragraphs":["1416 Qiao Chen Was Tricked Like a Monkey","Fu Ge could tell from her tone that she wanted to watch the show.","He frowned.","“Mom.” Qiao Chen noticed Fu Ge’s ugly expression and quickly stopped Shen Qiongzhi. “Mom, stop talking.”","Her eyes flickered and she bit her lip. She seemed to be very understanding. “Since Sister has decided to participate in the competition, she must be confident. We have to believe in her...”","Fu Ge’s expression softened, and his tone became much gentler. “Chen Chen, it’s best if you think that way. After all, Qiao Nian is representing the country in this competition. If she wins, we’ll also be able to hold our heads high overseas.”","Ah!","Qiao Chen’s face turned even paler. She lowered her eyelashes and suppressed the jealousy that she almost couldn’t hold back. Her tone changed and said softly, “I know. It’s just that...”","“Just what?” Fu Ge looked at her again, not understanding what she was trying to say.","Qiao Chen adjusted her emotions and looked up. Her beautiful eyes were a little lost as she said helplessly, “I heard someone say that she lost her hard drive on the way here.”","“What did you say?” Fu Ge jumped and reacted strongly. He immediately stood up and looked at Qin Si and the others in the inner court.","It seemed to confirm Qiao Chen’s words. Ye Wangchuan and Gu San were not around.","The competition was about to begin, but neither of them returned.","His heart plummeted.","Qiao Nian didn’t just represent an individual this time. She represented the entire country!","It had been a long time since they raised their heads in a high-tech territory like this one. Everyone overseas thought that they were a weak country in this field.","This time, it wasn’t easy for Qiao Nian to represent the country from the elimination round to the finals. It hadn’t been long since Yin Wenzhi’s incident. How could something like this happen again?","Fu Ge couldn’t tell what he was feeling.","His heart was a mess. Of course, he didn’t see Qiao Chen’s flickering gaze and her obvious shady tone.","“I heard she lost her hard drive. Won’t she...”","Embarrass herself? Qiao Chen had yet to finish her sentence.","“Wait a minute.” Fu Ge had been staring at the stage. As the game began, he saw the girl take something that looked like a hard drive from her pocket and put it into the computer very naturally.","His tense nerves immediately relaxed. He turned to look at Qiao Chen, his handsome face filled with confusion. “Qiao Nian didn’t lose her hard drive. Where did you hear that?”","Qiao Chen had thought that victory was in her hands and that she had the initiative this time. Although she said that she sympathized with Qiao Nian for losing the hard drive, she was actually waiting to see Qiao Nian make a fool of herself.","Her face paled upon suddenly hearing that Qiao Nian had not lost her hard drive, and her eyes widened involuntarily as she turned toward the arena.","On the big screen, the camera zoomed in on Qiao Nian. The girl wearing the baseball cap slowly inserted the hard drive into the computer.","She turned it on and entered the program. It was done in one go!","“...How, how?” Qiao Chen could hardly believe what she was seeing. She rubbed her eyes and opened them again.","Qiao Nian had already pulled out the program from the hard drive.","It was evident that the hard drive was intact!","Qiao Chen’s lips turned pale, and her fingers trembled uncontrollably. She was completely stunned by the situation in front of her.","Qiao Nian had another hard drive?","Qiao Chen’s mind went blank and her lips turned pale. She suddenly realized that she had been tricked.","She had been played like a monkey!"]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 Mas Purposely Provoked Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1417 Mas Purposely Provoked Sister Nian","On stage.","Qiao Nian skillfully placed the hard drive into the computer before turning it on and pulling out the program.","Suddenly, her computer screen went black and she lost control of the mouse and keyboard at the same time.","Then, a thumb-down dynamic icon appeared on her computer screen, followed by a string of mocking English words, ‘Bronze Medalist’.","Third place.","The three contestants’ computers had special cameras pointed at them. Since Qiao Nian’s computer had been hacked, the scene of the thumbs down and the mocking words in English was naturally broadcasted live.","The spectators in the stands saw it.","There was a moment of silence in the entire competition venue. Immediately after, it was as if someone had poked a hornet’s nest. The audience in the stands started arguing.","“What does he mean? Is he mocking our domestic representative?”","In the inner court.","Qin Si, Bo Jingxing, and Zhang Yang also saw this scene.","The veins on Qin Si’s forehead instantly bulged. He threw the water bottle to the ground in anger. “F*ck, who did this!”","Zhang Yang quickly pulled him back and told him not to cause trouble.","“Young Master Qin, forget it. Miss Qiao is currently in the competition. No rule forbids hacking into the opponent’s computer. The other party’s actions conform to the rules of the competition.”","“How can he humiliate people like this? Is it in accordance with the rules of the competition?” Qin Si’s fair face turned red. His eyes also reddened. “Who set up these competition rules? If it’s a competition, it’s a competition. Do you have to humiliate people like this?”","He fumed as he watched from below the stage. He couldn’t imagine how Qiao Nian was feeling right now!","“F*ck, I’ll go find the organizer,” Qin Si said coldly and broke free from Zhang Yang’s hold to leave.","“Stop right there.” Bo Jingxing stopped him and said coldly, “You’ll only cause trouble for Qiao Nian if you go now. Others will only think that she can’t afford to lose.”","Qin Si suddenly stopped and turned around. His face was filled with dark clouds and he was about to explode. “Then, what do you think we should do? Just watch? Let them bully Sister Nian? You can sit still, but I can’t!”","“You have to sit down even if you can’t!”","Bo Jingxing pressed the space between his eyebrows. His eyes, hidden behind his glasses, were sharp and clear. He said angrily, “Zhang Yang is right. The other party’s actions are in line with the rules of the competition. If you go and cause trouble now, the organizers will ignore you. Even if they do anything, your actions will only embarrass Qiao Nian even more... There’s only one way now. Win!”","Qin Si: “... Are you preaching to me?”","His breathing was rapid. “Sister Qiao’s hand is injured. We don’t even know if the hard drive is the original one. Is winning so easy?”","Bo Jingxing stopped talking.","On the stage.","Mas received a close-up shot. The other party’s lips were curled into an arrogant smile. It could basically be confirmed that it was Mas who had hacked Qiao Nian’s computer.","Country M’s Mas was said to be a top hacker comparable to Sun.","It was too difficult for Qiao Nian to win against such a person.","Seeing that he was silent, Qin Si turned his head away and looked at the stage. He had gradually calmed down and was grabbing his hair in despair. “If only Sun was here.”","It was the best he could come up with.","Bo Jingxing’s eyes darkened as well. He stuffed his hands into his pockets, looking handsome and refined.","Yes, if only Qiao Nian was Sun.","On the competition stage.","Qiao Nian looked at the provocative red words that appeared on her computer screen.","She calmly cleaned up the other party’s trojan horse, not seeming the least bit affected."]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 Only Sister Nian’s Hand Speed Is the Slowest","paragraphs":["1418 Only Sister Nian’s Hand Speed Is the Slowest","On the other hand, Mas watched coldly as the girl deleted his trojan horse program. He sneered and revealed a rather disdainful expression. He whispered, “I thought the woman Aidan was afraid of had some real ability. I didn’t expect her to be a coward.”","He probably felt that Qiao Nian’s reaction was too boring, so he retracted his gaze and returned his attention to his computer.","This final was pure—it was about making software.","Software had always been divided into several levels. From the A-S level, each level was more powerful than the previous one. The most powerful was the legendary S-level software.","However, this kind of programming was very difficult. Mas himself was not confident that he could create an S-grade software in a short period of time.","Therefore, he prepared an A-grade software this time.","A-grade software was already very rare on the market. It was more than enough to win this competition.","He was very focused when he did things. At least, he was much more focused in private. In the blink of an eye, he focused all his energy on programming.","The camera focused on him.","Mas was focused, his face almost expressionless. His hand speed was especially fast, and his brows were covered with the pride of a top-notch IT expert.","The originally boisterous audience was shocked by his aura and fell silent.","Except for Mas, the camera turned to the contestant from Country H.","He looked much more amiable than Mas. His single eyelid was also fully focused on programming.","They could see that his hand speed was equally amazing. Ordinary people couldn’t compete with him, but he was still a little slower than Mas.","But he won by being sneaky.","While Mas was putting the trojan horse on Qiao Nian’s computer, he seized the opportunity and started programming early on. At this moment, he had already done quite a bit. At least 30% progress.","After the camera panned around, the only person who looked slow was Qiao Nian.","After she’d dealt with the trojan horse that Mas had implanted in her computer, she took her time turning on the programmer. Since she couldn’t use her right hand, she only used the left one to tap the keys on the keyboard, giving off a cynical vibe...","But she was very calm!","...","Offstage.","Qin Si looked around. Seeing Qiao Nian’s cap covering her chin and her unhurried attitude, he was so anxious that the veins on his forehead bulged again.","“Is Sister Qiao too slow?”","“Miss Qiao’s hand is injured, after all. She can only use one hand, and it’s her left hand that she doesn’t often use. It’s normal for her to be slower.” Zhang Yang looked up at the situation on the field.","The arena was changing, not to mention this kind of world-class professional competition.","He was afraid that in the blink of an eye, the situation would change again.","He was watching the competition so seriously. Of course, he saw that Qiao Nian’s hand speed couldn’t compare to the other two contestants.","Not to mention Mas, who had deliberately provoked her when the competition began, Qiao Nian’s hand speed couldn’t even compare to that person from Country H.","Things were not looking good.","How could Qin Si not know that Qiao Nian’s situation wasn’t good? He was as anxious as an ant on a hot pan, but there was nothing he could do. “... Even if Sister Qiao doesn’t get first place, I hope that that person, Park-something, gets first place. It’s better than Mas getting first place!”","“The competition isn’t over yet. Let’s wait and see.”","Bo Jingxing kept feeling that Qiao Nian’s condition was similar to when she was at the Ninth Branch. For some reason, he had a strange feeling that Qiao Nian would win.","Zhang Yang chimed in, “That’s right, Young Master Qin. The competition isn’t over yet. Let’s wait for the software to be developed first.”","Qin Si clenched his fists and locked his gaze on the arena. He couldn’t take this lying down."]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 Complete the Mission at the Last Second","paragraphs":["1419 Complete the Mission at the Last Second","This software competition was 40 minutes long.","The rules of the competition were that whoever made the highest-grade software within 40 minutes would win.","This kind of rule was simple and crude. It was precisely the rigor of such professional competitions.","Software competitions were not better than software. Could it be that they were better at playing games?","40 minutes passed in the blink of an eye.","Mas was the first to finish. A green light on his computer indicated to the judges that he had completed the software.","A gasp could be heard from the stands.","“It’s only been 32 minutes and he’s already done? He’s strong.”","“Looks like we’re up for grabs this year.”","As Mas completed the software first, the contestant from Country H also finished and the green light lit up.","He was a good five minutes behind Mas.","He took 37 minutes to complete the mission.","However, he was still three minutes ahead of the time limit. He was also considered strong.","There were a total of three people in the competition. Two of them had completed their mission in advance. The remaining cameras were all focused on one person—Qiao Nian.","The girl was still wearing a baseball cap with the brim lowered. She lowered her head and was completely unaffected by the outside world. She was completely focused on doing her own thing.","Her hand speed was not fast, but it was not slow either. It was just that her unhurried attitude made people anxious for her.","39 minutes 58 seconds.","39 minutes 59 seconds.","Everyone in the audience was worried for her. They were worried that Qiao Nian wouldn’t be able to finish the software in time.","In the ninth row.","Qiao Chen had been fidgeting. At this moment, a mocking smile appeared on her face. She said softly, “Don’t tell me Sister can’t finish it?”","Shen Qiongzhi snorted and said sarcastically, “That’s why I said that I don’t know what her biological father is thinking. She can’t use her right hand, yet she still wants to compete. It’s as if he wants her to lose face.”","Fu Ge said nothing. There was a hint of worry and disapproval on his handsome face. He frowned slightly and said nothing.","Time wouldn’t stop moving forward because of anyone.","As the second jumped forward, it jumped into the 12th scale.","40 minutes were up!","The girl finished just in time for the green light to come on in her place.","Qiao Nian completed the mission at the last second!","Everyone in the stands heaved a sigh of relief. At least she had completed her software.","Mas crossed his arms over his chest and smirked disdainfully when he saw the green light on the girl’s seat. Then, he looked away, as if he couldn’t be bothered to look at Qiao Nian.","Everyone’s software production was over. Next was the review.","The judges displayed it in order.","The contestant from Country H was up first according to age.","His software rating came up quickly.","Grade B.","This rating was not high, but it was definitely not low.","After all, A-grade software on the market could only be chanced upon by luck. In comparison, B-grade did not sound as impressive as A-grade software, but it was still pretty good.","Especially since he’d created the software within the allotted 40 minutes.","The International IT Association judges talked to each other and graded him, giving him a combined score of 86.35.","There was another lively discussion as soon as the score of the contestant from Country H appeared on the big screen.","“Wow, above 85. He’s very strong this year. He didn’t get as much attention as Aiden and Mas before the competition. Everyone didn’t think highly of him. In the end, his results were even better than the second place last year. He’s only one point away from last year’s champion.”","“That high? I wonder how many points Mas will get.”","The second score was for Mas.","Mas wasn’t as nervous. His expression was proud when dealing with the judges. He seemed very nonchalant."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 Total Suppression, S-Grade!","paragraphs":["1420 Total Suppression, S-Grade!","However, everyone was in an uproar when his software rating came out.","On the big screen, in bold red letters, was Mas’s software rating—Grade A.","“Damn, Grade A. This Mas is too strong!” Someone couldn’t help but sigh.","The others were also extremely nervous.","“I wonder what his final rating is.”","Soon, the judges gave Mas a combined score—93.5.","It was much higher than the contestant from Country H’s score.","This score was considered a rare high score in the history of software competitions. No one had ever scored so high.","Previously, the highest score given by the World Software Competition was only 91.3 points.","Mas’ results were enough to make history!","It wasn’t convenient for Qi Lanyin to show her face backstage. She had been hiding backstage to pay attention to the situation on the competition stage.","Her beautiful face revealed a happy expression upon seeing Mas’ score. “Aunt, Mas got 93.5 points. The first place will definitely be ours this time.”","The middle-aged woman beside her was wearing a slanted top hat. Under the wide brim of the hat, her face was charming. She was more feminine and charming than the inexperienced Qi Lanyin.","She only smiled faintly and said unhurriedly, “Don’t be anxious. Let’s wait and see.”","“Tsk, what’s there to see?”","Qi Lanyin felt that they would definitely win, especially since the first two scores were both high. If Qiao Nian’s score was very low, it would definitely be twice as embarrassing.","She felt extremely comfortable at the thought that Qiao Nian was about to experience the pain she had experienced previously. Refreshed, she said, “Qiao Nian barely managed to create the software at the last second. She can only get 60 points at most. It depends on whether the judges give the Ye family face!”","She was still talking.","The two people in front of the stage had already been given their final overall score. Only Qiao Nian was left.","The judges wasted no time.","This time, the results were slower than the previous two!","It took the IT Association five minutes to discuss Mas’ results, but it took them 10 minutes to discuss Qiao Nian’s results.","The audience gradually became restless.","No one was sure what the situation was.","Qiao Nian, on the other hand, was very calm. Her black hair flowed over her brow bone. She lowered her hat a little more to cover the slight swelling on her lips, revealing her fair and beautiful chin.","15 minutes passed.","The judges finally stopped communicating and each began to rate solemnly.","A minute later, Qiao Nian’s rating appeared on the big screen—S-grade!","“F*ck, S-grade?!”","“Am I seeing things?”","Qin Si was about to go crazy. He grabbed Zhang Yang’s collar and shook him hard. “Help me see if Sister Qiao is an S-grade!”","Zhang Yang almost vomited from the shaking. He endured the dizziness before he could confirm Qiao Nian’s results.","“It’s S. I saw it written on the big screen.” Zhang Yang said happily, “Miss Qiao’s software rating is S. Young Master Qin, you’re not seeing things. I also saw it.”","Qin Si’s mind went blank after a moment of excitement.","S-grade.","Qiao Nian’s software rating was one level higher than that person’s. He had never seen such a turnaround in the summit. He couldn’t help but mutter, “Damn, I was just saying that an A-grade is awesome. Did you see that? Sister Qiao is S-grade!”","Bo Jingxing also looked surprised. It was rare for him to take off his glasses. “Qiao Nian’s software is S-grade?”"]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 Sister Nian Will Tell You What a Face Slap is","paragraphs":["1421 Sister Nian Will Tell You What a Face Slap is","Creating an S-grade software in 40 minutes even when her right hand was injured and she could only use one hand.","Question: How terrifying is Qiao Nian?","...","On the competition stage.","Mas, who had been waiting for it to end so that he could go back, also saw Qiao Nian’s software rating given by the IT Association.","He thought for a moment that he was seeing things when the capital S appeared in front of him.","Astonishment, shock, dissatisfaction...","Too many emotions welled up at once.","His first reaction was: “Impossible!”","But he knew in his heart that the International IT Association would never side with anyone. They would only judge based on the real situation.","Since Qiao Nian had obtained an S grade, the software she created was an S grade.","Mas’ expression collapsed. He couldn’t accept this outcome.","One minute later.","Qiao Nian’s overall score was out—98.8.","Close to a god’s score.","She just put her hands in her pockets and looked at her results with dry eyes. She didn’t comment.","Well, it was one point short.","Honestly, she was a little obsessive.","However, she lowered her eyelashes. She had no objections to the result. She was still waiting for the judges to finish their scores.","Previously, when Mas’ score was released, it had already caused a heated discussion. After Qiao Nian’s score was released, she firmly suppressed him. The audience went crazy.","“98?”","“No, what 98? You’ve never learned to round it up. This one is clearly a 99.”","“99. What kind of score is that? Has there been such a high score in software competitions before?”","“Qiao Nian is too awesome.”","...","98.8.","Qiao Nian’s overall score was far higher than Mas’ score in his heart. He had never thought that after stepping on Country H’s contestant, Qiao Nian would step on him next.","All his confidence was crushed under her feet.","His insolence had vanished.","He was in a daze when the computer screen in front of him suddenly turned black.","Mas’ attention was drawn to it.","He saw that his computer, which had specially set up a defense system, had been successfully hacked by a virus. Immediately after, two Chinese words appeared on the screen.","Stupid!","Arrogant!","She was extremely arrogant!","The camera was already aimed at him and Qiao Nian.","Mas’ expression changed when he saw Chinese on the screen. He immediately operated the mouse to clean up the virus.","Who knew that everything he did was futile?","After the two Chinese words were slapped arrogantly, a string of English letters appeared on the computer interface and also on the big screen.","THE LOSER.","Loser.","Defeated!","The perfect comeback to Mas’ ‘Bronze Medalist’ before the game started.","This time, Mas’ expression turned extremely ugly. He realized that he couldn’t stop the other party’s virus from invading. With bloodshot eyes, he threw the mouse to the ground and suddenly looked in the girl’s direction. It must be Qiao Nian!","At the same time.","The girl happened to look at him at this moment. Her beautiful eyes met his gaze with undisguised arrogance.","Everyone at the scene, including the cameras, saw it clearly.","The girl slowly took her left hand out of her pocket. Under Mas’ extremely angry gaze, she made a throat-slitting gesture with her thumb.","She moved slowly, even a little too slowly.","But it was that calmness and arrogance that made her feel both good and relieved.","Qin Si also saw Qiao Nian’s handsome action. He was stunned for a moment, unable to recover from his daze. Then, he exclaimed, “Damn, Sister Qiao is too damn handsome!”","This was a slap in the face!","It was an interpretation of arrogance."]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 Cooking Qiao Chen","paragraphs":["1422 Cooking Qiao Chen","Compared to Qiao Nian, Mas’ provocative behavior seemed so childish and ridiculous. He was like a child who had yet to be weaned.","By the time Qiao Nian was done, Mas’ face was as black as the bottom of a pot. If the people around him hadn’t stopped him, he might have rushed up to fight Qiao Nian.","Unfortunately, no matter how agitated he was, Qiao Nian acted as if nothing had happened. After making the motion of slitting her throat, she grabbed her things and left the competition venue.","There was no doubt who was first in this World Software Competition!","...","In the audience, Qiao Chen stood up with a pale face and said to the stunned Shen Qiongzhi, “Mom, I’m not feeling well. Let’s go back.”","Shen Qiongzhi was originally shocked by Qiao Nian’s cool and valiant actions on stage. She barely regained her senses when Qiao Chen called out to her. She was still in a daze. “Ah, okay, okay.”","After Shen Qiongzhi recovered a little, she immediately asked with concern, “Chen Chen, what’s wrong? Are you feeling unwell?”","Qiao Chen avoided her gaze and shook her head. She was very weak and obedient. “There are too many people here. I’m just a little dizzy.”","“Mom, let’s go home.” She picked up her bag, feeling uneasy.","Fu Ge turned his head as well. “... going back now?”","Shen Qiongzhi frowned and supported Qiao Chen. She was very worried. “Chen Chen said that she’s dizzy. Let’s go back first.”","Fu Ge glanced at the stage. Qiao Nian was gone.","He looked at Qiao Chen’s pale face and pursed his lips. “I’ll get the car.”","“Okay.” Shen Qiongzhi was slightly relieved.","After all, Fu Ge was a member of the Fu family and had some say in Rao City. If Qiao Chen was really unwell, it would be easier to find a doctor with him around.","The three of them were about to grab their things and leave when the intersection of row nine was blocked.","Gu San was already waiting for them at the exit. Seeing the three of them picking up their things and about to leave, he smiled insincerely and said sarcastically, “Little Young Master Fu, where are you guys going?”","Fu Ge did not expect Gu San, who was not in position for the entire competition, to appear here. He didn’t react for a moment and then subconsciously replied, “My girlfriend is not feeling well. We’re preparing to go back. What... is the matter?”","“There’s something.” Gu San glanced at Qiao Chen, who was nervously clutching her bag. Seeing that the girl’s eyes were wandering, he sneered and said, “We found a very interesting surveillance footage backstage. We need Qiao Chen to go over and verify it.”","Qiao Chen trembled and her face turned pale.","Gu San made way for her and said calmly, “Miss Qiao, let’s go.”","Qiao Chen’s heart was in her throat. She had already grabbed Shen Qiongzhi’s arm in a panic and whispered, “Mom.”","Shen Qiongzhi immediately shielded her. She opened her mouth but did not speak.","Gu San looked over and covered her mouth. “I’m politely inviting you over now. If you’re unwilling, I’ll have to call security to ‘bring’ you over. You can choose.”","Fu Ge’s expression changed again and again. He pinched his palm and had no choice but to turn around. He said to Shen Qiongzhi in a low voice, “Aunt, let’s accompany Chen Chen.”","Shen Qiongzhi also knew that Gu San was from Beijing. She could only nod when she heard that. For a moment, she was not confident."]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 Sister Nian: Did I Say She Stole My Things?","paragraphs":["1423 Sister Nian: Did I Say She Stole My Things?","The organizers had especially paid attention to the privacy of the contestants. There were no surveillance cameras in the lounge, so she dared to steal.","Therefore, Qiao Chen did not panic when she saw the surveillance footage. She was still relatively calm.","“Chen Chen, didn’t you tell me you went to the washroom?” Fu Ge had also seen the surveillance footage.","Qiao Chen was standing in front of Qiao Nian’s lounge and knocking on the door.","Distracted, he questioned the girl hiding behind him. “Have you ever told me the truth?”","That was a bit harsh of an accusation!","Qiao Chen’s eyes turned red and watery. She looked extremely aggrieved. “I... I just don’t know how to tell you.”","Fu Ge frowned.","Qiao Chen clenched her fists again. She looked at him and said in humiliation, “I only wanted to reconcile with Qiao Nian. I didn’t mean anything else. I saw that she wasn’t in the lounge and went out. I didn’t do anything.”","Fu Ge didn’t know if he believed her. There was a moment of hesitation on his handsome face. In short, he did not ask her in front of Ye Wangchuan why she said that someone had stolen Qiao Nian’s hard drive.","He turned his head, his handsome face a little embarrassed. He looked at the girl who was sitting on the dressing table and said, “Qiao Nian, Chen Chen said that she didn’t touch your things...”","“Did I say that she touched my things?” Qiao Nian jumped down and stood still. She raised her hand and tugged at her cap. Her eyes were cold and impatient as she looked at him. “I don’t think I said anything the entire time. You guys were the ones talking.”","Fu Ge’s expression changed, and his expression became ugly. He clenched his hands, looking quite humiliated. “Isn’t that what you mean by calling Chen Chen over?”","“You’re a worm in my stomach. I didn’t even say anything, but you already know what I mean.” Qiao Nian glanced sideways at him.","“You!” Fu Ge’s fair face instantly turned red.","He didn’t dare to act rashly upon seeing Ye Wangchuan standing behind her.","However, Fu Ge clearly couldn’t take it anymore. He clenched his fists tightly, afraid that no one could tell that his expression was ugly.","Unfortunately, no one present cared about him.","Zhang Yang sneered and stood up. Seeing the three people who came in from behind, his friendly and easy-going face was filled with mockery. “Young Master Fu, you don’t have to be so agitated. Miss Qiao hasn’t even said that you stole anything, and you’re already helping your girlfriend deny it. This isn’t appropriate, right?”","Fu Ge’s face heated up. His expression changed, but he didn’t dare to flare up."]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 If Sister Nian Doesn’t Let You Go, Who Can Go?","paragraphs":["1424 If Sister Nian Doesn’t Let You Go, Who Can Go?","Qin Si stood beside Zhang Yang with his arms crossed and said coldly, “Aren’t thieves all like this?”","In a few words, they pinned the blame on Qiao Chen.","Shen Qiongzhi’s face turned green. She flung her hand away and stood in front of Qiao Chen, glaring at Qiao Nian. She lowered her voice and asked angrily, “Qiao Nian, why did you call us out?!","“If you just want your friend to humiliate Chen Chen, then we don’t have time to play with you!","“We’re leaving.”","Then, she pulled Qiao Chen away.","“Wait a minute.”","The girl’s dark eyes narrowed. Her gaze was quite dry as she called out lazily.","Gu San immediately blocked Shen Qiongzhi and Qiao Chen’s way.","He was 1.8 meters tall and exuded a powerful aura. His square face looked tough compared to Ye Wangchuan and the others.","At this moment, he glanced down at Shen Qiongzhi and said indifferently, “Madam Qiao, I’m sorry, you can’t leave yet.”","Shen Qiongzhi really couldn’t get out with Gu San blocking the way!","“...” She turned around abruptly and glared at Qiao Nian. Her eyes looked like they wanted to tear her apart.","She was like an angry lioness, standing in front of Qiao Chen to protect her. “Chen Chen only went to your lounge to look for you. So many people went to your lounge. Why are you only targeting her?”","“I lost my hard drive. Only she went in after I left, and she didn’t come out for three minutes. No one else went in there until I went back.”","Shen Qiongzhi was flustered. She was not confident, but she pretended to be calm and said sternly, “Just because you lost your hard drive doesn’t mean that Chen Chen must have taken it. What if you lost it yourself?”","“Whether she took the hard disk or not, we’ll know after we investigate it.”","Qiao Nian picked up an alcohol spray bottle from the table and approached Qiao Chen. Then, she said with an indifferent gaze, “I applied potassium permanganate on the hard drive. Do you know that potassium permanganate changes color when it encounters alcohol?”","Qiao Chen’s expression suddenly changed. She paled, and her pupils trembled violently. She suddenly hid behind Shen Qiongzhi.","“Didn’t you say that you were innocent?” Qiao Nian walked over and stood in front of her. She handed over the alcohol spray and looked at her. The corners of her lips curled up slightly. “Try it?”","Qin Si didn’t know that Qiao Nian had fiddled with the hard drive. He was stunned for a moment before he reacted. He immediately bared his teeth and grinned. “That’s right. Didn’t you say that you didn’t steal anything? This is a chance to prove it. Why are you hesitating? Try it!”","How could Qiao Chen dare to try?!","Her mind went blank. In her extreme fear and panic, even her lips were pale. The tips of her fingers were cold.","Qiao Nian handed her the alcohol spray.","Qiao Chen looked up at her with a pale face, as if trying to read her.","However, Qiao Nian’s expression was as indifferent and irritable as ever. She couldn’t tell anything, and she didn’t know if the other party was serious.","Suddenly.","Fu Ge frowned and his eyes darkened. He said in a low voice, “Chen Chen, since you haven’t stolen it, there’s no harm in trying. Try it.”","“I...” Qiao Chen didn’t expect him to say that. For a moment, she was flustered and afraid. Her eyes kept flickering, avoiding everyone’s gaze.","Suddenly, Qiao Chen saw a cup of hot tea on the table not far away from the corner of her eye. It should be the cup of a security guard.","A sudden thought occurred to her."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 Qiao Chen ’Accidentally’ Hurt Her Hand","paragraphs":["1425 Qiao Chen ‘Accidentally’ Hurt Her Hand","Qiao Chen gritted her teeth and looked up. She composed herself and looked at Qiao Nian. “I didn’t take your things.”","“Try it, then.” Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows noncommittally, looking quite cool.","Qiao Chen looked at her hand holding the spray and gritted her teeth. Her beautiful eyes flashed and she said, “Since you don’t believe me, I can try... but if it wasn’t me, you have to apologize to me.”","Qiao Nian clicked her tongue, her eyes frivolous. She looked at her teasingly, as if waiting for her next performance.","Qiao Chen took a deep breath and hesitated for a long time before walking over slowly. She reached out to take the spray from Qiao Nian’s hand.","That was when the accident happened.","Qiao Chen stumbled and seemed to have lost her balance. She accidentally tripped and fell to the side.","Qiao Chen ‘panicked’ and grabbed to the side. The iron porcelain teacup on the table was suddenly overturned and the boiling tea inside poured onto the back of her hand.","Qiao Chen cried out in pain and covered her hand. She had already fallen to the ground.","“Chen Chen!” Shen Qiongzhi was shocked and quickly ran over to help her stand up. Her heart ached when she saw that Qiao Chen’s right hand was covered in blisters from the hot tea.","She quickly blew on it. “Why are you so careless? Does it hurt?”","Qiao Chen’s face was pale from the pain. Tears quickly gathered in her eyes, but she still shook her head stubbornly and comforted her. “Mom, I’m fine.”","The more she acted like this, the more Shen Qiongzhi’s heart ached.","“How can you say you’re okay when your hand is burned like that! No, Mom will take you to the hospital immediately.”","Her heart was filled with thoughts of Qiao Chen’s scalded hand. She turned her head and said to Qiao Nian domineeringly, “Are you done fooling around? I don’t care who stole your hard drive or whether it was your sister. Enough is enough. I’m going to take your sister to the hospital. Get your men to move aside!”","Her attitude was undeniably nasty.","Qin Si’s originally friendly expression instantly turned cold.","Who did Shen Qiongzhi think she was?","How ignorant must she be to dare to criticize Qiao Nian on this occasion!","Qiao Nian had a good temper. Seeing that Qiao Chen had ‘accidentally’ scalded her right hand with the hot tea, she slowly placed the alcohol spray on the table beside her.","She picked up a wet tissue and wiped her fingers clean. Then, Qiao Nian threw the wet tissue into the trash can and looked up at the girl, who was in so much pain that tears were about to fall from her eyes. She sneered. “Qiao Chen, you believed me when I said that the hard drive was coated with potassium permanganate?”","The cup of hot tea had been splashed on the back of Qiao Chen’s hand. At this moment, the skin was so scalded that she wanted to scream. She looked up in disbelief when Qiao Nian said that. “What do you mean?”","Qiao Chen wasn’t stupid. She had already guessed the truth.","“You lied to me? You didn’t even put anything on it. You just bluffed me?”","Qiao Chen’s face turned pale as if it was about to disappear when she realized this.","She almost died of humiliation when she realized that she had once again been played like a monkey by the other party.","Her mind went blank. The string in her nerve was so tight it almost snapped.","Qin Si also looked like he had seen a ghost and couldn’t react. “Sister Qiao, you didn’t do anything to the hard drive?”","“No.” Qiao Nian nodded, admitting it readily. “I’m not a god. I prepared two hard drives in advance just in case, but I didn’t expect anyone to really court death.”"]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 The Scum Was Broken by Sister Nian!","paragraphs":["1426 The Scum Was Broken by Sister Nian!","Qin Si: “...”","Then, why did you just say that you smeared something on the hard drive?!","Not only Qiao Chen, but Qin Si, Bo Jingxing, Zhang Yang, and the others also didn’t expect Qiao Nian to do this.","They all believed that Qiao Nian had smeared the chemical reagent on the hard drive.","Who knew that she was just joking?","The entire room was silent. Even Ye Wangchuan looked surprised. He glanced at the girl’s figure and then looked away. His thin face was half-closed, revealing some interest.","Wasn’t she afraid that she would ruin Qiao Chen?","...","Qiao Chen was indeed ruined.","The skin on the back of her right hand hurt so much that she couldn’t think straight. But none of this could compare to the humiliation Qiao Nian had brought her.","Her not-so-pale face turned the color of a pig’s liver. She held her breath for a long time before saying, “You...”","Qiao Nian ignored her. Her eyes were cold as they met hers and she said sharply, “Qiao Chen, you haven’t had time to deal with the hard drive you stole, have you?”","Qiao Chen’s blood instantly turned cold. She tried her best to avoid eye contact again. “I told you, I didn’t take anything from you!","“I went in to find you because I wanted to make peace. I came out when I found out you weren’t inside.”","She seemed to have found her backbone and was a little less nervous. “As for why I was in there for three minutes, that was because I was waiting for you. I thought you’d be back soon. I went out later when I saw you hadn’t returned.","“That’s what happened. It’s not like what you think.” Qiao Chen took a deep breath and continued, “No matter how much I hate you, I know that you’re representing the country in this competition. I can’t take your hard drive on purpose. If you lose face, we’ll lose face with you. I understand this.”","“Pfft.” Qiao Nian chuckled. Her dry eyes stared at her as she returned to her seat. She didn’t listen to Qiao Chen’s nonsense at all and continued, “Time was too tight, you shouldn’t have been able to find a chance to deal with the stolen hard drive. You’re afraid that I’ll find it, but you don’t want to throw it in the trash can nearby... Let me guess where you’ve hidden it?”","Qiao Chen’s heart raced and was about to rush out of her throat. “I told you, I didn’t steal anything from you.”","“In the bag?”","Qiao Chen clenched her fists nervously, but her expression was still calm. She took the initiative to open her bag. “You can check if you don’t believe me.”","Qiao Nian looked her up and down. The satchel she had brought today was especially small and could only fit one phone. “That’s not right. Your bag can’t fit the hard drive. Besides, with your personality, you wouldn’t be so stupid as to put something you stole in your bag.”","Qiao Chen was about to go crazy from her torture. Her beautiful face turned pale. She tightened her grip on her bag and looked up. “Qiao Nian, what do you want? I told you, I didn’t take anything from you—”","Qiao Nian’s gaze landed on Shen Qiongzhi’s handbag before Qiao Chen could finish speaking. She said to the security guard, “Help me check if there’s a hard drive in that bag.”","“Okay, Miss Qiao.”","The tall security guard received Qiao Nian’s order and was about to snatch the bag from Shen Qiongzhi.","Qiao Chen’s expression changed. She cared more about Shen Qiongzhi’s bag than her own bag. She ignored her scalded right hand and wanted to snatch it. “What are you doing? Get lost!”"]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 She’s Just a Child!","paragraphs":["1427 She’s Just a Child!","She turned her head again and glared at Qiao Nian angrily. “Qiao Nian, you’re crazy. Even if you found your biological parents, you’ve called her Mother for 18 years. Is this how you treat your elders?”","Qiao Chen pushed a security guard away as she spoke.","“Who are you? Get lost.”","However, she was usually spoiled by Shen Qiongzhi. When everyone gave in to her, she could still kick up a fuss. When no one gave in to her, she was actually nothing!","As expected.","The tall and strong security guard quickly snatched the bag from Shen Qiongzhi’s hand, unzipped it, and poured out the contents.","A black hard drive fell out of the bag and clattered to the floor.","The security room was silent for a moment.","Shen Qiongzhi turned her neck stiffly and looked at Qiao Chen in shock. “Chen Chen, you... you really stole it?”","Qiao Chen’s mind buzzed, and she let go of the security guard’s hand. Her face was pale, and she didn’t know where to put her hands.","“I...”","Everyone was looking at her.","Qiao Chen seemed to be wrapped in endless darkness. Her eyelashes trembled. She stood there and looked at Shen Qiongzhi in confusion before looking at Fu Ge.","Fu Ge and Shen Qiongzhi looked at her in shock.","He looked at her as if he had only met her today!","Qiao Chen’s heart was burned by his gaze. Her heart seemed to be grabbed by an invisible hand, and it was beating very fast.","“I...”","Qiao Chen bit her lip, leaving a bite mark on her pink lips.","She clenched her fists tightly, then turned to look at Qiao Nian, who was supporting her chin with her uninjured hand, as if she had already seen through her.","Her jealousy was like a demon that had been released. It had finally driven her crazy!","Qiao Chen stared at Qiao Nian’s enviable face and admitted her actions through gritted teeth. “That’s right. So what if I took your hard drive?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, surprised that Qiao Chen would take the initiative to admit it.","However, Qiao Chen seemed to be holding it in. She spoke quickly and anxiously, “I didn’t want to take your things. You didn’t lock the door yourself. I knocked on the door and realized that no one was there. That’s why I was tempted to take the hard drive.","“Qiao Nian, you won’t lose anything even if I take your hard drive. You still got first place and are in the limelight... You’ve already achieved your goal. What else do you want?”","“F*ck!”","Qin Si coughed. He spat out the cigarette in his mouth, stepped on it, and cursed.","“According to you, you’re justified in stealing?”","Qiao Chen knew that his status in Beijing was extraordinary, so she normally did not dare to provoke him.","However, Qiao Chen couldn’t remain calm under such circumstances. She said coldly, “I don’t mean that. What I mean is that she has already prepared two hard drives. Even if I take one, doesn’t she still have another? She won’t lose anything if I take this hard drive...”","Shen Qiongzhi had already recovered from her initial shock. She hurriedly pulled her back and shielded her. She looked at the girl in the middle of the crowd with a troubled expression and said with difficulty, “Qiao Nian, Chen Chen is still young. She’s just a child.”","“Heh, still a child at 18?” Gu San sneered. “What a big child.”","“You...” Shen Qiongzhi blushed from his sarcasm, but she did not dare to retort."]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 Qiao Chen Is Finished","paragraphs":["1428 Qiao Chen Is Finished","All her attention was on Qiao Nian, because she knew that Qiao Nian was the only one who could take this matter lightly.","She looked urgently at the girl. For the first time, she showed the gentle side of a mother and spoke softly.","“Qiao Nian, she was in the wrong. I apologize. Can you not haggle over it with her?”","Shen Qiongzhi turned to Fu Ge and said anxiously after she finished speaking, “Young Master Fu, say a few words on Chen Chen’s behalf.","“You know what Chen Chen is like. She was just confused for a moment. I’ll definitely educate her when I get back. You’re Chen Chen’s boyfriend. Speak up for her.”","Fu Ge’s was as stiff as a rock, and he couldn’t move. He hesitated for a moment, but in the end, he only said one sentence. “Auntie, if Qiao Nian hadn’t prepared a spare hard drive in advance, do you know what the consequences of Qiao Chen’s actions would have been?”","Qiao Nian would embarrass herself and lose the competition!","But the problem was that Qiao Nian wasn’t standing on the stage alone. She was representing the country!","“She’s gone too far this time. I can’t speak for her.” Fu Ge looked away, his voice low and firm.","Shen Qiongzhi looked desperate. She didn’t understand his ruthlessness.","In her eyes, Qiao Chen was just a child. She should be forgiven even if she did something wrong.","Ye Wangchuan stood up and walked over to the girl. He asked her softly, “What are you going to do with her?”","Who he meant went without saying.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t even bother to call Qiao Chen by her name. He just used ‘her’ instead.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were dry, mainly because Shen Qiongzhi was making her head hurt. However, she didn’t hesitate. She simply said, “There’s nothing to do. Call the police and let them handle it.”","“Call the police?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows, and a hint of surprise appeared on his face. He hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to make such a decision.","“... aren’t you going too easy on her?”","What he meant was that he could make Qiao Chen suffer worse than going to jail.","However, Qiao Nian tugged at her cap and shook her head. Her eyes were cold and dry, and her voice was hoarse. “You don’t know Qiao Chen. Calling the police is enough for her.”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t want to let the other party off so easily. At the very least, he wanted to cripple Qiao Chen’s hand. However, he respected Qiao Nian’s decision.","He immediately looked at Gu San and instructed him in a deep voice, “Call the police.”","“Alright, Master Wang.” Gu San was far away. In fact, he could vaguely hear the two of them talking, but he didn’t hear what Qiao Nian said to Ye Wangchuan.","But he felt that this was the best way to deal with it.","Gu San immediately picked up his phone and made a call.","“Hello, Officer Cai...”","...","Of course, Qiao Chen heard Ye Wangchuan and Gu San calling the police.","She hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to do this. She was stunned for a second before reacting, her fair face pale with fear.","Shen Qiongzhi was also frightened. She shouted, “Qiao Nian, what are you doing?! Why did you call the police...”","She wanted to rush over and argue with Qiao Nian.","However, Ye Wangchuan blocked her path.","His cold eyes narrowed slightly, and his voice was soothing and deep. “Madam Qiao, if you take another step forward, I guarantee that Qiao Chen’s outcome will be even worse.”","There was some silence.","Shen Qiongzhi did not dare to act rashly again."]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 Master Wang: Five or Six Years Is No Problem","paragraphs":["1429 Master Wang: Five or Six Years Is No Problem","Shen Qiongzhi’s reddened with anger even if she didn’t dare to do anything.","She also raised her finger and pointed at Qiao Nian, her voice trembling with excitement. “You, you, Qiao Nian, Chen Chen is your sister! How can you call the police on her... Do you know that she’s still on probation? She’ll be locked up if you call the police. You’ll cause her to go to jail. How can you be so ruthless...”","Qiao Chen was the one in the wrong from the beginning to the end, but Shen Qiongzhi always acted as if Qiao Nian was the one in the wrong.","Qin Si and the others were furious.","Fu Ge couldn’t stand it anymore. His lips moved, but he couldn’t speak because of his status.","“Chen Chen grew up with you. You ate our Qiao family’s food. We were the ones who brought you out of the orphanage. Qiao Nian, I order you to get your men to tell the police that it was a mistake. I, I won’t let you off if Chen Chen goes to jail!”","Shen Qiongzhi was anxious. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have said such brainless words.","However, she was always like this when it came to Qiao Chen.","Qiao Nian’s black hair flowed over her brow bone. For a moment, her eyes flickered, and a frustrated aura seemed to envelop her.","Hearing Shen Qiongzhi’s exasperated accusation, she calmly pulled the zipper of her sweater to her neck, revealing her cold chin.","“You’re giving me an order?”","Shen Qiongzhi suddenly felt a little suffocated. Her hot blood cooled, and she stuttered. “I...”","Qiao Nian looked at her with dark eyes. “What are you going to use to order me around?”","Shen Qiongzhi’s old face almost turned red.","Humiliation and embarrassment.","A smile appeared on Qiao Nian’s pretty face, as if she felt that it was meaningless to argue with her anymore. Her eyes revealed her loathing as she looked at Shen Qiongzhi. “I didn’t put Qiao Chen in jail. She put herself in jail.”","She had given the Qiao family and Qiao Chen countless chances.","They were the ones who dug their own graves.","Qiao Chen couldn’t blame anyone for getting to where she was today.","She could only blame herself!","“I did prepare two hard drives, but I didn’t ask her to steal one. She stole it herself, admitted it herself, and the police are looking for her now. Is it my problem?”","Shen Qiongzhi felt as if someone was strangling herself, and she couldn’t say a word.","Ye Wangchuan grabbed the girl’s wrist at this moment and felt that it was slightly cold. He gently calmed the girl down and said in a low voice, “Alright, leave this to me. Go out with Qin Si and the others and wait for me.”","The temperature of his palm was high, pulling Qiao Nian out of her frustration.","She pressed a hand to her brow, then realized she was having trouble controlling her emotions. Thus, she didn’t refuse. She jumped off the makeup table and said, “I’ll wait for you outside.”","“Okay.”","Ye Wangchuan was worried about her and reminded Qin Si before watching them leave.","After Qin Si and Qiao Nian left...","He returned to his chair and found a box of cigarettes in his pocket. He poured out a cigarette, lowered his head, bit it, and lit it. Then, he looked up at Shen Qiongzhi and Qiao Chen and said indifferently, “Tell me, how many years do you want to be sentenced to?","“A three-year reprieve. If you count off the crimes, you could go in for five or six years.”","Qiao Chen felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her eyes widened in disbelief and her vision darkened. She swayed and almost fell to the ground.","“Chen Chen.” Shen Qiongzhi quickly supported her.","Qiao Chen’s face was pale, and her mind was buzzing."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 Qiao Chen Was Taken Away by the Police","paragraphs":["1430 Qiao Chen Was Taken Away by the Police","Ye Wangchuan’s voice sounded low and slow. “Actually, in the beginning, you didn’t think that you were smart enough to chase Qiao Nian out. With her personality, even if you didn’t do anything, you could have gone on smoothly in Rao City. Even if you went to Beijing, with her around, you wouldn’t have suffered a loss. Unfortunately, you insisted on courting death. You pushed her away step by step...”","He looked at the pale girl and smiled, his eyes scornful and mocking. “You think she’ll lose because you stole her hard drive?”","“...” Qiao Chen pinched her palms until they were about to tear.","Yes, she had stolen the hard disk because she wanted to see Qiao Nian fall from the clouds.","It was just bad luck this time!","But she had no regrets.","If she had been luckier and Qiao Nian hadn’t prepared a backup hard drive, she might have succeeded long ago. At this moment, she should be the one laughing in the end!","Ye Wangchuan could tell the answer from her expression. His eyes darkened as he said, “Qiao Chen, let me tell you, you wouldn’t have succeeded even if she didn’t prepare a spare hard drive today.","“Because...”","Nobody else heard what he said.","When Qiao Chen heard that, her expression changed drastically. She couldn’t take it anymore. Her legs went weak and she sat on the cold ground. “How is that possible?”","Her pretty face finally looked desperate.","...","The police quickly came over and took Qiao Chen away.","Shen Qiongzhi beat and scolded the police. She even sat on the ground and threw a tantrum, but she couldn’t stop the police from handcuffing Qiao Chen and taking her away.","She also realized that Qiao Nian wouldn’t let Qiao Chen off this time. She watched as Qiao Chen was escorted into the police car in a daze.","Shen Qiongzhi couldn’t care less. She took a taxi back anxiously and prepared to ask her younger brother, Shen Jingyan, for help.","...","Meanwhile...","After Qiao Nian left the security office, Qin Si scratched his head and thought for a long time. Then, he followed her and asked, “Sister Qiao, what do you want to eat for lunch? Hot pot?”","Qin Si recalled that Qiao Nian liked spicy food, or rather, she loved spicy food. He scratched his head and tried his best to find a topic to divert her attention.","“Is there any delicious hotpot restaurant in Rao City? Let’s eat together this afternoon. My treat. It’s a good opportunity to celebrate your first place in the software competition!”","At the mention of this, most of the gloominess in everyone’s hearts was swept away.","Bo Jingxing also said politely, “Speaking of which, I haven’t congratulated you yet. Congratulations, Miss Qiao.”","“That’s right, Miss Qiao. Congratulations.” Zhang Yang had always been smart. He quickly said, “Young Master Qin, don’t snatch this chance from me. You must give me a chance to treat Miss Qiao this time. I’ve already told Miss Qiao several times that I want to treat her to a meal, but I’ve never had a suitable opportunity. You have to give me this chance no matter what. I...”","However, before he could finish speaking...","Qiao Nian received a call from Liang Conglin. He also wanted to treat her to lunch. He roughly meant that the IT Association was holding a small celebration party for her at noon and asked if she wanted to go.","Qiao Nian looked up and saw Qiao Chen being escorted to the police car. The door was closed and the police car drove away.","She stopped in her tracks and replied unhurriedly, “Noon? I won’t be going. I’ll return to Beijing in the afternoon. I’ll just find something to eat. Principal Liang, you guys enjoy yourselves.”","Liang Conglin said a few more words to her. Qiao Nian nodded patiently and hung up.","Qin Si waited for her to finish the call and then immediately asked, “Sister Qiao, are you going back in the afternoon?”"]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 The Person Aiden Is Looking For Is Qiao Nian","paragraphs":["1431 The Person Aiden Is Looking For Is Qiao Nian","Qiao Nian put down her phone and lowered her eyes. “Yes, I’ve already finished my work in Rao City. There’s nothing to do if I stay. I might as well go back.”","Qin Si thought so and immediately said, “Alright, I’ll go back with you.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and was about to say, “No need...”","Qin Si immediately smiled and said, “Sister Qiao, it’s settled then. We’ll go back together in the afternoon. Anyway, we came over to cheer you on. It’s meaningless for us to stay since you’re going back. Why don’t we go back together?”","Zhang Yang took out his phone and said eagerly, “I’ll book a flight.”","In a few words, they decided to leave together. Qiao Nian had no choice. Actually, she was more inclined to go back by herself.","There were too many people, especially Qin Si.","She could imagine the noise around her ears on the way back.","However, Zhang Yang had already called to book a plane ticket. She frowned and put her phone back without saying anything else.","“Done.”","Zhang Yang booked all their tickets in less than five minutes. He had a smile on his handsome face and was very amiable. “Young Master Qin, Miss Qiao, I booked a flight at four in the afternoon. It’s noon now. Let’s eat something and go over slowly. The time is very suitable.”","He was the most inconspicuous person in the small circle, if not for him being smart enough to get close to Qin Si.","With Zhang Yang’s identity and background, he would definitely not be able to enter this small circle.","Even so, Zhang Yang’s family background was one of the best outside. He could settle something as simple as booking a plane ticket with a phone call.","If not for the fact that Qiao Nian was usually too low-key, getting a private jet wouldn’t be a problem for him.","After Zhang Yang booked the tickets, he put down his phone and asked her, “Miss Qiao, at noon...”","However, before he could finish speaking.","20 meters straight ahead, a tall man walked towards them.","Zhang Yang’s attention was immediately attracted to that person.","The blond man looked very young. His handsome face was exceptionally attractive under his curly blond hair, and his skin was also fair.","At first glance, he felt that he had seen this face somewhere before.","Zhang Yang could not remember where he had seen her before.","He was puzzled when he suddenly heard Qin Si’s surprised voice. “Aiden? Didn’t he withdraw from the competition? Why is he here?”","“Aiden?” Zhang Yang tilted his head and said with a puzzled expression, “Young Master Qin, are you talking about the contestant from Country D who withdrew from the competition?”","Qin Si was still puzzled. “Ah, who else could it be? I thought he quit early because of an emergency. I didn’t expect him to still be in Rao City... Then, why did he quit?”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. No one noticed that she had raised her hand to pull down the brim of her cap, lowering it even further.","Very low-key.","It was obvious she didn’t want to be noticed.","“Who is he looking for?” Bo Jingxing crossed his arms and pushed his gold-rimmed glasses up his nose. He glanced at the three of them and asked in a low voice, “Do any of you know him? I think he’s here for us.”","Gu San, Qin Si, and Zhang Yang were all dumbfounded.","Who the f*ck knew him!","When Bo Jingxing saw that the three of them were shaking their heads like idiots, his gaze couldn’t help but fall on the girl whose cap was lowered and had one hand in her pocket. Just her side profile was quite cool.","He had the answer in his heart.","The person Aiden was looking for was—Qiao Nian."]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 Isn’t Sun Right by Your Side?","paragraphs":["1432 Isn’t Sun Right by Your Side?","As expected.","The blond young man stopped in front of them. His fair and handsome face couldn’t hide his excitement and respect. He handed Qiao Nian the bouquet of flowers when he saw her.","“S...”","He almost let it slip again. Fortunately, he was quick on the uptake. Aiden caught himself, and his refined face changed. He corrected himself immediately.","“Miss Qiao, congratulations on winning first place in the competition.","“This bouquet is for you.”","He pushed the bouquet towards Qiao Nian.","“I prepared this in advance. I knew you would definitely win the competition!”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","What she was really afraid of was coming???","Her eyes were especially irritable. Under the gazes of Qin Si and the others, she silently reached out to take the bouquet. “Thank you.”","Aiden’s eyes sparkled at the sight of her accepting the bouquet he’d prepared, and his reaction was extraordinary. He waved his hands in a quick gesture. “It’s my honor.”","His reaction was as if Qiao Nian accepting his flowers was his greatest honor.","However, the problem was that he was definitely at the top of the pyramid in the IT field. Otherwise, the State Councilor of Country D would not have spent so much effort inviting him to the competition.","Such a person actually restrained his arrogance in front of Qiao Nian. He lowered his head and looked very respectful.","Qin Si couldn’t hold it in anymore. He looked at Aiden, then at Qiao Nian. “Sister Qiao, do you know each other?”","Qiao Nian wanted to say that she didn’t know him, but Aiden beat her to it. “No, no, we don’t. I just admire Miss Qiao’s performance on the field and want to get to know her.”","“Oh.” Qin Si was actually still a little puzzled, but he had never been the type to think too much. He muttered to himself, “I thought you two knew each other.”","Aiden immediately expressed that he didn’t know Qiao Nian before.","Qin Si stopped thinking and looked at him. He seemed to have thought of something and suddenly became interested. “I heard that you’re a member of the Red Alliance?”","Red Alliance.","Aiden couldn’t hide his pride. “Yes.”","Looking at Qiao Nian, he retracted his pride and explained in a low-key manner, “But I’m only one of the overseas members now.”","He was a member of the overseas branch of the Red Alliance and the illegal district.","The members of the headquarters were the Red Alliance’s backbone. He wasn’t qualified to be selected to enter the illegal district yet.","“The overseas members are already very impressive.”","Qin Si pondered and said, “Um, can you help me make an appointment with Sun? I want to treat ‘him’ to a meal. You can help me pass a message to ‘him’.”","He was still thinking about the last time Sun had helped them locate their location. He was abnormally obsessed with treating Sun to a meal.","Aiden looked at him strangely. He stole a few glances at Qiao Nian before saying softly, “Well, it’s not convenient for me to make an appointment for you. If you want to have a meal with Sun, you can ask her yourself.”","Qin Si was about to say, “If I could know ‘him’, why would I ask you to help me pass the message?” when Qiao Nian interrupted them. She raised her eyelids and said roguishly, “I’m hungry. Let’s go eat.”","Although Qin Si was unwilling to give up, he saw that Qiao Nian was hungry.","He still reluctantly waved Aiden off and took small strides to keep up with the girl.","It was Aiden who stood his ground and waited until they were gone before daring to scratch his head. “He doesn’t know that Sun is beside him?” he asked incredulously.","...","In Beijing.","Jiang Zongnan had just hung up on Shen Jingyan. He rubbed his temples and talked to Tang Wanru with a headache. “The Shen family called and said that Qiao Chen has been taken away by the police. They asked me to plead with Nian Nian.”"]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 Just Time to Remove Her Bad Luck","paragraphs":["1433 Just Time to Remove Her Bad Luck","Tang Wanru was wearing a scarf, and her dignified face was expressionless. Only when she heard Qiao Nian’s name did she frown slightly.","He asked Jiang Zongnan, “Hubby, did you agree?”","Jiang Zongnan placed his phone on the table and straightened his back. He answered her without thinking, “How could I agree? Last time, I was in a mess with my father and the others because of these matters. It’s fine with Zhu Yuanhao, but the Qiao family doesn’t know us. How could I speak up for her?”","A trace of coldness flashed across Tang Wanru’s eyes. “That’s true.”","“Nian Nian has tolerated the Qiao family for a long time. This time, she let the police take Qiao Chen away. It’s definitely because Qiao Chen did something that she couldn’t tolerate.”","Jiang Zongnan sighed. “No matter what, I can’t speak up for outsiders.”","Therefore, he rejected Shen Jingyan and said that he wouldn’t get involved in this matter.","Shen Jingyan was not very happy.","However, the Jiang family didn’t have much contact with the Shen family. Whether the other party was happy or not had nothing to do with him.","Just as Jiang Zongnan was thinking this, he heard Tang Wanru say, “Xianrou has entered the Pharmacy Association this time and acknowledged the Countess as her godmother. I want to properly organize this banquet.”","“What do you think about us setting the table at the Imperial Mansion?”","Previously, at Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet, Old Master Jiang had set up a few tables for Qiao Nian in the Imperial Mansion.","Tang Wanru didn’t want her daughter’s filiation banquet to be lower than this.","At the very least, it had to be on the same level as Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet. Only then would she feel better.","Otherwise, just the thought of Qiao Nian being lucky enough to win first place in the software competition made her feel uncomfortable.","“It’s also a joyous occasion for Xianrou to acknowledge the Countess as her godmother. To our family, the benefits outweigh the disadvantages. I want to organize it well.”","Tang Wanru took the tie from the servant and carefully tied it for him. She then patted the tie knot and smiled.","“A lot has happened to Xianrou recently. It’s rare for something good to happen. I still hope to get rid of her bad luck.”","She said “get rid of her bad luck” very clearly.","She was just short of saying that “Qiao Nian” was their family’s bad luck.","Jiang Zongnan frowned and glanced at her.","Tang Wanru didn’t back down. It was as if what she said just now was not directed at anyone.","“And putting aside the matter of Xianrou acknowledging her godmother, it’s a good thing that she was able to enter the Pharmacy Association successfully this time.","“You also know the Pharmacy Association’s status in the medical world. She was chosen by the Pharmacy Association to be one of them. It’s much better than learning from Liang Lu. It can be considered a glory for the family.”","Tang Wanru restrained the light in her eyes and handed Jiang Zongnan his briefcase, then said softly, “Jiang Yao is in Tian Chen, and Xianrou has also entered the Pharmacy Association. Apart from Jiang Li, the three children at home are all very hardworking.","“As parents, if nothing else, it’s not too much to throw her a filiation banquet. Zongnan, don’t you think so?”","Jiang Zongnan took the briefcase from her. After thinking for a moment, he said, “It’s not that I don’t want to hold a filiation banquet for her. We definitely have to hold this filiation banquet. It’s just that who we invite to attend is a problem. We need time to prepare.”","Tang Wanru had already expected him to say that.","“I’ve thought about it. We’ll definitely have to invite our relatives to Xianrou’s filiation banquet. Great Aunt’s family will definitely have to be invited. As for the rest, we’ll invite some of your business partners. Jiang Yao can invite Young Master Xu. In addition, I know some friends. Xianrou has friends to invite herself. I’ll ask her when the time comes.”"]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 Not Planning to Invite Sister Nian and the Others","paragraphs":["1434 Not Planning to Invite Sister Nian and the Others","She didn’t mention Jiang Li, mainly because she didn’t think he knew anyone presentable.","The entertainment industry was a big dye vat.","Those glamorous stars outside would only make a fool of themselves in their circle.","Jiang Xianrou’s filiation banquet this time was of extremely high standards. She would never let Jiang Li call these people to join in the fun.","The only one left was Jiang Yao’s friend, Xu Jishen.","Xu Jishen’s identity was enough.","The other party was on good terms with Jiang Yao. If Jiang Yao invited him, he would most likely come.","Tang Wanru had already calculated a rough list in her heart. At this moment, she was just mentioning it to Jiang Zongnan.","Jiang Zongnan remained silent for a long time before asking slowly, “What about my father and brother? Are you calling them?”","Tang Wanru’s dignified and elegant face froze. She frowned and adjusted her scarf before saying, “We definitely have to call Dad. I’ll get the chauffeur to pick him up from the sanatorium as long as Dad is willing to come.”","Tang Wanru said bluntly, “But you also know Big Brother. We split up with them. We even fell out with each other when we split up. Later on, Xianrou was even chased out of the family tree in a fit of anger because of their family matters.","“No matter what, this is a joyous occasion for Xianrou. It’s not that I don’t want them to come, but you know very well that there’s a barrier between Xianrou and Qiao Nian. It wasn’t easy for her to get through it. Can you not make things difficult for her on her happy days?”","Jiang Zongnan was a little silent. His grip on his briefcase tightened. “But Nian Nian and the others are our relatives, after all...”","“I didn’t say that they aren’t relatives.” Tang Wanru interrupted him and insisted on this matter. “There are also differences between relatives.","“When the two families separated, she kept saying that we would be two families from now on. She hoped that we wouldn’t disturb each other.","“Besides, father and daughter aren’t the kind of people who like crowds. They might not want to come even if you call them.”","After a short hesitation, Jiang Zongnan seemed to be annoyed and only said, “We’ll see. I’ll go to the company now.”","Tang Wanru knew that some things were better than nothing. She wasn’t in a hurry. She calmly tidied Jiang Zongnan’s suit and let go. Then, she smiled and said, “Go. I’ll wait for Xianrou to come back and ask her opinion.”","“Yes.”","Jiang Zongnan took the things and his expression softened a little. He lowered his head and kissed her cheek before leaving for the company.","...","The internet was filled with news of Qiao Nian winning the World Software Competition.","# Qiao Nian Wins the Prize","# Qiao Nian Winning Mas With One Hand","# yyds","Several trending topics were about this software competition.","The software competition was clearly very professional, but because the participants were too awesome, the popularity of the professional competition was even higher than that of the entertainment industry.","A few trending searches were posted.","Many onlookers also paid attention to this competition.","Through the popular science on Weibo, they immediately became fans. Under the latest official announcement from the IT Association were 53,000 reposts and over 300,000 likes.","Compared to this heat, the latest list of members of the Pharmacy Association was not very popular. In the comments section, only the students from the same major paid attention to it.","Not many passersby would notice this Weibo post.","However, anyone who knew the industry knew how awesome the Pharmacy Association was. It was also a great honor to be able to enter it.","And Jiang Xianrou’s name was in this honor."]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 Can She Be Compared to You Entering the Pharmacy Association?","paragraphs":["1435 Can She Be Compared to You Entering the Pharmacy Association?","Lan Pavilion.","The clubhouse was in a quiet place on Chang’an Street. The decoration of the French parasol tree made the environment in the clubhouse look even more elegant.","After passing through the winding corridor, Jiang Xianrou was in one of the private rooms.","Many other people were in the private room apart from her.","Ruan Sisi and Tang Ning were there.","However, like last time, Tang Ning was dragged here by her friend. She found a corner to play by herself and basically did not talk to Jiang Xianrou.","People were playing cards in the box. Some were singing. Some were drinking. It was a lively game.","Jiang Xianrou sat in a corner and played with her phone.","Her fair face was almost expressionless. It was impossible to tell that she was the star of the day.","After Ruan Sisi played a round of dice with someone, she threw down the dice and walked to her side. She sat down with a smile and asked her, “Xianrou, why aren’t you playing with us?”","Jiang Xianrou turned off the light on her phone screen and looked up. Her eyelids were lowered as she said softly, “I don’t know how to play dice.”","Naturally, Ruan Sisi saw her small gesture of putting the phone down. She raised her eyebrows, smiled, and said, “Isn’t there something else if you don’t play dice? We can sing or play pool.”","“Forget it today.” Jiang Xianrou did not deny it, but she wasn’t interested in this at all. “I don’t want to play today.”","Ruan Sisi smiled and exposed her thoughts. “I think you’re not in the mood to play~! Did you see the news about Qiao Nian on the Internet?”","Jiang Xianrou’s beautiful eyes darkened when Qiao Nian was mentioned. It was obvious that she didn’t look well and didn’t want to mention this name.","Ruan Sisi smiled when she did not deny it. She held her arm and said disdainfully, “Xianrou, why are you arguing with her? Some people only have such big plans. They think that they have seen the vast world just by seeing the palm-sized sky... Didn’t she just get first place in a world-class competition? How can she compare to you entering the Pharmacy Association?","“What kind of place is the Pharmacy Association? How many people want to enter but can’t?","“Among the authoritative experts in the country, I’m afraid even Mr. Huang might not be qualified to enter the Pharmacy Association. How can Qiao Nian compare to you now that you’re a member?”","Jiang Xianrou’s gloomy expression eased a little. She curled her lips and smiled, looking quite humble. “I was also lucky to be able to enter the Pharmacy Association.”","However, Ruan Sisi gave her enough face. “That’s not true. You entered because of your ability. In short, you’re the one who entered the Pharmacy Association, not Qiao Nian.”","Jiang Xianrou’s mood improved a little. She pursed her lips and did not speak, but her smug expression clearly agreed with her words.","Ruan Sisi let go of her arm and patted her shoulder. She said earnestly, “So, don’t compare yourself to Qiao Nian. She can’t compare to you.”","“I didn’t compete with her. I really don’t want to play dice. That’s why I’m not playing with you guys. It’s not that I’m in a bad mood because I saw the news on Weibo.”","Jiang Xianrou spoke in a dignified manner. Ruan Sisi was speechless.","However, Jiang Xianrou ignored her. She looked at her phone again, got up, and said, “I’m going to the washroom.”","“Yes, go ahead.”","Ruan Sisi put away her unhappiness and nodded. She watched Jiang Xianrou leave the private room, but she was very nonchalant."]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 Want to Call Ye Wangchuan and the Others Through Jiang Li","paragraphs":["1436 Want to Call Ye Wangchuan and the Others Through Jiang Li","Jiang Xianrou had offended Young Master Ye and was about to be expelled from this circle.","Who would have thought that the Jiang family was so capable? They found a backer for Jiang Xianrou and used their connections to stuff her into the Pharmacy Association...","After all... the Pharmacy Association was different from the International Medical Organization. It was not just about reputation. There were also tangible benefits.","There were too many powerful masters in the Pharmacy Association.","If Jiang Xianrou could enter the Pharmacy Association, it meant that she had their support.","In addition, Jiang Xianrou was able to make a comeback with the Countess who was about to become her godmother.","Who else would have come out to play with her today?","Ruan Sisi looked at Jiang Xianrou’s departing figure and curled her lips in disdain. She felt that the other party was too pretentious and did not want to care anymore. She leaned over and played dice with the others...","...","Outside the private room.","Jiang Xianrou did not go to the washroom as she had said after she left the private room. Instead, she walked out of the corridor.","The weather in Beijing was perfect.","The sun shone brightly on the camphor trees. The sky was cloudless, like an azure mirror. A few birds would occasionally fly by.","Jiang Xianrou held her phone and looked along the way after she went out.","She had sent Ye Wangchuan three WeChat messages in the past two days.","All three were inviting the other party to her filiation banquet.","However, two days passed and Ye Wangchuan did not reply.","Jiang Xianrou found a quiet place and finally couldn’t hold it in anymore. After some thought, she found the phone number in her address book and called Jiang Li.","“Toot-toot.”","It rang a dozen times, and she was about to hang up when Jiang Li answered.","When he picked up, he said in the same cold tone, “Hello? Why are you calling me? What’s the matter?”","A look of humiliation flashed across Jiang Xianrou’s oval face, but she hid it very well. She tried her best to calm her breathing and said, “Brother, I’m holding a filiation banquet in a few days. Do you have time?”","“I told my agent to clear the day.” Jiang Li couldn’t believe she’d call him about that. “You just wanted to know if I had time that day?”","“I have one more thing to ask of you.” Jiang Xianrou didn’t beat around the bush with him. She made up her mind, gritted her teeth, and said in a low voice, “I... I wanted to invite Master Wang and the others to dinner that day.”","Sure enough, Jiang Li said nothing.","Jiang Xianrou took a deep breath and continued humbly, “Brother, can you help me call Master Wang and the others? You know that I had a conflict with them because of some matters previously. I sent a message to Master Wang, but he didn’t reply to me. This filiation banquet is very important to me. I also hope to invite a few more people. It will be very embarrassing for me if no one comes...","“I want to apologize to Master Wang and the others in person and reconcile. Brother, you have a good relationship with them. Can you help me?”","She was usually arrogant and spoke on her high horse.","For once, she showed weakness.","Jiang Li didn’t know how to deal with it for a moment. He was silent for a full half a minute before his tone softened. He asked her, “Xianrou, did you invite Nian Nian to your filiation banquet?”","There was some silence.","Jiang Xianrou felt as if she had been slapped in the face. Her expression froze, and her throat seemed to be blocked. She couldn’t say a word.","Jiang Li knew that she definitely hadn’t invited Qiao Nian from her silence."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 Failed Dream!","paragraphs":["1437 Failed Dream!","Hence, the hesitation that had just appeared in his heart instantly disappeared. He regained his previous coldness and said indifferently, “Since you didn’t invite Nian Nian, Master Wang and the others definitely won’t go either. Think about it carefully.”","Qiao Nian, Qiao Nian, Qiao Nian...","Jiang Xianrou gripped her phone tightly, her face distorted by jealousy.","She was confused.","She had entered the Pharmacy Association. Why did she have to listen to Qiao Nian once she acknowledged a big shot as her godmother?","Would Qin Si and the others come only if Qiao Nian came as well?","Jiang Xianrou took a deep breath. The color on her face was still very bad. “... I understand. I’ll consider it again.”","She didn’t want to deal with Jiang Li anymore. She said coldly, “I’m hanging up, brother.”","Jiang Xianrou placed her phone in front of her and scrolled through her WeChat after she rang up. After thinking about it, she lowered her head and sent Ye Wangchuan another WeChat message.","...","Beijing Capital Airport, Terminal T1.","Qin Si and the others walked out after taking their luggage.","Gu San arranged a car.","The black, red-flag sedan was spacious and comfortable to sit in. The air-conditioning was on full blast.","Qiao Nian sat on the left in the back row.","Her cap was pulled down low, and she wished she could take it off and cover her face. Her beautiful black eyes were half-closed, and she was extremely sleepy.","Sleepy.","The flight from Rao City to Beijing was three and a half hours long.","The journey would take some time. She hadn’t slept for almost the entire day. Her eyelids were drooping and she wished she could curl up in the backseat and sleep.","Unfortunately, Qin Si kept finding topics to talk about along the way.","He hadn’t stopped in four or five hours.","“Master Wang, shall we have dinner together tonight? What do you guys want to eat?”","“We just had hot pot for lunch. How about a light meal tonight?”","“The Imperial Mansion or Lan Pavilion?”","“Sister Qiao...”","Qiao Nian’s head hurt when he mentioned her name again.","She tugged at the brim of her cap with her long, thin fingers and pulled it a little lower. It was a complete ‘don’t-call-me’ gesture.","Qiao Nian’s voice was hoarse as she suppressed her emotions. “I’m going to the sanatorium. Don’t worry about me. Eat by yourself tonight.”","“Why are you going to the sanatorium?” Qin Si scratched his head and reacted. “Ah, you’re going to see Old Master Jiang?”","“Yeah.”","Qiao Nian’s voice was low.","She was lazy.","Qin Si didn’t notice it and chattered on. “I haven’t seen Old Master Jiang in a long time. Let’s go together!”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","“We’ll accompany you to the sanatorium. We’ll go for a meal after we come back.” Qin Si smiled, his handsome face in high spirits. His thick eyebrows and big eyes could basically be dug out. He was too ignorant!","Suddenly.","The man sitting beside Qiao Nian moved.","He noticed the girl’s thin T-shirt and exposed thin arms. He reached for the driver’s window to let in the natural breeze.","Ye Wangchuan slowly retracted his hand and interrupted Qin Si. “Go back to your own house for dinner tonight. No one will eat with you.”","“Master Wang, do you have to be so heartless...”","Ye Wangchuan glared at him and he shut his mouth obediently before he could finish speaking.","He shut up for the first time in four hours. The car was much quieter without his chattering voice.","Qiao Nian felt the natural wind blowing in from outside. h?Her breathing became smoother without Qin Si chattering in her ear."]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 Master Wang’s Public Display of Affection","paragraphs":["1438 Master Wang’s Public Display of Affection","She pulled her headphones out of her pocket and was about to put them in her ears when she heard the man’s deep voice.","“Aren’t you going to have dinner with me tonight?”","Ye Wangchuan’s voice was gentle and pleasant to the ears.","They were both talking.","She clearly felt that she was not as irritable as before when Qin Si was chattering in her ear. The nerves in her mind that had been tensed up by Qin Si’s noise eased. “Okay.”","Qiao Nian looked at the time on her phone and raised her head, revealing her exquisite and eye-catching face. She explained, “I don’t know when I’ll be back, so I won’t be eating with you guys.”","“Yes, I’ll get Gu San to send you there first.”","Then, Ye Wangchuan instructed Gu San to go to the sanatorium before returning to Rhine Apartments.","Gu San turned the car around and drove towards the sanatorium.","They arrived at the sanatorium half an hour later.","The black flag stopped steadily at the entrance of the sanatorium. Qiao Nian had already called Old Master Jiang to say that she wanted to visit him.","She got out of the car door and got out as soon as she arrived.","The next second, the man in the car stuck his head out and said, “Come back early. If it’s too late, remember to send me a message. I’ll come and pick you up.”","Qiao Nian was stunned.","Then, she heard his lazy and serious voice say, “Rhine Apartments isn’t far from here. Tell me half an hour in advance and I’ll come and pick you up. Take your time chatting with Old Master Jiang. I’ll wait outside. There’s no need to rush.”","Listen to him!","This was too showy!","When had Master Wang ever been so humble?","Not only did he want to pick her up, but he also asked Miss Qiao to tell him in advance and he would come over early. He could also wait outside if Miss Qiao hadn’t finished talking to Old Master Jiang.","Qin Si, Zhang Yang, and the others were forced to stuff their mouths with dog food. Their feelings were quite complicated.","Only Gu San had his hands on the steering wheel since he was already used to it. His face was numb. Seeing that he usually ate a lot of dog food, he had long cultivated a calm heart. After all, he knew best that Master Wang was a good man!","Qiao Nian paused for a full two seconds. Her raven-black eyelashes came down, and her voice was hoarse. “Okay.”","With that, she closed the door, stuffed her uninjured hand in her pocket, and strolled into the sanatorium.","Ye Wangchuan rolled up the car window and lowered his eyes to glance at his phone after the girl entered.","He saw that Jiang Xianrou had sent him another WeChat message.","His long fingertips clicked on it.","[Master Wang, I’m holding a filiation banquet at the Imperial Mansion on September 28th. Do you have time to come? I hope you can.]","Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up into a mocking smile.","The light in his eyes flickered. He deleted Jiang Xianrou’s WeChat message almost without thinking. Then, he looked up and instructed Gu San, “Go back to Rhine Apartments.”","“Alright, Master Wang.” Gu San sensed that after Qiao Nian left, the temperature in the car dropped by a degree. Without asking any questions, he turned the car around and drove towards Rhine Apartments.","Ye Wangchuan turned the phone in his hand and narrowed his eyes in thought. He then sent a message to a number that didn’t show his phone number.","[Check the Qi family.]","The message was sent quickly and successfully.","Then, Ye Wangchuan skillfully deleted the message.","When he was done, he rolled down the window again and rested his elbow on it, enjoying the cool evening breeze."]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 Do You Want Anything? Grandpa Will Buy It For You","paragraphs":["1439 Do You Want Anything? Grandpa Will Buy It For You","Meanwhile, on Qiao Nian’s side.","Qiao Nian pulled up the hood of her sweater and walked slowly to Old Master Jiang’s ward.","It wasn’t the first time the nurse saw her.","She greeted her familiarly, “Miss Qiao, you’re here to see Old Master Jiang again.”","Qiao Nian nodded politely. “Yes.”","The nurse smiled and tactfully grabbed the tray. “I’ll leave you two to talk,” she said.","She then left after exchanging a few pleasantries with Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian opened the door and entered Old Master Jiang’s ward.","Old Master Jiang was wearing a light gray housecoat. He was looking at a box with a magnifying glass on his kind face.","Seeing Qiao Nian, he immediately threw down the magnifying glass and put the box down. He called out to her kindly, “Nian Nian, come in quickly.”","Qiao Nian walked in.","Old Master Jiang immediately got up and poured her a glass of water. Then, he placed the fruit basket on the coffee table and reminded her, “Have some fruit. Take the oranges, they’re especially sweet.","“I’m going to peel a pear for you. Wait for me.”","“No, I don’t eat pears.”","Qiao Nian rarely spent time alone with him. In fact, she wasn’t used to interacting with her elders.","She thought for a moment, then called out to the busy old man.","She seemed a little uncomfortable and said softly, “Do you want an orange? Let me peel one for you.”","Old Master’s eyes were filled with emotions when he turned around.","However, he was already past the age of knowing fate and was more reserved than young people. He quickly suppressed his emotions and immediately replied, “Eat! I’ll have an orange.”","Qiao Nian nodded. Without further ado, she chose a large and beautiful orange from the fruit basket that Old Master Jiang had brought over.","Her fair fingers patiently peeled the orange for Old Master Jiang.","When she looked down, her raven-black eyelashes covered her face. She was exquisite and eye-catching.","When Old Master Jiang saw the girl sitting there quietly peeling fruits for him, his heart softened and he looked much better than usual.","He sat on the sofa opposite Qiao Nian. There were deep marks of age around his aged eyes, but they were filled with peace.","“Nian Nian, I saw the news. You got first place?”","Qiao Nian carefully removed the silk from the orange petals and placed the peeled orange on the fruit plate beside her, looking very patient. She didn’t even look up, as if she didn’t care about getting first place. “Yes.”","Old Master Jiang had thought that she would be very excited to win first place in the world-class competition. He didn’t expect Qiao Nian to be even calmer than him.","He couldn’t react for a moment.","Deep down, though, he was happy. His face was rosy. “Do you have any gifts you want? Grandpa will buy them for you!”","Qiao Nian finished peeling half of the orange. She first handed the fruit plate to Old Master Jiang, then peeled the other half.","Her tone was casual as she replied, “... there’s nothing I want.”","Old Master Jiang was a little disappointed. “You don’t want any bags or bracelets? Girls your age like these things.”","Qiao Nian almost said no.","Then, she looked up, saw the old man’s lost expression, and pursed her lips. “Not at the moment. I’ll tell you if I do.”","“Okay, okay, okay.” Old Master Jiang’s depression was swept away when he heard that."]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 It’s Very Similar to the Health Products You Gave Me","paragraphs":["1440 It’s Very Similar to the Health Products You Gave Me","He was so happy that he couldn’t stop grinning, as if he was afraid that Qiao Nian wouldn’t ask for anything. “Take a look first. Tell Grandpa what you like. I’ll take you to buy it.”","“Okay.”","Old Master Jiang was afraid that she would only agree verbally and not look for him. He thought for a moment and said, “Take a photo of whatever you like and send it to me. I’ll buy it for you or transfer the money to you on WeChat.”","Qiao Nian’s heart suddenly softened, as if a warm current was flowing through it. She nodded at him solemnly. “I know. I’ll tell you if there’s anything I like.”","“Good. Don’t forget it.”","Old Master Jiang was satisfied.","Seeing that Qiao Nian was still peeling oranges for him, he recalled that he had received a call from Jiang Zongnan not long ago. After hesitating for a moment, he looked at the girl and said softly, “Many things have happened at home while you were away. Your cousin... Xianrou has entered the Pharmacy Association.”","Jiang Xianrou entered the Pharmacy Association?","Since when did the Pharmacy Association have such a low threshold?","She remembered that the Pharmacy Association was famous all over the world for its abnormal selection conditions. Could it be that she had not paid much attention to the Pharmacy Association in the past two years and the standards had lowered?","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow but didn’t stop peeling oranges for him. She said lazily, “Congratulations.”","Seeing her reaction, Old Master Jiang thought that she was too young and did not understand the Pharmacy Association’s status. He said, “You might not know the situation of the Pharmacy Association. You know your teacher, Mr. Huang, right?”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian finished the remaining half of the orange and placed it on the fruit plate. She wiped her fingers clean with a tissue and looked up at him. “I know.”","Only then did Old Master Jiang continue, “Mr. Huang is already a God-like existence in the country. He’s also one of the honorary presidents of the International Medical Organization. With Mr. Huang’s status in the medical world, he can only barely enter the Pharmacy Association. You can imagine how difficult it is to enter the Association.","“I’m also surprised that your cousin can enter the Pharmacy Association this time.”","Old Master Jiang’s tone was a little solemn as he looked at Qiao Nian. “But since she can enter the Pharmacy Association, Nian Nian, what about you? Do you have any thoughts?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, not quite understanding what he meant.","Old Master Jiang rubbed the space between his eyebrows and realized that he had made things a little serious. He smiled and looked at her lovingly. “I’m not asking you to find a way to enter the Pharmacy Association. I mean, you’re also a medical student. Why don’t you join an organization and have more people take care of you?","“Mr. Huang has connections in the Medical Organization. Why don’t you try to put your name in the Medical Organization in the country first?”","Qiao Nian roughly understood what he meant.","However, she wasn’t interested in reputation, so she shook her head and rejected Old Master Jiang’s kindness. “I don’t want to join these organizations for now. Let’s talk about it if there’s a need later.”","Old Master Jiang did not force her upon seeing that she was indeed not interested in entering the Medical Organization.","Then, he looked at the box on the table and remembered something. He smiled and said, “Speaking of which, there’s something else.”","Old Master Jiang picked up the box and handed it to Qiao Nian, gesturing for her to take a look. “Take a look and see if this small pill looks like the health supplements you gave me.”","Qiao Nian’s temples throbbed. She had a headache.","Tsk. It couldn’t be what she thought."]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 Sister Nian Has as Much of This Medicine as You Want","paragraphs":["1441 Sister Nian Has as Much of This Medicine as You Want","As expected.","Old Master Jiang mentioned excitedly, “Your cousin gave this to me. She said that this medicine is a very precious medicine developed by the Pharmacy Association. It’s not sold on the market. It’s very rare. She only obtained this medicine through her connections with the Pharmacy Association.","“Nian Nian, look at this small pill. Does it look like the medicine you gave me?”","Old Master Jiang didn’t really treat the medicine that Jiang Xianrou had given him as a ‘health supplement’ that Qiao Nian gave him. He purely felt that it was a coincidence.","Laughing, he said, “The first time I saw this drug, I had this feeling it looked like the drug you gave me.”","Qiao Nian opened the box and saw a small pill lying quietly inside. It was very familiar.","It was hers.","“Apparently, this drug is selling for seven figures on the black market.”","Old Master Jiang shook his head in disbelief.","“What medicine is so expensive? She must have been cheated.”","“...” In theory, they did have to sell them for seven figures each.","Because she had been busy recently, the black market had been out of stock for a long time. She didn’t expect Jiang Xianrou to get a pill.","Jiang Xianrou was right about the value of this medicine.","“I think so,” Qiao Nian replied casually.","She closed the lid of the box casually and handed him back the box with the small pills. Then, she turned and took a glass bottle from the shoulder bag she had brought and handed it to the old man.","Her eyebrows were restrained as she said softly, “Grandpa, I brought you a new bottle of health supplements. Put it away first.”","“Why did you buy it for me again?”","Old Master Jiang looked at the familiar glass bottle. There wasn’t a label. He was a little surprised that Qiao Nian had brought him another bottle.","“I haven’t finished the bottle you bought for me. There’s still half left. Besides, I’ve been much stronger recently. Don’t spend money on me...”","Qiao Nian didn’t explain much. She simply said, “This is a new product. Take this after you finish the previous bottle.”","She had checked a lot of information some time ago and improved the prescription.","This was the little pill she had remade.","Compared to the previous ones, the new pills could be considered a strengthened version!","The small pill that Jiang Xianrou had given Old Master Jiang was a semi-finished product before she changed the prescription. It was also effective, but it was incomparable to the new one.","She only made about 20 pills after she improved the prescription this time.","She put them in three glass bottles, one for Old Master Jiang, one for Old Master Ye, and the other for her father.","There was only one left.","Wei Lou had told her many times that the black market had been out of stock for a long time. The remaining one would most likely be sold soon.","She had no shortage of money.","Therefore, she had never thought of selling these things for money.","If she could give things like small pills to her family, she would definitely give them to them first.","The rest could wait.","Old Master Jiang looked at the girl seriously.","He took the medicine and solemnly put it away.","He had specially placed the health supplements that Qiao Nian gave him in his small drawer. That level of importance was even greater than the precious medicine that Jiang Xianrou had told him about seven or eight times.","After Old Master Jiang put away the new ‘health supplements’, he looked at the girl with loving and gentle eyes and said, “By the way, your cousin is holding a filiation banquet next week. Are you going?”","Qiao Nian’s eyebrows were sharp, and she was in low spirits. She casually zipped up her bag and stuffed her hands into her pockets. “No. No time.”"]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 Master Wang Dotes on Me","paragraphs":["1442 Master Wang Dotes on Me","Old Master Jiang had been in the government for decades and had long cultivated a pair of sharp eyes. How could he not tell that she just didn’t want to go?","Seeing that Qiao Nian didn’t want to go, he didn’t force her. He only said, “I’m not feeling well recently, and I don’t really want to go. If you don’t go, I won’t go either.”","Jiang Xianrou had already been expelled from the Jiang family’s genealogy.","He could also tell that his daughter-in-law did not really want him to go.","Since the other party was just being polite to him, he knew that he had to be sensible.","At his age, he was not shameless enough to insist on going to someone else’s filiation banquet.","“This time, she entered the Pharmacy Association and acknowledged the Qi family’s godmother. But you have a conflict with her again...”","A look of worry appeared on Old Master Jiang’s face as he looked at her and said, “Nian Nian, try your best to avoid her during this period of time. Don’t provoke her. She’s a petty person, unlike Jiang Li.”","Qiao Nian didn’t care who Jiang Xianrou acknowledged as her godmother, nor did she feel that it was a big deal to join the Pharmacy Association.","However, she didn’t want Old Master Jiang to worry about the trivial matters at home at his age, so she suppressed the darkness in her eyes and nodded sensibly. “I know.”","Old Master Jiang was relieved. He asked, “Did your father give you that thing?”","Jiang Zongjin had indeed given Qiao Nian something similar to a seal.","She remembered and nodded. “He did.”","“Good.” Old Master Jiang was slightly relieved. He smiled and said, “I’ll find an opportunity to introduce you to a few elders when you’re done with your work.","“Grandpa won’t let anyone bully you even if she enters their Pharmacy Association.”","...","Qiao Nian chatted with Old Master Jiang in the sanatorium until eight in the evening.","As an old man, his energy must be incomparable to when he was young.","Although she could tell that the old man wanted to spend more time with her and forced himself to talk to her, he couldn’t hide his exhaustion.","Qiao Nian guessed that there was too much time, so she bade him farewell and made an appointment to visit him again after a while.","It was dark outside by the time she walked out of the sanatorium.","The night was like a thick inkstone, too deep to melt.","The sky of Beijing in September was dotted with stars. Qiao Nian saw a man leaning against a black Land Rover by the roadside under the bright moonlight.","Ye Wangchuan was leaning against the wall, looking down at his phone. He was wearing a black windbreaker and looked just as graceful in the night.","He just didn’t know how long he’d been leaning against the side of the car.","Upon seeing Qiao Nian come out, Ye Wangchuan put down his phone and smiled. “You’re out?”","In front of Qiao Nian, he had already restrained himself.","However, she could tell at a glance that he wasn’t someone to be trifled with.","Her eyes darkened before she silently looked down and slowly walked towards him.","Well, she didn’t seem to be easy to deal with either.","They were both the same.","Ye Wangchuan waited for her to come over and took her shoulder bag. His eyes were clear and beautiful as he looked at her and smiled. He asked gently, “How is Old Master Jiang’s health?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him sideways; it was especially seductive. “He’s in good spirits, but he doesn’t look too good. Maybe he hasn’t rested well recently.”","Ye Wangchuan opened the door for her. Her sideways glance made his Adam’s apple move up and down. His eyes darkened and he looked dangerous. “Yes, I haven’t visited him in a long time. I’ll accompany you to visit Old Master Jiang another day.”"]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 I Never Forgot My Initial Motive","paragraphs":["1443 I Never Forgot My Initial Motive","Qiao Nian got into the car and replied lazily, “We’ll talk about it next time.”","The fact that she didn’t refuse was tantamount to a tacit agreement.","Ye Wangchuan was in a good mood. He got in behind her and closed the door, then instructed the driver, “Drive back to Rhine Apartments.”","“Alright, Young Master Ye.”","The Ye family driver did not dare to take another look at them. He stepped on the accelerator and the car turned around and drove steadily into the night.","The girl had been running all day and was already tired. Her fair face under the baseball cap was covered in fatigue. Her beautiful eyes narrowed, and her eyelids started to flutter as soon as she got into the car.","Ye Wangchuan covered her legs with a blanket and then pressed down the window to let the night breeze in.","Qiao Nian yawned comfortably and leaned back lazily, planning to close her eyes and rest on the way.","“The software competition is over. What are your plans now?” The man’s voice was soothing and pleasant.","Qiao Nian pretended to be listening to a lullaby. She forced her eyelids open and yawned again. She raised her hand to push down the brim of her cap and said, “I don’t have any plans. I’ll probably have to stay at school for the next few days. Professor Du said there are a few award-winning forms for me to fill out later.”","She thought for a moment and pressed her brow bone down in frustration. “I haven’t been to class in a long time, either,” she said. “In any case, since I’m still at Qing University, I must attend a few classes. Otherwise, I’m afraid I won’t be able to graduate.”","“God Qiao still needs a college diploma?” Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but tease her. “I thought you didn’t care about these...”","His low and sultry voice filled the car.","Qiao Nian’s heart skipped a beat.","She turned her head to the side and stared at the man’s face for about three seconds, then looked away. Remembering the swelling at the corner of her mouth, which had only just subsided, she stopped thinking.","“I’ve warned myself from the first day of my medical studies that we need to maintain a sense of awe when it comes to medicine, because every detail may determine whether a life is taken or not. Nothing weighs more than life.”","Qiao Nian’s gaze fell on the night view outside the car window. Her voice was light but heavy.","“I’ve never forgotten my original intentions.”","The sea of knowledge was boundless. Even geniuses had to work hard their entire lives to break through their bottlenecks.","Mr. Huang was a big shot in the medical world.","Never for a moment had she considered herself above the decades of achievement of the older generation.","She wasn’t interested in a diploma.","It was a show of respect for the older generation.","With that, the car fell silent.","She didn’t try to be melodramatic. The phone next to her lit up.","Qiao Nian picked it up and unlocked it with her fingerprint.","It was a message from Lu Zhi.","[Shall we have dinner at the Imperial Mansion next Saturday?]","Only then did Qiao Nian remember that Lu Zhi was still in Beijing. She had a headache, but she still returned his message.","[What time.]","The other party replied quickly.","[At noon, depends on your time.]","After seeing the time and place, Qiao Nian stopped replying to him.","She narrowed her eyes and suddenly remembered that next Saturday would be the same time as Jiang Xianrou’s family gathering.","Qiao Nian’s slender fingers curled up and tapped on the phone case a few times, as if she was wondering if she should ask Lu Zhi to change locations.","But then she thought better of it.","Jiang Xianrou’s filiation banquet had nothing to do with her. The Imperial Mansion was so big that they probably wouldn’t meet.","A week passed in the blink of an eye."]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 The Old Master Won’t Come Today?","paragraphs":["1444 The Old Master Won’t Come Today?","Saturday dawned bright and clear.","It rained for two consecutive days. The drizzle washed away all the sand and wind in the hot capital.","The air in Beijing was much fresher now.","Today was an extremely important day for Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou.","They had been unlucky for so long. Finally, they could hold their heads high.","Both of them woke up early and went to a special beauty salon to do their skincare. They also called a professional styling team to style their hair.","Neither of them wanted anything to go wrong today.","Ten o’clock.","After Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou finished their styling, they took a car to the Imperial Mansion on Chang’an Street.","They were early, but someone had arrived before them.","“You guys are here?”","Jiang Zongnan had specially postponed his schedule at the company for a day. He looked mature and energetic in a black suit.","Seeming to be in a good mood. He smiled and said when he saw them, “Xianrou’s godmother isn’t here yet. I just asked her. She’s on the way here and confirmed that she can arrive before midnight.”","Tang Wanru was wearing a traditional Chinese suit today. If it were anyone else, the rose-red color would definitely not be able to suppress it. She was wearing an emerald-agate necklace. Coupled with a set of expensive jewelry, it forcefully suppressed the rose-red color.","A smile appeared on her well-maintained face. She leaned against Jiang Zongnan and said gently, “It’s fine. It doesn’t matter if the Countess comes later. Anyway, Xianrou’s filiation banquet won’t officially start until 12.”","She thought for a moment and asked, “By the way, Zongnan, which relatives are coming today?”","“Only Aunt’s family arrived. In addition, a few relatives from the family came, but they are all distant relatives.”","When Jiang Zongnan mentioned the guests who had already arrived, the smile on his face clearly faded, his brows furrowed, and his tone was low.","“I called Dad half an hour ago. The old man insisted he wouldn’t come.”","Today was a happy day for Jiang Xianrou.","Although Jiang Zongnan wanted to call his brother and niece, he only informed Old Master Jiang in the end because of his wife’s and daughter’s wishes.","However, Old Master Jiang was very stubborn and insisted on not coming.","He had taken the time to visit the sanatorium himself yesterday. The old man’s attitude was unyielding, and he did not show any signs of softening.","He was really not coming.","He made a special trip there, but the Old Master’s attitude was the same. He was not coming!","Jiang Zongnan didn’t want his family to end up like this.","However, things had already developed to this point. Since the old man was unwilling to come, he had to help Xianrou complete this filiation banquet no matter what.","“It’s fine if Dad doesn’t want to come.” Tang Wanru’s eyes flickered with a trace of coldness.","She was very good at saving face. She placed her hand on the man’s shoulder and comforted him silently. “Dad is old. After all, his body can’t compare to before. It doesn’t matter if he doesn’t want to make a trip. Elders will always be our elders. I don’t think Xianrou will be angry with Grandpa because of this.”","She turned her head and gestured to Jiang Xianrou with her eyes. “Xianrou, don’t you think so?”","A trace of disdain flashed across Jiang Xianrou’s bright oval face. Her eyelashes drooped and she looked like a lady from a wealthy family. She nodded. “Yes.”","Tang Wanru immediately smiled and said to Jiang Zongnan, “Look, you can rest assured since Xianrou said so.”"]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 Xu Jishen Is Not Coming","paragraphs":["1445 Xu Jishen Is Not Coming","Jiang Zongnan was frowning when he mentioned that Old Master Jiang was unwilling to come, but his expression relaxed at this moment. He looked at Jiang Xianrou with a gratified expression and said, “Xianrou, it’s good that you think that way.","“Your grandfather... He doted on you since you were a child. He just misunderstood you. It’s not that he doesn’t like you anymore.”","“I know.” Impatience quickly flashed across Jiang Xianrou’s eyes, but she was much calmer than before. Under such circumstances, she could still smile at Jiang Zongnan and say, “Dad, don’t worry. I won’t blame Grandpa.”","Now that she had entered the Pharmacy Association and acknowledged the legendary figure of the Qi family as her godmother, she naturally wouldn’t argue with the old man.","The Jiang family still held some weight in her eyes in the past.","But now?","They were just so-so!","She had long seen how vast the sky outside Beijing was through Qi Yan. In the past, her horizons had been restricted by Qin Si and the others.","She thought she could get into that little circle and had already touched the ceiling.","However, she didn’t know that there was always someone better in this world.","Outside Beijing, there was Continent O, a country, and a royal family. She even learned from Qi Yan about the independent continent and the illegal district...","The world in Beijing seemed so small in comparison.","She didn’t even care about Qin Si, so how could she care about the Jiang family’s insignificant status?","Jiang Xianrou’s eyes were filled with desire and ambition. She curled her lips and looked ahead.","Outside was a bustling crowd of passersby.","In her heart, she only wanted to use the bridge her mother had laid for her this time to successfully ascend to a higher level.","As for who her grandfather loved the most, she didn’t care at all.","Jiang Xianrou didn’t care why the old man refused to come to her filiation banquet.","In any case, she no longer needed to rely on the Jiang family’s background. Those people in Beijing could only support her now that she had the Pharmacy Association’s backing.","They were even more flattering than before.","Wasn’t Ruan Sisi and the others the best example?","Jiang Xianrou was in a daze and did not notice that Jiang Yao’s car was also parked outside. Only Jiang Yao got out of the car.","She didn’t notice him.","Tang Wanru immediately noticed that Jiang Yao was alone. Her instincts prompted her to frown and ask her son, “Yao’er, why did you come alone? Where’s Young Master Xu? Didn’t he come with you?”","“He’s busy.”","Jiang Yao was dressed very casually today, not as grandly as the other three.","He was wearing a designer shirt jacket over his white T-shirt. The collar was open, and he looked like a handsome young master.","Jiang Yao had long legs and strode over in a few steps. He relaxed when he saw Jiang Xianrou. He patted her shoulder and said warmly, “Xianrou, congratulations.”","“Thank you, Big Brother.” Jiang Xianrou lowered her head shyly, looking very humble.","However, she became even more respectful to Jiang Yao after she humbly understood the situation outside Beijing and how powerful Tian Chen was.","Tian Chen had a background in the illegal district, and Jiang Yao was a member of Tian Chen.","She might need her big brother to help her in the future.","Jiang Yao nodded in relief upon seeing that she was no longer arrogant and impatient. He then turned to look at Tang Wanru. “Young Master Xu’s grandfather is sick. He caught a small cold. He was worried and went back to Rao City. He left this morning. He left less than an hour ago.”"]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 Sister Nian Has Already Arrived at the Imperial Mansion","paragraphs":["1446 Sister Nian Has Already Arrived at the Imperial Mansion","“What a coincidence?” Tang Wanru was disappointed. She really wanted to rope in Xu Jishen to help Jiang Xianrou in the future, but the other party happened to have something on. “I thought Young Master Xu would be able to come this time. I didn’t expect him to go back.”","“That’s right. I can only say that this timing is too coincidental. No one expected Old Master Su to suddenly catch a cold.”","Jiang Yao was also very regretful. Then, he smiled and said, “It doesn’t matter if he can’t come. I invited a few people from Tian Chen to come and play. Two of them can come. They should arrive later.”","Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou were surprised.","!!","Jiang Yao looked around and did not speak to them again. He turned to ask Jiang Zongnan, “Dad, why don’t I see Uncle and the others?”","He still didn’t know that Jiang Zongnan hadn’t invited Qiao Nian and the others.","Jiang Zongnan’s expression became a little uncomfortable. He was so embarrassed that he didn’t know what to say. “Your uncle and the others have something on, so they might not be able to come.”","Jiang Yao knew that they had recently fallen out with his uncle’s family.","He thought that Jiang Zongnan had invited his uncle’s family, but Jiang Zongjin had rejected him and was unwilling to come.","Taking a deep breath, he took out his phone and pretended to make a call. “I’ll call Qiao Nian and ask her if she can spare some time.","“It’s just a meal. It won’t take her long. I’ll talk to her nicely. She might be willing to come.”","No one dared to refute him for a moment.","However, neither Tang Wanru nor Jiang Xianrou could understand why he was so concerned about whether Qiao Nian would come for dinner.","Only Jiang Yao himself knew who he had seen outside the city hospital half a month ago!","He made a call and heard a robotic female voice. Only then did he remember that Qiao Nian had already blacklisted him.","Jiang Yao felt a headache coming on. He thought about how to contact her.","...","On the other side, Qiao Nian had just alighted from the car and was walking towards the Imperial Mansion.","She got a call from someone not long after she got out of the car.","Qiao Nian glanced at the caller ID.","It was Jian Jin.","She glanced up at the stairs and slowly answered, “Hello.”","She had been busy with school recently and had more free time.","The quality of sleep shot up.","Her voice was not as hoarse as before. It was just lazy, as if she was not interested in her surroundings.","“Qiao, where are you?”","Qiao Nian glanced at the main road but didn’t say anything.","Jian Jin’s bright, cheerful voice came over the line. “I’m up. Do you want me to drive over and pick you up?”","Qiao Nian’s fingers tapped on her phone, her eyelids drooping, hiding the unrestrained look in her eyes. She replied casually, “No need. I’m already outside. Which private room did Lu Zhi book? Do you have a seat? Send me the location.”","“You’re here?” Jian Jin said immediately, incredulous. “Give me a minute and I’ll tell him to send the location to you.”","Qiao Nian hung up.","With one hand in her trouser pocket and the earpiece in her ear, she continued on her way to the Imperial Mansion.","The cast on her right hand had been removed. Because it was only a minor fracture, not even a bone injury, the doctor had not bandaged her.","Apart from not being able to lift heavy things, her injured hand basically did not affect her life.","Lu Zhi’s location was quickly sent over.","Qiao Nian opened WeChat and followed the red dot."]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 The Qi Family Is Finally Here","paragraphs":["1447 The Qi Family Is Finally Here","She used the side door to enter, directly avoiding the possibility of encountering the Jiang family.","Qiao Nian was already keeping a low profile.","However, her aura was too strong.","Even though she tried her best to keep a low profile and did not want to have anything to do with the Jiang family, Yuan Qing still saw her back when she entered.","“That person is Qiao Nian?”","Yuan Qing was wearing a red shirt today. Her white hair was combed neatly.","If not for the fact that she was usually too mean and looked a little stingy, she would have been a blessed old lady at her age.","“Qiao Nian?”","“That way.”","The person who accompanied her to Jiang Xianrou’s filiation banquet was her son, a middle-aged man with a sallow face and a thin body.","The middle-aged man looked in the direction where her walking stick was pointing. At a glance, he only saw a corner of her clothes.","Unconcerned, he looked away and pushed his old mother. “I didn’t see her, Mom,” he said. “You must be mistaken. The eldest branch of the family doesn’t seem to be coming.”","“Didn’t you see the person who walked past just now?” Yuan Qing didn’t give up. She wished she could follow him and take a look, but it was inconvenient with lame legs. “I think it’s that Qiao Nian.”","The middle-aged man didn’t want to cause trouble for no reason today. “Mom, forget it. Don’t worry about it. Anyway, it has nothing to do with us. Why are you worrying about these things? I’ll push you back.”","“You know nothing!”","Yuan Qing was angered by his disappointing words.","“I’m doing this for your son. The eldest branch is disappointing. In the future, we can only cozy up to the second branch. My brother is muddle-headed, but I can’t be muddle-headed.”","After rolling her eyes a few times, she didn’t chase after the person who had entered the Imperial Mansion to see if it was Qiao Nian.","As noon approached, the guests invited by the Jiang family arrived one after another.","The Qi family had also arrived.","This time, only two people from the Qi family came. One was Qi Yan, and the other was Qi Lanyin.","Jiang Yao received them.","Qi Yan even gave Jiang Xianrou a greeting gift.","The scene looked very harmonious.","Everyone chatted and laughed as they entered the banquet hall of the Imperial Mansion.","Only Qi Lanyin, who was following behind Qi Yan, had a cold expression the entire time. Her bright oval face was long, and anyone with a discerning eye could tell that she was not in a good mood.","Especially when she saw Qi Yan give the Qi family’s emblem to Jiang Xianrou as a gift, extreme dissatisfaction and anger flashed across her eyes.","However, Qi Yan ignored her.","Qi Lanyin didn’t dare to be impudent in front of her aunt.","She was frustrated. So, after entering the banquet hall, she whispered to Qi Yan, “Auntie, I’m going to the washroom.”","Qi Yan had tied her hair into a bun today. She was wearing a shirt set, which weakened her feminine charm and added to her elegance.","She knew what Qi Lanyin was unhappy about, but she didn’t show anything in front of Tang Wanru’s family. She only gave Qi Lanyin a look that said, “Don’t cause trouble,” then smiled and said, “Okay, go.”","Qi Lanyin was no fool.","On the contrary, she had been one of the most important heirs of the Qi family since she was young and had always been outstanding.","Her only failure in life was when she lost to Qiao Nian in a medical competition. At other times, she was the only one whose brilliance overshadowed others.","Of course, she saw the warning in her aunt’s eyes and felt even more annoyed."]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 She Looked Down on Jiang Xianrou","paragraphs":["1448 She Looked Down on Jiang Xianrou","Qi Lanyin glanced at Jiang Xianrou, who she had once looked down on but was now extremely glorious. She sneered and clenched her fists, then reluctantly answered, “Auntie, I’ll come and find you later.”","“Okay.”","Qi Yan didn’t have time to talk to her alone. She was surrounded in the blink of an eye.","Qi Lanyin clenched her fists and looked at Jiang Xianrou in disdain. Then, she turned around and left without looking back.","...","The Qi family’s power was mainly overseas, but it did not affect Qi Yan’s status and influence.","She was a unique existence in the Qi family.","Even the head of the family, Qi Rongguang, had to give her face. It was because Qi Yan had married into a royal family in Continent O.","Her husband was third in line to the throne, and she herself had been made a countess.","None of that was the point.","The main point was that these royal families had always been closely related to places like the Independent Continent and the illegal district. The forces behind them couldn’t be underestimated.","For Jiang Xianrou to be able to attach herself to Qi Yan, she was definitely considered to have climbed up the social ladder.","Including this time.","Qi Yan was the one who pulled strings for Jiang Xianrou to enter the Pharmacy Association. It took a lot of connections for her to successfully enter the association.","Jiang Xianrou was definitely not qualified to enter a place like the Pharmacy Association.","For that very reason, the Jiang family treated Qi Yan extremely formally. Jiang Yao accompanied her the entire time and introduced Qi Yan to many connections in Beijing.","Qi Yan also gave him enough face and showed a very loving attitude towards Jiang Xianrou the entire time.","Of course, Jiang Xianrou was flattered. She spoke to Qi Yan carefully, afraid that she had not performed well and won the favor of this extraordinary godmother.","She chatted with Qi Yan for a while before saying, “Godmother, I’ll go prepare. Take your time.”","She meant playing the piano.","Jiang Xianrou had already planned to show off her skills in front of Qi Yan this time, so she told Qi Yan that she would play a piano piece for her.","She stood up now.","Qi Yan immediately patted the back of her hand and said gently, “I’ve long heard that you play the piano very well and even won an international award. I haven’t even won an award at your age. It’s already very impressive that you can have such achievements at such a young age.","“Go. I’ll wait for you.”","Jiang Xianrou quickly lowered her head, but she couldn’t hide her arrogance. “Yes.”","She also told Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru before leaving.","...","Meanwhile, on Qian Nian’s side.","She first went to the location that Lu Zhi gave her, asked the waiter, and confirmed that this seat was reserved by a Mr. Lu.","She dragged out a chair by the window, sat down, and ordered a lemonade.","The waiter brought the drink quickly.","Qiao Nian drank lemonade while playing with her phone.","Neither Jian Jin nor Lu Zhi had arrived by the time she finished the entire glass of lemonade.","She checked the time.","11:45.","15 minutes to the appointed time.","Annoyed, Qiao Nian got up and picked up her phone, planning to go to the washroom.","She put the peaked cap on and pulled the brim down. As she walked, she sent a message to Jian Jin, telling her that she was going to the washroom.","The Imperial Mansion was very big, and the decor was low-key and stylish.","After sending Jian Jin a message, Qiao Nian put her phone back into her pocket and walked calmly towards the washroom."]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 Someone Was Actually Talking About Her","paragraphs":["1449 Someone Was Actually Talking About Her","Unexpectedly, she realized that the lobby was filled with people as she passed by.","“Who the hell is it? Who broke my present?”","Jiang Xianrou’s angry voice came from the crowd.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She hadn’t expected to bump into her here.","Not wanting to be nosy, she folded her hands and was about to leave when she heard her name being mentioned in the crowd.","“Could it be Qiao Nian?”","The string in her head tightened. Qiao Nian pushed her cap down and looked at the person who had spoken.","She caught a glimpse of an elderly woman with white hair.","All eyes were suddenly on her.","Yuan Qing was nervous for a moment, but she quickly calmed down and said hesitantly, “I think I saw her coming to the Imperial Mansion today. I thought she was coming over to the banquet, but I didn’t see her inside. Since she’s here and hasn’t shown her face... I’m just guessing. I’m guessing that she’s jealous that Xianrou sneaked over without telling everyone and ruined the greeting gift Godmother Xianrou gave her.”","“Aunt, Qiao Nian is also in the Imperial Mansion?” Jiang Xianrou looked shocked.","At this moment, Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao heard the news and came out of the banquet hall in a hurry.","They happened to hear Yuan Qing’s words.","Jiang Zongnan quickly asked what was going on.","It turned out that when Jiang Xianrou went backstage to change her clothes, she realized that the gift Qi Yan had given her had been torn apart. The diamond emblem was torn.","In addition, the deep-sea coral that Qi Yan had given her was also destroyed.","The scene was a mess.","But neither the waiter nor anyone else had seen anyone pass through...","Because Yuan Qing’s words were directed at Qiao Nian!","After all, the second branch hadn’t invited Qiao Nian and the others to dinner this time. However, Qiao Nian had appeared at the Imperial Mansion at an inappropriate time.","It had to be said that Qiao Nian was the most suspicious.","Otherwise, just as Yuan Qing had said, she was not here to eat. Why would she come to the Imperial Mansion?","What was she doing here?","Jiang Xianrou was obviously concerned about this matter. She stared at Yuan Qing and asked, “Aunt, are you sure Qiao Nian came to the Imperial Mansion?”","Yuan Qing was actually not too sure. “I saw her at noon. It should be her. It’s difficult to recognize her.”","Jiang Zongnan frowned and did not speak.","Jiang Xianrou snorted and said without thinking, “Call the police.”","Jiang Zongnan looked at her in surprise.","However, Jiang Xianrou’s face was dark and her eyes were filled with hatred. “We’ll know if she’s in the Imperial Mansion when the police come looking for her.”","“Xianrou.” Jiang Zongnan instinctively resisted. “What are you doing? Things are still uncertain. You don’t have to make such a big fuss.”","Jiang Yao had the same thought. He felt that Qiao Nian wasn’t the culprit.","However, Yuan Qing was an elder.","Since she said that he had seen Qiao Nian appear in the Imperial Mansion, it was very likely that Qiao Nian had come.","But what was Qiao Nian doing in the Imperial Mansion?","As he was thinking, he suddenly saw the figure of a girl outside the crowd from the corner of his eye. She was wearing a baseball cap and a casual sweater. She was dressed very casually.","If not the person they were discussing, then who?","Stunned, Jiang Yao subconsciously called out, “Qiao Nian?”","The others surrounded Jiang Xianrou, still wondering who did it.","Jiang Yao suddenly shouted the name of the most suspicious person.","Qiao Nian?","Qiao Nian was really here?"]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 Qiao Nian, Who Are You Eating With?","paragraphs":["1450 Qiao Nian, Who Are You Eating With?","Everyone instinctively followed his gaze—the girl was standing a few steps away from them, as if she was watching a show that had nothing to do with her.","Until all eyes focused on her.","Only then did she raise her head casually. Her gaze was sharp and mocking as she glanced past the crowd and landed on the Jiang family members.","“Why? Have you booked the entire Imperial Mansion today?”","The girl’s voice was cold and hoarse.","The sarcasm was unmistakable.","Jiang Xianrou’s face turned pale. She pinched her palms and was so angry that her eyes turned red. “You!”","How dare she mock them!","Jiang Zongnan didn’t expect Qiao Nian to really be here. He was stunned for a moment, unable to regain his senses.","Frowning, he looked at Jiang Xianrou and the precious coral that had been smashed on the ground. He had a headache. “Alright, Xianrou, there must be a misunderstanding. Nian Nian is not such a person. Go and change your clothes. The Qi family is still waiting for you.”","“Dad!” Jiang Xianrou couldn’t accept his way of handling things. Her face was filled with anger. “She ruined all the gifts the Qi family gave me. If you don’t pursue the matter, are you going to let me off? How am I going to explain myself when the Qi family asks?”","So much commotion outside.","Many guests who had just arrived were attracted over and stopped to watch.","In the crowd, Jiang Yao saw his two colleagues from Tian Chen had finally arrived.","The expression on his handsome face kept changing. He felt extremely embarrassed.","He looked at the girl and hesitated for a moment before asking in a low voice, “Qiao Nian, what are you doing here?”","He didn’t say he suspected her, but the very fact that he asked the question was tantamount to outright suspicion.","Qiao Nian smiled contemptuously as she glanced at him with her dark eyes and then said in a low voice, “To eat.”","Jiang Yao was speechless.","He frowned. He took a deep breath and stared at the girl intently. “Who are you eating with?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She didn’t understand where he got the confidence to interrogate her.","However, Jiang Yao treated her silence as guilt. He lowered his brows even more and said irritably, “Since you came to the Imperial Mansion to eat, you can’t possibly come alone. As you can see, the gift Godmother gave Xianrou was broken for no reason. This gift is very expensive. Just that coral alone is worth more than eight figures.","“I’m not doubting you. I just want to ask exactly who you’re having dinner with. If it’s convenient, could you have that person drop by?”","He spoke reasonably and seemed polite.","However, Qiao Nian suddenly lost interest in arguing with them. She lowered her gaze, her dark eyelashes covering the coldness in her eyes. “If you think that I’m the one who broke Jiang Xianrou’s things, you can call the police if you have evidence. I’ll stay here and wait for the police to find me. But if you don’t have proof...” Her eyes were deep and dark, only mockery left. Her stance was uninhibited, and her lips curved in a sneer. “I stand by what I said,” she said casually.","“Do you own the Imperial Mansion?”","Jiang Yao was speechless.","After saying that, she ignored him. She turned around and pulled the brim of her cap to leave.","“Wait.” Jiang Yao instinctively ran after her.","The other Jiang family members were also restless.","There was no lack of discussion in the crowd.","Suddenly, a voice broke the silence, causing Jiang Yao to break out in a cold sweat.","“I’m meeting her for dinner here. Any objections?”"]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 I Know CEO Lu, but CEO Lu Doesn’t Know Me","paragraphs":["1451 I Know CEO Lu, but CEO Lu Doesn’t Know Me","Everyone’s eyes were still on Qiao Nian and Jiang Yao.","“She’s having lunch with me. I asked her to come to the Imperial Mansion.”","It wasn’t until a cold and sinister voice interrupted that the Jiang family and the onlookers looked to the side.","A young man in his early 20s was sitting in a wheelchair pushed out by an iron tower-like bodyguard in black.","The bodyguard was dressed in a suit and leather shoes. He wore sunglasses and looked expressionless. He had no interest in the people around him. His ogling attitude was an oppressive aura that came from his bones.","Lu Zhi was sitting in a silver wheelchair. It was rare for him to wear a shirt. His light blue shirt was ironed without a single wrinkle. The top button of his collar was unbuttoned, and his collar was slightly open. The color of his shirt accentuated his skin.","His skin hadn’t seen the sun for many years, and its whiteness was dazzling in the light.","His own hands lay primly on the blanket, his head on one side, his eyes half-closed, the long lashes covering the deep pupils above them.","He looked like a very shrewd person.","“Who said you wanted to see me just now?” Lu Zhi looked gentle and elegant. He smiled with his rose-colored thin lips and glanced sideways at the stunned Jiang Yao. He narrowed his eyes again and said in a charming voice, “You were the one who wanted to see me? I’m here. Tell me, what’s the matter?”","Jiang Yao’s shirt was already drenched in a cold sweat and stuck to his back. He looked at Lu Zhi in shock as if his throat was blocked.","He couldn’t find his voice for a long time. “CEO, CEO Lu.”","Jiang Xianrou frowned. She didn’t know Lu Zhi. She turned her head and asked Jiang Yao disapprovingly, “Brother, who is he? Do you know him?”","Jiang Xianrou wasn’t the only one who was dumbfounded.","The relatives of the Jiang family looked at each other. They didn’t understand who this man was and why Jiang Yao had such a huge reaction.","Yuan Qing muttered softly, “CEO Lu? This person is a boss? He runs a company?”","Her son shook his head, indicating he wasn’t sure.","Yuan Qing looked at his useless appearance and turned away aggrievedly before continuing to look at Jiang Yao.","Jiang Yao had never expected Lu Zhi to be the one asking Qiao Nian out for lunch.","At this moment, he already regretted his previous impulse.","However, it was impossible for him to back down now. He answered Jiang Xianrou with difficulty, “I know CEO Lu, but CEO Lu doesn’t know me.”","“?” Jiang Xianrou did not quite understand what he meant.","After all, she had a new understanding of Jiang Yao after she understood how powerful Tian Chen was.","Jiang Yao could enter Tian Chen.","How many people in Beijing could make her brother say such discouraging words?","Jiang Yao took a deep breath and explained to her in a low voice, “CEO Lu is Tian Chen’s boss.”","Jiang Xianrou gasped. “You said he’s Tian Chen’s...”","She couldn’t bring herself to say the last word.","Jiang Yao nodded with difficulty.","Jiang Xianrou suddenly looked at the girl standing in the crowd. A huge mountain was pressing down on her, almost suffocating her.","“How could Qiao Nian know such a person?” Jiang Xianrou tried her best to control her emotions, but her tone was still filled with jealousy and shock.","She couldn’t understand why Qiao Nian was always so lucky.","She didn’t even dare to think about the boss behind Tian Chen, but Qiao Nian actually knew him!","Jiang Yao did not answer her.","The bodyguard in black had already pushed Lu Zhi to Qiao Nian’s side. Jiang Yao saw that the two of them were talking familiarly. It was obvious that they knew each other for a long time."]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 So He Went to Pick Clothes","paragraphs":["1452 So He Went to Pick Clothes","His mind went blank, a little hollow, and buzzed again.","He had thought that Qiao Nian might know Lu Zhi because he had seen him go to the hospital last time.","But he hadn’t expected them to be so close, as if they’d known each other for years.","But Qiao Nian was still so young, not even 20 this year.","!!","Qiao Nian had just finished her college entrance examination at the beginning of the year. Logically speaking, she had not stayed in Beijing for more than half a year. She was as ordinary as the other students. Other than her face, there was nothing remarkable about her resume...","Jiang Yao clenched his fists at his sides.","His hands shook slightly.","He regretted his rash actions even more.","...","On the other side.","After Lu Zhi asked the girl frivolously, “Why were you outside?”","Qiao Nian looked up at him and said concisely, “I came out to take a breather, but I happened to hear my name. I realized that I was lying 100,000 meters away, but the blame still landed on me. I was quite curious about how they planned to shift the blame, so I listened here... You saw what happened later.”","She was still in the mood to joke. She shrugged and said flippantly, “Tsk, bad luck. Someone found out. They also found me here and pestered me for an explanation.”","Explanation?","Sorry, she didn’t have any!","She didn’t even know how she’d been shot while lying down.","Lu Zhi’s gaze darkened when he saw the cynical expression on her fair face. His knuckles were on the ruby ring, and the uneven surface of the gem cut his hand. He chuckled, not seeming to care about the pain. “So you asked them to call the police.","“Actually, you could call me.”","Qiao Nian glanced at him, as if asking, “Why would I call you?”","Lu Zhi’s brows relaxed and he smiled. “Weren’t they questioning who you’re eating with? The matter would have been resolved if you’d just called me.”","Qiao Nian hummed, as if she understood what he meant. She replied casually, “Even if I don’t call you, they won’t be able to stop me either. I can’t be bothered to call you.”","Lu Zhi was speechless.","Qiao Nian stared at him for two seconds after she finished speaking. Lu Zhi’s heart skipped a beat, and his back straightened unconsciously.","The girl had just pulled down her cap and frowned when she suddenly said, “I thought you never wore anything other than white. Why are you wearing blue today?”","Lu Zhi thought that Qiao Nian hadn’t noticed something different about him today. Seeing that Qiao Nian had noticed, the corners of his lips curled up. He said gently and elegantly, “Ah, about that. I’m in a good mood today.”","Behind him, the bodyguard, who did not dare to say a word, remained silent.","However, he already understood why Mr. Lu stayed in the cloakroom for three hours before leaving.","He was shocked. After all, Lu Zhi was definitely not someone who valued relationships.","However, under Lu Zhi’s pressure, even though he was filled with surprise and shock, he remained expressionless and numb. He didn’t even dare to look at Qiao Nian.","“Okay.” Qiao Nian wasn’t someone who paid attention to such trivial matters. She was just used to Lu Zhi wearing white. Suddenly, she couldn’t help but look at him in other colors.","After Lu Zhi explained, she didn’t think too much about it.","Just then, the phone vibrated in her pocket.","Qiao Nian took it out and looked down."]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 The Loud Slap","paragraphs":["1453 The Loud Slap","Jian Jin’s name danced across the phone screen.","Qiao Nian didn’t pick up. After hanging up, she took out her WeChat and sent a message to her saying that she would be right there. She put her phone in her pocket and looked at the man in front of her. “Jian Jin is here. Let’s go over.”","Lu Zhi knew her personality. After speaking to her, he looked at the Jiang family standing not far away.","He didn’t waste any time. His gaze landed on Jiang Yao and he said indifferently, “Are you from Tian Chen?”","Under his gaze, Jiang Yao’s neck felt like it weighed a thousand kilograms. He was suppressed by Lu Zhi until he couldn’t raise his head.","Lu Zhi didn’t do anything, but he was already at a disadvantage.","“Yes, I’m—”","Jiang Yao hadn’t finished introducing himself when Lu Zhi tapped his fair fingertips on the armrest of the wheelchair and interrupted him, “When did the threshold of Tian Chen become so low that any Tom, Dick, or Harry can enter?”","Jiang Yao paled. He looked at Lu Zhi anxiously. “CEO Lu, I...”","“If you can’t even polish your eyes, how much value can I expect you to create for Tian Chen?” Lu Zhi did not give him any chance to explain. He said coldly and sinisterly, “You don’t have to come to the company anymore. Tian Chen can’t afford to raise a talent like you!”","Jiang Yao’s shoulders sank as if he had been struck by lightning.","However, Lu Zhi did not pity him. He glanced at him and said in a distant tone, “Since you’re always worried that your sister will be wronged, I’ll give you a chance to stay at home and watch over her.”","He raised his hand and instructed the bodyguard to push the wheelchair without waiting for Jiang Yao’s reaction.","Qiao Nian had no intention of interfering and followed him in.","Her back view was as low-key as ever, but this time, it was like a loud slap to the faces of the Jiang family.","The slap was so loud!","...","After both of them had disappeared.","Jiang Xianrou finally found her voice. She came back to her senses and grabbed Jiang Yao’s arm in disbelief. “Brother, what does CEO Lu mean? He...”","“I was fired.” Jiang Yao’s voice was heavy, and the wall of his throat was as sharp as sand.","Every word he spoke seemed to crush him.","Jiang Xianrou looked in the direction Qiao Nian and Lu Zhi had just left in shock. Then, she looked at Jiang Yao, unwilling to accept this outcome.","“How, how could this be? Brother, are you mistaken?”","“...” Jiang Yao didn’t want to speak. Or rather, he couldn’t take his mind off what had just happened.","Jiang Zongnan also revealed a shocked and anxious expression when he heard Jiang Yao’s words. “Yes, Yao’er, are you mistaken? CEO Lu might not have such intentions.","“You didn’t do much.” He was distraught. “I’ll explain it to him.”","Jiang Yao blocked his path and looked at him with an ashen face. “Dad, who do you think Lu Zhi is? Don’t provoke him. He’s not someone we can afford to offend.”","He wanted to tell Jiang Zongnan about the illegal district in detail, but there were too many people around, so he didn’t dare to talk about it in public.","Jiang Yao was very patient. “In short, Lu Zhi is not as simple as you think. He’s temperamental. It’s fine if you don’t look for him, but if you do, things will only become worse.”","“But...”","Jiang Yao held his forehead and said with a splitting headache, “Don’t be anxious. I’ll think of a way. I’ll discuss it with Young Master Xu later.”"]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 Nothing But Regret","paragraphs":["1454 Nothing But Regret","At this moment, Jiang Xianrou mentioned Qiao Nian. “I think Qiao Nian has a good relationship with him. Just now, she could have settled it with just a few words, but she didn’t say anything.”","Jiang Yao didn’t say anything. He knew very well why Qiao Nian didn’t speak up for him.","They were the ones who had been heartless first. Without any evidence, they asked her why she was at the Imperial Mansion. He had no face to blame Qiao Nian for not speaking up for him.","Jiang Yao exhaled and said in a low voice, “It’s not her fault. I’ll think of another way.”","!!","Jiang Xianrou wanted to say something else.","Seeing that Jiang Yao did not want to mention it again, she could only suppress the frustration in her heart. Her expression was not good.","Qiao Nian had come to the Imperial Mansion to eat with someone. Who had broken her things?","...","With such a farce happening midway, everyone was a little distracted.","Jiang Zongnan arranged for the guests to go in.","The two colleagues that Jiang Yao invited had personally witnessed Jiang Yao offend the big boss. Without any hesitation, they immediately found an excuse to leave, unwilling to give him face anymore.","Jiang Zongnan also knew that it was impossible for them to keep them under such circumstances.","Instead of asking them to stay, he might as well be polite and let them leave with some dignity.","He didn’t persuade Jiang Yao’s two colleagues to stay. He sent them to the door and returned. His heart was already in a mess, and he was so vexed by the sudden situation that his head hurt.","The Jiang family’s aunt, Yuan Qing, even grabbed him to ask about the situation just now. “Second Brother, who was that person just now? What’s going on? Is he Jiang Yao’s boss? How does Qiao Nian know him? You said that Jiang Yao was fired just now. Is that true?”","Jiang Zongnan was about to be annoyed to death. He pulled a long face and looked at her solemnly. “Aunt, what exactly do you want to ask?”","Yuan Qing let go of his hand in embarrassment. “It’s nothing. I’m just curious how Qiao Nian knows Jiang Yao’s boss. I heard that Jiang Yao’s boss is an extraordinary figure. Qiao Nian has always lived in Rao City and has never even been to Beijing. How could she know such a person?”","“I don’t know,” Jiang Zongnan answered her expressionlessly. “In short, things are as you see them. I’m not sure about the rest. It’s useless for you to ask me.”","Yuan Qing was speechless.","“I still have to greet the guests. Please help yourself.” Jiang Zongnan did not want to waste time with her and hurried in.","Yuan Qing watched him leave in a hurry with a sinking heart. “How do you think Qiao Nian knows such a person? Hasn’t the eldest branch always been inferior to the second branch?”","There was only her eldest son behind her. The eldest son shook his head and still did not know anything. “All the relatives think that the eldest branch’s family can’t do it.”","“Do you remember Jiang Yao’s reaction? You can tell that the other party has an extraordinary status. The Jiang family is definitely not on the same level as her.” After Yuan Qing finished speaking, her heart became heavier. She said to her son regretfully, “Do you think I’m too anxious? Why do I feel that I’ve chosen the wrong side? Jiang Xianrou is not as good as that Qiao Nian?”","Her eldest son was silent for a few seconds. After a long time, he comforted her. “Mom, you’re thinking too much. It was just an accident. Didn’t Jiang Yao say that we can still use our connections? I heard from my cousin-in-law that the Pharmacy Association will come to congratulate us later. Only a few people left...”","Yuan Qing frowned and tightened her grip on her walking stick. “Are you talking about the Pharmacy Association?”","Her mind raced. In fact, she still regretted going too far. Her face turned green. “... I hope so. I hope we picked the right side.”","But she already felt that she had chosen the wrong side."]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 You Won’t Get Me Into Trouble, Will You?","paragraphs":["1455 You Won’t Get Me Into Trouble, Will You?","In the reception hall on the first floor.","Tang Wanru was talking to Qi Yan. Only when Qi Lanyin returned did she find an opportunity to stand up elegantly and smile at Qi Yan. “I’m going to the washroom.”","“Alright, go ahead.” Qi Yan placed her bag on her lap and smiled politely.","Tang Wanru left in a hurry.","!!","Qi Yan immediately stopped smiling. She frowned and looked at Qi Lanyin and asked coldly, “Why did you take so long? What happened outside? I think there’s something wrong with the Jiang family’s reaction.”","“You know them, Aunt. But I don’t know them. It’s no fun for me to come in, so I walked around outside for a while and got some fresh air.”","Qi Lanyin sat down beside her and continued calmly, “As for what happened outside, I’m not sure. I saw a large group of people outside when I came back. It was noisy, as if they were all relatives of the Jiang family. I didn’t go over to join in the fun.”","Qi Yan observed her. Seeing that her expression was calm and did not seem to have caused trouble for her, she heaved a sigh of relief. “It’s good that you didn’t cause trouble.”","Qi Lanyin was indignant and frustrated. “Aunt, what can I do?”","Qi Yan found a mirror and lipstick in her bag. After touching up her makeup, she put the lipstick and mirror back and looked at her sharply. She said, “I know you’re not satisfied that I gave the spot to Jiang Xianrou but not to you.”","Qi Lanyin’s back stiffened and her expression turned ugly when she heard that.","“You got that spot through your relationship with the Pharmacy Association. You can give that spot to whoever you want. I don’t blame you for this...”","Although she said that she did not blame Qi Yan, her hands on her lap were clenched into fists.","What kind of person was Qi Yan? She had long cultivated a pair of sharp eyes. At a glance, she could tell that Qi Lanyin was hiding her unwillingness to fight.","She sighed imperceptibly and patted Qi Lanyin’s shoulder. It was not appropriate to say too much to her. “I know you’re feeling uncomfortable. You’ve always been talented in medicine. I’ve discussed it with your father before, and I also wanted to give the Pharmacy Association’s spot to you. It’s just that there was an accident in the middle. You know that our family almost didn’t survive that period...”","Qi Lanyin lowered her head. “I know, Aunt. I don’t blame you or my father. It’s just that I wasn’t as good as her and lost to Qiao Nian in the medical competition. Otherwise, I could have entered the Pharmacy Association with my own abilities.”","“It’s good that you’ve thought it through.” Qi Yan’s eyes were filled with relief. She patted Qi Lanyin’s back and comforted her in a low voice, “Jiang Xianrou is inferior to you in every aspect, but we can only give her the spot in the Pharmacy Association. Her background is not as simple as you think. There are still many things you don’t know concerning this matter. I’ll tell you when I have the chance.","“Just remember not to mess with her. Try to get along with her. It’ll do you good.”","Qi Yan narrowed her eyes and said meaningfully, “This Jiang Xianrou will have a great future!”","Qi Lanyin looked up at her aunt and frowned. No matter how she thought about it, she couldn’t understand why her aunt valued this small Jiang family so much.","The Jiang family was inconspicuous in Beijing.","Not to mention that Jiang Xianrou had been expelled from the family by Old Master Jiang not long ago. She was only short of having a bad reputation in the upper circles of Beijing..."]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 So It Was Qi Lanyin","paragraphs":["1456 So It Was Qi Lanyin","Outside.","Tang Wanru finally found Jiang Xianrou and Jiang Yao.","She hurried over. “Xianrou, what happened? It’s almost 12. Why haven’t you changed?”","She saw a cleaner cleaning the floor not far away. Tang Wanru frowned and turned to look at Jiang Yao. She asked in a low voice, “Yao’er, what’s going on? What are they cleaning?”","“Someone ruined the Qi family’s gift.” Jiang Yao felt upset when he thought of the results of the police investigation. He looked up and said to Tang Wanru, who still didn’t know anything, “We just found an eyewitness.”","Tang Wanru frowned. “Since you found out who did it, why didn’t you arrest them?”","Jiang Xianrou’s face was ashen. She pinched her palms and did not want to speak.","Jiang Yao said on her behalf, “Someone saw Qi Lanyin sneak into the room where the gifts were placed. Not long after she entered, that person heard the sound of something being smashed.”","“You said Qi Lanyin broke Xianrou’s...” Tang Wanru looked shocked.","Jiang Yao’s heart was heavy as he nodded. “That person didn’t want to cause trouble. He heard the commotion but didn’t go in to take a look. He wouldn’t have said anything if the police hadn’t come to investigate.”","Before the police found any witnesses, they refused to let go of Qiao Nian, saying that she was the one who had damaged the item.","Now the facts were before him.","This matter had nothing to do with Qiao Nian at all!","Jiang Yao was extremely frustrated when he thought of what had happened half an hour ago. He regretted being too impulsive.","Before he could figure things out, he heard his aunt’s words and suspected Qiao Nian. In the end, he realized that his previous actions were no different from a farce.","“Mom, Qi Lanyin is a member of the Qi family. How should we deal with this matter?” Jiang Yao definitely wanted Qi Yan to know what Qi Lanyin had done.","Tang Wanru frowned and seemed to have other considerations. She said, “Don’t worry about this for now. Tell your father not to tell anyone for the time being. I’ll take care of it.”","“Aren’t we being too easy on her by doing this!” Jiang Yao didn’t agree with this way of handling things.","Previously, Jiang Xianrou had even suggested calling the police when she thought Qiao Nian was the culprit.","Now that they knew that the culprit was Qi Lanyin, it was too much to cover up the matter.","“Listen to me. I’ll handle it.” Tang Wanru’s attitude was firm. She didn’t want to discuss it with Jiang Yao.","After she finished speaking, she looked at Jiang Xianrou. Seeing her pale face and embarrassed expression, her eyes were filled with heartache.","She walked over and patted her arm. “Xianrou, don’t be sad. Qi Lanyin is only doing this in private because she’s jealous of you entering the Pharmacy Association. It’s useless no matter how much trouble she makes. You’re the one who entered the Pharmacy Association, not her! Alright, quickly go and change your clothes. President Luo from the Pharmacy Association will be here soon. President Luo is usually by Dean Zhong’s side. He’s Elder Zhong’s personal disciple and has a special status in the Pharmacy Association. His status is not lower than the Qi family... No matter what, let’s finish your filiation banquet first.”","“Yes.” Jiang Xianrou clenched her fists tightly and barely responded.","Tang Wanru’s heart ached even more. She helped her adjust her collar before saying softly, “Don’t worry. As long as you perform well, neither Qi Lanyin nor Qiao Nian will be able to surpass you in the future!”","Jiang Xianrou bit her lip. She was still in a bad mood and didn’t even respond this time."]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 Sister Nian Might Not Even Meet the Person You’re Climbing For","paragraphs":["1457 Sister Nian Might Not Even Meet the Person You’re Climbing For","Tang Wanru knew that she must still be thinking about the fact that her greeting gift had been broken. She added, “I’m telling you the truth. I’m not lying to you.","“As long as you enter the Pharmacy Association, your future development won’t be worse than theirs. Qi Lanyin secretly broke your things because she’s jealous of you entering the Pharmacy Association.","“And Qiao Nian.” At the mention of Qiao Nian, her expression was filled with disgust and jealousy. “She won first place in the medical competition. So what if she won glory for the country in a world-class competition? She won’t even be able to touch the door of the Pharmacy Association!”","Jiang Xianrou’s mood finally eased a lot. The sinister look in her beautiful eyes faded, and the corners of her mouth curled up again. “I understand. I’ll perform well in front of the people from the Pharmacy Association.”","Tang Wanru placed her hand on her shoulder and smiled. “It’s good that you’ve thought it through. The Qi family is just your stepping stone. The Pharmacy Association is where you can truly display your abilities.","“Mom believes you.”","...","On the other side.","The dishes that Lu Zhi ordered were basically all served.","Embroidered balls of dried scallops, stir-fried chicken with pearls, sliced fish with milk sauce, golden hand rolls... A dazzling array of dishes filled the table.","Jian Jin saw the table full of dishes and couldn’t help but look at the young man sitting opposite her. She clicked her tongue and asked, “Boss Lu, you didn’t order every dish on the menu, did you?”","Lu Zhi looked down and picked up his chopsticks. He said calmly, “I don’t know what you like to eat.”","“You don’t know what Qiao likes to eat, do you? I’m just a ribbon-cutter.”","Jian Jin scanned the table full of dishes and sighed silently.","In a way, Lu Zhi was also a talent.","She took a look. There were so many dishes on the table, but they perfectly avoided what Qiao liked to eat. They were all light dishes.","How could his flattery compare to that person from the Ye family?","Qiao Nian acted as if nothing had happened. It was as if she had no objections to Lu Zhi’s orders. She grabbed her chopsticks and picked up a dish to try.","Then, she put down her chopsticks, looked up, and gave Lu Zhi an affirmative look. “Not bad.”","Jian Jin was speechless.","As expected, Lu Zhi lowered his long eyelashes and said in a good mood, “If you like it, I’ll order more next time.”","“These are enough.” Qiao Nian picked up the teacup beside her and took a sip of tea. Her body honestly didn’t touch her chopsticks. “My appetite is average. It’s a waste to order too much.”","Her phone vibrated on the table as they spoke.","Qiao Nian placed the teacup on the table and picked up her phone with one hand. She leaned back and opened the message.","[You’re in Beijing?]","[QN:?]","Qiao Nian sent a question mark.","The phone she’d put down vibrated again.","Qiao Nian picked it up again and looked down.","The other party had replied to her.","[My apprentice also went to Beijing. His name is Robert. I asked him to bring you something. Do you have time? If you do, meet him.]","Qiao Nian frowned and lowered her head to play with her phone. Her fair neckline was very eye-catching.","She typed quickly.","[QN: What is it?]","This time, she had learned her lesson. The other party was probably replying to her message on his phone. She might as well lean back in her seat and see what the other party said.","The message came back within a minute.","[Some ancient recipe.]","[I found it in the Association’s library. I figured you’d like it, so I asked him to bring it to you.]"]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 Sister Nian: When Are You Leaving?","paragraphs":["1458 Sister Nian: When Are You Leaving?","An ancient recipe of the Pharmacy Association?","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, her interest piqued. She replied, “I don’t have time now. I can do it another day.”","The other immediately returned to her.","[By the way, Robert saw the notes you left in the library. There are some things he doesn’t understand, and I don’t know much about ancient Chinese medicine recipes. I can’t explain them to him. If you have time, can you show him?]","Qiao Nian didn’t mind. She replied instantly.","[QN: OK, ask him to find me.]","After sending the last message.","Qiao Nian put away her phone and finally had the time to look at Lu Zhi. “When are you going back?”","Lu Zhi looked a little dispirited. He raised his good-looking eyes and looked at her. “Do you want me to leave so badly?”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian pondered for a moment, then turned her head as if she was seriously considering his question. After a long while, she looked at him and said lazily, “As long as you stay in Beijing, the eyes of the people in the illegal district will be focused here. I’m still studying. I don’t want to cause trouble.”","Lu Zhi mimicked a parrot and stared at her with his dark eyes. “...You’re still studying and don’t want to cause trouble?”","She could actually say such a thing.","Qiao Nian pulled up her cap, revealing an exquisite face beneath. Her eyes were sparkling, and she was extremely shameless. “Yes, I’m studying in Qing University, the Chinese Medicine Faculty.”","She even crossed her legs, not at all looking like a good student.","Lu Zhi liked to see her relaxed form. His thin lips curled up as he said, “You had a lot of trouble before I came.”","“You’re right to say that.” Qiao Nian admitted it openly. Then, she looked at him frankly. “But I’m sure that if you don’t leave, I’ll have more trouble in the future.”","She spoke in that devil-may-care tone that suggested she was only joking.","But Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. She was actually quite serious.","It wasn’t that she wanted Lu Zhi to go back. It was mainly because he was not like Jian Jin. He was unpredictable and did things based on his mood.","She had yet to explain the bracelet Lu Zhi gave her to Ye Wangchuan and Qin Si.","If Boss Lu’s brain short-circuited again one day and sent her the latest weapon...","She was afraid the police would come to her door.","Lu Zhi had known her for 10 years. He knew very well how lazy Qiao Nian was and how much she didn’t want to deal with troublesome matters.","“I’ll leave tomorrow.”","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow, her expression asking why he was so straightforward this time.","Lu Zhi had some internal injuries, but he had never revealed his true emotions on his face.","His eyes were dark and bright, and there was a smile on his lips. He smiled faintly and said, “Tian Chen has some important matters. I have to go back and deal with them. Are you free tomorrow?”","Before Qiao Nian could speak, she picked up her teacup, wondering if she would be free tomorrow.","“Don’t say that you’re so busy that you don’t even have time to send me off.” Lu Zhi looked at the girl’s side profile. “I’ll leave at nine tomorrow morning. I’ll send you the address later.”","He certainly wasn’t going to take a plane back to the illegal district. It was too dangerous for him to hang around with passengers in his position, and it wouldn’t be easy for him to get an entry and exit permit.","He would definitely use his private jet to get back.","“When and from where” was also a secret.","Qiao Nian swirled the glass for a while. Tired of playing with it, she placed the glass on the table and said arrogantly, “Alright, I’ll send you off tomorrow.”"]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 God Q, Hello","paragraphs":["1459 God Q, Hello","Qiao Nian left after lunch.","Rhine Apartments was pretty quiet today.","Ye Wangchuan wasn’t at home, and neither was Gu San.","The two of them weren’t at home, and Qin Si and the others didn’t come over either. No one was chattering by her ear. Qiao Nian was happy to be free.","She opened the refrigerator door, grabbed a bottle of mineral water, and headed up to the second floor.","The second-floor room was pleasantly sunny, and the brilliant sun shone through the French windows onto the floor, giving it a golden sheen.","After Qiao Nian returned to her room, she took a shower and changed into a fresh set of home clothes. Then, she pulled out a chair from the desk and sat cross-legged on it before turning on her laptop.","The computer booted up instantly.","She was in no hurry.","She unscrewed the water beside the table, loosened the cap on the bottle, and logged into QQ unhurriedly.","She rarely used QQ and usually hung it on her phone.","A notice popped up when someone at QQ sent a new message.","After she logged into QQ, about three minutes later, sure enough, a verification message flashed.","Qiao Nian took a sip of water and set it aside. With one hand, she clicked on the small loudspeaker in the corner of the computer.","In the verification message column, the other party obediently filled in the verification words—”Hello, God Q.”","“Tsk!”","Qiao Nian’s slender fingers tapped twice on the mouse. Her bright eyes narrowed lazily as she looked at the other party’s request.","[Hello, God Q. I’m one of your students introduced by Dean Zhong. My name is Robert.]","Qiao Nian had heard this name before.","The famous Chief Luo of the Pharmacy Association, Dean Zhong’s pride.","The other party’s status in the Pharmacy Association was quite high. At the very least, it was not something that a new student like Jiang Xianrou could compare to.","But she had long since left the Pharmacy Association and had no interest in such things.","Qiao Nian’s dark eyelashes covered her bright eyes as her fair fingers tapped on the keyboard.","[You have something to ask me?]","After Qiao Nian sent the message, there was no reply for the time being. The other party was probably busy with something and couldn’t look at his phone immediately.","She was in no hurry. After sitting at the computer desk and playing a little game, the QQ message popped up.","It wasn’t a message from Robert.","It was Wen Ruxia, who had not appeared for a long time.","Qiao Nian switched off the game and leaned back in her chair. Her arm hung in the air as she opened Wen Ruxia’s message.","[Nian Nian, do you remember what you promised me?]","Qiao Nian was stunned for a few seconds.","Wen Ruxia sent another message.","[You promised me that you’d help with an MV. The director is already here. When are you free tomorrow?]","Ah, that MV.","Only then did Qiao Nian remember her promise. She immediately felt a headache coming on.","Tomorrow?","She had promised Lu Zhi that she would send him off tomorrow.","Time had collided.","Qiao Nian was thinking about how to balance things out when Robert sent her a message.","Her QQ notification beeped twice.","Qiao Nian supported her hand and waited to see what he had to say.","After clicking on it—","[Well, I found the notes you left in the library. There are a few things I don’t quite understand, God Q. Are you free tomorrow? The dean also instructed me to give them to you.]","Tomorrow again!","Qiao Nian suspected that they had all arranged to meet in private tomorrow.","It was impossible for her to attend three appointments at the same time tomorrow.","Thinking she wasn’t online, Wen Ruxia sent another emoticon. “Are you there?” flashed above the head of a chipmunk."]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 The Appeal","paragraphs":["1460 The Appeal","After a moment of thought, Qiao Nian replied, [I’m free after 10 tomorrow. How is it?]","Then, she replied to Robert.","[Not tomorrow. Maybe the day after!]","...","G Electric’s headquarters.","After Wen Ruxia sent Qiao Nian the message, someone immediately knocked on the door.","She saw Qiao Nian’s QQ light up. Qiao Nian didn’t seem to be around, so she didn’t reply to her message for the time being.","She pushed her swivel chair back and took her hands off the table. “Come in,” she said casually.","Outside.","Wen Ruxia’s assistant entered and carefully placed a folder on her desk. “Manager Wen, this is the preliminary plan for the variety show reported by the planning department for this quarter. Please take a look at it.”","“Hmm.” Wen Ruxia picked up the folder and flipped it open.","She read quickly.","After all, every TV station had to come up with quite a few variety shows every year. There were different types of variety shows, but the bottom line was the same—celebrities.","It depended on who invited more celebrities and whose celebrities were more popular.","She wasn’t in charge of variety shows and she had a high background. She wasn’t particularly interested in these small shows.","Wen Ruxia skimmed through it and realized that the preliminary proposal for the variety show submitted by the planning department this season was similar to the previous ones.","The invitees were much the same.","The male celebrities invited included Duan Lei.","The name she saw the most was Bai Lin, one of the most popular female celebrities.","Bai Lin had a backing. She had been popular since her debut. After becoming popular through an online drama, she was now in the limelight in the entertainment industry.","Not long ago, she had single-handedly tied Jiang Li up and created a neighborhood couple.","Because the man was handsome and the woman was beautiful, this CP also attracted a lot of CP fans. Wen Ruxia had more or less heard some rumors that such a CP existed.","Except she wasn’t much interested in any of that.","Jiang Li’s career in the entertainment industry did not mean that he had to rely on it like everyone else.","No matter what, the Jiang family had Old Master Jiang. Jiang Li had a lot of fun in the entertainment circle. If he didn’t want to play, he could choose to leave the circle at any time. After leaving the circle, he could do whatever he wanted.","Neighborhood CP.","It was just a marketing tactic by the weaker party.","Wen Ruxia’s gaze swept past Bai Lin’s name. She picked up her fountain pen from the pen holder and signed her name.","Then, she handed the folder to her assistant. “Take this to the planning department.”","“OK.”","The assistant was about to go out with the folder when he remembered something. She stopped and turned back to her. “Ah, Manager Wen, there’s something else.”","“?”","Wen Ruxia frowned slightly and listened to her patiently. “What else?”","The assistant didn’t dare to beat around the bush and told her everything in detail. “After Director George Lucas’s plane landed, Bai Lin went to the airport to pick him up. Now, many people on the Internet are saying that Bai Lin is the female lead of this MV promotional video and wants to combine with Jiang Li to film it. Some of the CP fans are already in a frenzy and even created a super hot topic on Weibo...”","Wen Ruxia originally thought that she was talking about trivial matters again. Hearing this, she slammed the teacup on the table, her capable eyes filled with anger. “She ran to the airport to pick him up? She even got the paparazzi to wait there and take photos?","“I don’t know if the paparazzi at the airport were hired by them, but Bai Lin did go to pick him up.”"]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 If She Wanted to Compete, She Would Have to See Who Was Competing","paragraphs":["1461 If She Wanted to Compete, She Would Have to See Who Was Competing","When Wen Ruxia’s assistant mentioned this, her tone was a little heavy. It was obvious that she looked down on the other party’s publicity stunt.","“Apparently, she had a nice chat with Director Lucas at the airport. A lot of people saw it.”","Wen Ruxia’s mind tightened. Her temples throbbed. She pressed her fingers to them. Her brain was still cold with anger.","She’d always known that actresses in the entertainment industry pulled a lot of strings.","However, she didn’t expect that someone would dare to play this trick on her. Did Bai Lin not know that she already had a female lead in mind?","She actually thought of using online public opinion to pressure her.","Neighborhood CP, ha!","The other party thought that the entertainment industry was omnipotent after getting a dividend from the CP!","“Just now, Bai Lin’s manager came to look for you. I stopped her outside. She asked me to pass on her apology and even said that it was an accident. Bai Lin and Director Lucas met at an award ceremony previously. Coincidentally, Bai Lin was going to pick someone up at the airport today and bumped into him. She went over to greet him out of courtesy. She didn’t expect to be photographed by someone and posted online...”","“I understand.”","Wen Ruxia didn’t want to hear any more. Her spirits plummeted.","Just as her brows were shrouded in malicious anger and she was about to flare up, her QQ rang twice.","Wen Ruxia’s attention was immediately drawn to it.","As expected, Qiao Nian replied.","Wen Ruxia’s furrowed brows relaxed again when she saw the message on QQ. She quickly arranged a time with Qiao Nian and looked up. Her sharp eyes narrowed slightly as she said to her assistant unhurriedly, “Leave them alone for now. Don’t bother with them.”","The other party was creating hype and had her agent come knocking on her door to apologize.","She just wanted to have this resource.","She wanted to restrain her with such a despicable method? Why didn’t she look in the mirror to see if she was worthy?!","The assistant didn’t quite understand her and looked over. “Aren’t we going to do anything about it, Manager Wen?”","“Don’t worry about it.” Wen Ruxia waved her hand, capable and domineering. “Some people think that by taking a few photos and attracting a few children who haven’t grown up to be fans, they think they’re shining.","“She’ll know what it means to be ‘self-conscious and defeated’ when she sees someone who really shines!”","Qiao Nian had agreed to shoot the MV. She could imagine the results after the MV was released.","Bai Lin?","A popular actress?","Heh, if she wanted to compete, she had to see who she was competing with.","...","The next day.","The Jiang family.","Jiang Yao did not sleep the entire night. He called Xu Jishen at dawn.","Yesterday, Xu Jishen seemed to have something on and did not pick up his call all day.","Today, however, the call went through.","Jiang Yao had something on his mind. As soon as the call went through, he immediately said, “Hello, Young Master Xu. Are you free? I need your help with something.”","Yesterday, Su Huaiyuan’s cold turned into a fever and he had an IV drip in the hospital.","After Su Huaiyuan lost the entire night, Xu Jishen stayed in the hospital.","He had not slept all night and received a call from Jiang Yao early in the morning. He was exhausted, and his voice was hoarse and tired. “Tell me.”","Jiang Yao briefly told him what had happened yesterday. Then, he asked him, “Young Master Xu, can you help me tell Andre to contact me?”","Xu Jishen was stunned after hearing what he had done in the Imperial Mansion yesterday.","After his surprise, he was silent for a moment before answering, “Why are you looking for Andre? Don’t tell me you still want to see CEO Lu?”"]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 It’s Useless to Find Lu Zhi, I Can Only Beg Qiao Nian","paragraphs":["1462 It’s Useless to Find Lu Zhi, I Can Only Beg Qiao Nian","Jiang Yao didn’t say it directly. He only said, “Young Master Xu, help me tell Andre to contact me. I’m looking for him on the intranet of Tian Chen, but he ignored me. You’re close to Andre, so he’ll definitely help you.”","“Jiang Yao, you haven’t figured it out. It’s not a matter of whether I’m willing to help or not!” Xu Jishen interrupted him. “You still haven’t figured out where you went wrong!”","Jiang Yao frowned fiercely.","Xu Jishen didn’t give him any face and said bluntly, “I told you before that your cousin isn’t simple. Look at the people around her. Young Master Ye, Young Master Qin, Jian Jin... and now CEO Lu. You might not even know these people! She’s just a high school student from Rao City, but she knows these people. Look at the way these people treat her. Do you really think that she only hangs around them because she’s good-looking?”","Jiang Yao couldn’t help but think of the back view he and his father had seen at the hotel.","Lu Zhi’s bodyguards were also there.","What did the bodyguard say?","“That person is one of Tian Chen’s founders.”","That back view was extremely similar to Qiao Nian’s!","“You think you’ve offended CEO Lu, but that’s not the case. The person you’ve offended has always been your cousin!”","Xu Jishen was still talking to him.","“So, Jiang Yao, it’s useless for you to look for CEO Lu. I’ll help you get through to Andre, but the outcome will still be the same. As a friend, let me tell you the truth. If you don’t want to leave Tian Chen, you’d better find your cousin and talk to her.","“She’s not a cold-hearted person. I think she’s very good to your grandfather and uncle. If you hadn’t kept provoking her, she probably would have left you alone.”","Jiang Yao himself knew that he had gone overboard yesterday.","However, Xu Jishen was asking him to lower his head to Qiao Nian. He couldn’t bring himself to do so.","“You said that she wasn’t the one who broke your sister’s things. Since you two know she didn’t break anything, have you apologized to her afterward?”","Xu Jishen roughly understood why he didn’t look for Qiao Nian. He said persuasively, “Think about it carefully. If I were you, I would apologize to her openly and not be so biased in the future. Both of them are your sisters, why do you have to be so prejudiced against Qiao Nian?”","Jiang Yao pursed his lips and didn’t say anything for a long time.","Before he had met Qiao Nian, he had already had a bad impression of her. Naturally, he didn’t like her in person.","However, he was indeed in the wrong yesterday. Xu Jishen was right. After they found out the truth, no one apologized to Qiao Nian. This wasn’t good.","“I understand.”","Jiang Yao was still considering it, mainly because he couldn’t find her even if he wanted to apologize.","Qiao Nian didn’t answer his call at all. It was harder than ascending to heaven for him to find her.","Xu Jishen sighed heavily. “You, you’re just blinded by her appearance. I think you don’t understand her as well as Jiang Li does.”","Jiang Xianrou looked talented and dignified, but in fact, she couldn’t tolerate anyone. She was also petty and would not achieve much in the future.","On the other hand, Qiao Nian, whom the Jiang family had found, kept a low profile and hid her background.","Jiang Yao was blinded and couldn’t see clearly. Otherwise, why would he keep fighting with Qiao Nian over Jiang Xianrou, pushing Qiao Nian away step by step...","It was probably not that easy to get some people back after pushing them far away!"]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 Xianrou, Have You Packed Your Things?","paragraphs":["1463 Xianrou, Have You Packed Your Things?","Jiang Yao had grown up hearing his mother say, “Jiang Li is disappointing. Don’t learn from him.”","This was the first time he had heard anyone say that he was inferior to Jiang Li.","Jiang Yao couldn’t describe his complicated feelings. He suppressed his eyebrows and said, “Young Master Xu, help me greet Old Master Su and ask him to take care of himself.”","“Yes, I’ll talk to my grandfather.” Xu Jishen still had something to say, but he could tell from the other end that Jiang Yao was unwilling to listen.","His own house was in a mess, and he didn’t want to meddle in other people’s affairs. In addition, they didn’t like to hear it, and he couldn’t be bothered to be a good person for nothing, so he stopped talking. “The nurse called me. I’m hanging up.”","“Okay.” Jiang Yao was very polite. “Bye.”","“Bye.”","Xu Jishen hung up. He did seem very busy.","Jiang Yao heard the busy tone on the other end of the phone. He slowly put the phone down and lowered his eyes. He remembered that Xu Jishen had asked him to look for Qiao Nian. He felt a headache coming on.","Jiang Yao was turning back to the living room with his phone when he looked up and saw Jiang Xianrou coming downstairs.","“Brother, good morning.” Jiang Xianrou was wearing a long yellow dress. Her hair was tied into an exquisite ponytail, and her oval face was fair and lustrous.","She smiled and looked gentle and sensible as she greeted him.","Jiang Yao’s anxious heart seemed to have been injected with a trace of coolness. He was not as uncomfortable now.","He walked into the living room, put his phone on the table, and nodded at the girl coming down the stairs. “Yeah. You’re up?”","“I just woke up. I heard someone talking downstairs, so I came down to take a look.” Jiang Xianrou staggered downstairs and walked to the fridge, opened it, and took out a bottle of milk.","She opened the bottle and took a sip gracefully. Then, she looked at Jiang Yao and saw that he was frowning as if something was bothering him.","She walked over again and asked with concern, “Brother, who were you speaking with?”","Jiang Yao didn’t have time to answer her.","Jiang Xianrou lowered her eyelashes again and asked very demurely, “Young Master Xu?”","They had a good relationship since they were young. Jiang Yao basically did not hide anything from her.","Since Jiang Xianrou had asked him, he sat down on the sofa and nodded. “Yes, I couldn’t get through to him yesterday, so I called him again this morning.","“Did I speak too loudly and wake you?” His handsome, cultured face was apologetic.","“No, it was the alarm that woke me up this morning.” Jiang Xianrou shook her head and looked at him with her beautiful eyes. She hesitated and asked, “Brother, did the matter with Tian Chen not go smoothly?”","She saw Jiang Yao holding his forehead with his hand a few times. He seemed to have a headache and looked pale.","She guessed that Xu Jishen was unwilling to help.","Jiang Yao’s handsome face was shrouded in a faint sinister expression. He didn’t say much to her. “Don’t worry about this. I’ll handle this matter.”","Jiang Xianrou could tell from his tone that things were not as simple as she had imagined.","She opened her mouth to mention Qiao Nian, but Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru came out of their bedroom at this moment.","Jiang Zongnan had already changed into a suit. Tang Wanru was still wearing her pajamas and tying his tie. Seeing Jiang Xianrou in the living room, her eyes were filled with joy. “Xianrou, have you packed your things?”","Jiang Xianrou smiled implicitly. “I did a simple packing last night and only packed the daily necessities. I haven’t had the time to pack my clothes yet.”"]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 Leaving for the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["1464 Leaving for the Pharmacy Association","“Oh, then you have to pack quickly.” Tang Wanru was very concerned and asked her, “Do you want Mom to help you?”","“Mom, there’s no need. I’ll pack up by myself.” Jiang Xianrou was obviously in a good mood when she mentioned this. She smiled and said, “Aren’t we leaving for the Pharmacy Association the day after tomorrow? There are still two days left. I can still pack up slowly.”","Jiang Yao was busy greeting guests yesterday and did not know that Jiang Xianrou was going to the Pharmacy Association.","Hearing this, his eyes lit up. He looked at Jiang Xianrou and said, “You’re going to the Pharmacy Association?”","“Yes.” Jiang Xianrou lowered her head as if she was embarrassed. She said humbly, “I’m going to report to the Pharmacy Association. Mom and Godmother will accompany me. We’ll go back with Chief Robert from the Pharmacy Association. We originally agreed to leave tomorrow, but the Chief has something on tomorrow and changed his schedule at the last minute. We’ll leave the day after tomorrow.”","“That’s a good thing.” Jiang Yao was quite happy for her.","Jiang Xianrou was quite happy herself. She couldn’t hide her smugness. However, she knew how to restrain her emotions better than before and did not show them on her face.","Jiang Zongnan adjusted his tie and took out his wallet from his briefcase. He opened the wallet and took out a black card before handing it to Jiang Xianrou.","“Dad?”","He was calmer than Tang Wanru and Jiang Yao. He forced the bank card into Jiang Xianrou’s hand and reminded her gently, “You have to restrain your temper. Talk less and do more. Watch more and learn more. Don’t be so impulsive when doing things.”","Jiang Xianrou stood rooted to the ground, feeling touched. She tightened her grip on the bank card and said softly, “Yes.”","Jiang Zongnan patted her shoulder lovingly, then put down his hand and said to her, “You have to listen to your mother when you get there.","“The Pharmacy Association isn’t as simple as you think. There are too many powers there, and none of them are people we can afford to mess with.","“So, when you get to the Pharmacy Association, try to keep a low profile. Don’t mess with anyone there. Understand?”","“I understand.” Jiang Xianrou’s heart was filled with yearning for the Pharmacy Association. “Dad, don’t worry. I’ll contact you in the future.”","She had heard a little about the Pharmacy Association from Qi Yan. The Pharmacy Association was an independent party in Continent O. There were various forces in the world, and it was very chaotic.","However, no matter which faction it was, they all stopped fighting to maintain peace in the Pharmacy Association’s territory.","It was obvious how powerful the Pharmacy Association was.","How could Jiang Xianrou not yearn for such a place?!","She couldn’t wait to leave for Continent O tomorrow.","Unfortunately, Robert had told them at the last minute that he needed to stay in Beijing for another day.","Although Jiang Xianrou felt regretful, she could only stay for another day. A day would pass in the blink of an eye. She could afford to wait.","“Yes.” Jiang Zongnan nodded. His tensed jawline relaxed slightly. He looked at her again and said hesitantly, “There’s one more thing.”","Jiang Xianrou looked at him in confusion.","Jiang Zongnan let out a long sigh, and his shrewd eyes revealed a rare hint of fatigue. He said in a low voice, “Xianrou, try your best to find out if there’s any medicine that can extend your grandfather’s lifespan. Your grandfather’s health has been deteriorating for the past two years. I’m afraid he... won’t be able to last more than a few years.”","“Didn’t Qiao Nian buy him health supplements?” Jiang Xianrou turned her face away. After suppressing the unhappiness in her heart, she put on a straight face and said expressionlessly, “Dad, don’t worry! I’ll definitely ask Dean Zhong if I have the chance.”"]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 Miss Qiao Went Out Long Ago","paragraphs":["1465 Miss Qiao Went Out Long Ago","“As for the dean’s willingness to help, I can’t decide.","“You know, Dad, it wasn’t easy for me to get into the Pharmacy Association. A newbie doesn’t have the capital to ask for anything.”","Jiang Zongnan only wanted a promise from her. He wasn’t forcing her to do it.","He nodded immediately.","Nothing more was said.","He patted Jiang Xianrou’s shoulder silently again, then turned around and said to Tang Wanru, “I’m going to the company.”","Tang Wanru’s expression turned ugly when he asked Jiang Xianrou to ask for medicine for Old Master Jiang. However, she did not make it too obvious.","Forcing a smile, she ushered the man out of the house.","After sending Jiang Zongnan off, she would immediately return to help Jiang Xianrou pack her luggage...","...","On the other side.","At Rhine Apartments.","Lu Zhi’s flight was at nine, and Qiao Nian only woke up at 8:30.","After she got up, she brushed her teeth and washed her face unhurriedly. Then, she changed her clothes and found herself a brand new black baseball cap to wear.","When it was done.","Satisfied, she grabbed her purse, tossed her phone and tablet into it, and zipped it up.","Only then did she descend from the second floor.","In the living room.","Gu San had already prepared breakfast.","Seeing Qiao Nian come down, he greeted the girl happily, “Miss Qiao, good morning.”","“Morning.”","Qiao Nian slowly walked down the stairs and greeted him. Seeing the dazzling array of breakfast on the table, she pursed her lips and said, “I have something to do in the morning, so I’ll skip breakfast.”","Gu San was still holding a spatula and making fried eggs. He was stunned for a moment upon hearing that Qiao Nian wasn’t eating breakfast. He forgot to put the spatula back and followed her out when he regained his senses. “Miss Qiao, aren’t you eating breakfast?”","Qiao Nian had already changed her shoes at the entrance. She calmly put on her canvas shoes; the black canvas shoes made the girl’s legs look straight and long, especially eye-catching.","She tied her shoelaces and straightened her back, then picked up her bag and turned her head to answer him. “Yes. A friend is leaving, and I promised to send him off. I’m a little late, so I won’t eat breakfast. I’ll buy some bread outside later.”","Gu San was quite disappointed.","But he didn’t hesitate when he heard that Qiao Nian was going to send her friend off. He immediately put down the spatula and untied his apron. “Miss Qiao, wait for me. I’ll send you to the airport.”","Qiao Nian remembered that Lu Zhi wasn’t leaving from the airport, so she rejected Gu San’s good intentions. “No need. I’ll take a taxi there myself.”","She pulled down the brim of her cap, took out her earphones from her pocket, and stuffed them in her ears. Then, she waved at Gu San coolly, bowed, and opened the door.","Qiao Nian had been out for half an hour when the door to Ye Wangchuan’s bedroom opened. The man seemed to have not slept all night and had just come out. His hair hung down to cover his brow bones, revealing only a pair of heavily bloodshot eyes. It was obvious that he had stayed up late last night.","“Master Wang.” Gu San had already prepared a simple breakfast and placed it on the dining table.","Ye Wangchuan grunted and walked over to the table. He pulled out one of the chairs and sat down.","Upon seeing that only his cutlery was placed on the rectangular dining table, he paused in the act of picking up his glass of ice water. He placed the glass on the table and turned back to ask the busy green figure.","“Where’s Nian Nian? She’s not up yet?”","Gu San was picking up the magazines scattered on the sofa when he heard his question. “Ah, Miss Qiao? Miss Qiao woke up long ago. She’s already out.”"]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 Stirring the Popularity Onto Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1466 Stirring the Popularity Onto Sister Nian","“She went out?”","Ye Wangchuan picked up a slice of toast and glanced at the clock on the wall. It had just ticked to nine.","Usually, at this time, Qiao Nian would have just woken up or would still be asleep. She rarely went out before nine.","Gu San replied indifferently, “Yes, Miss Qiao left about half an hour. She said that a friend was leaving and she was going to send her friend off.”","He put away the magazines that Ye Wangchuan and the others had read and placed them neatly in the cabinet. After some thought, he said, “I said that I would drive Miss Qiao to the airport. She didn’t let me. She said that she would take a taxi.”","Ye Wangchuan grunted. He was handsome and did not seem to have much of a reaction.","However, after he finished a piece of bread, he suddenly said, “Lu Zhi is leaving Beijing today.”","Gu San: “?”","Ye Wangchuan took a sip of ice water and put down the cup. His sitting posture was very lazy and casual, as if he had just mentioned it casually.","“The Ninth Branch received news yesterday that Lu Zhi is leaving at nine in the morning.”","Gu San was speechless.","He thought about it. Miss Qiao had gone out at 8:30 in the morning and said she was going out to see a friend off.","Master Wang said that Lu Zhi would leave at nine.","The time was just right.","His mind seemed to have a flash of inspiration as a shocking thought flashed in his mind. Gu San opened his mouth slightly and revealed an incredulous expression. He looked at the young man sitting at the dining table in shock.","“Master Wang, you mean...”","Ye Wangchuan wiped the corner of his mouth elegantly with a piece of paper and raised his eyelids. He glanced at him and put his arm to the side with a rather lazy expression. “I was just saying.”","Gu San was speechless again.","But he let go of his rising heart.","Gu San patted his chest, still feeling a lingering fear.","He was scared to death.","He thought that Master Wang wanted to say that the friend Miss Qiao said was going to send off was the dangerous Lu Zhi from the illegal district.","Miss Qiao and Lu Zhi?","Gu San put their names together and couldn’t think of a place where they could meet.","He was completely relieved and grumbled. “Master Wang, can you not breathe so heavily next time? If you keep doing this to me, I’m afraid I’ll lose a few years of my life.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at him with a faint smile, as if he was looking at a fool.","Gu San felt extremely stifled by his teasing gaze. After some thought, he asked him with uncertainty, “Could the friend Miss Qiao is talking about really be Lu Zhi?”","After all, anything seemed possible if it was Big Boss Qiao.","Gu San felt that it was not entirely impossible.","“I don’t know.” Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened as he remembered the diamond bracelet Jian Jin had mailed before.","He took out his phone and glanced at the message on it. His gaze froze.","There was a topic at the top of the trending searches.","#Zhui Guang snatches roles, Bai Lin is tragically replaced","The word ‘explode’ followed the topic. It was pushed to the top early in the morning.","Most of the trending searches during this period were bought by celebrity companies.","In a meaningless topic, the top trending topic was obviously very eye-catching.","Ye Wangchuan’s handsome face was covered in a layer of frost. He pursed his thin lips and threw his phone on the table, then said to Gu San, “Call the people on Weibo and ask them to remove the top trending topic.”","Gu San picked up his phone and saw the top trending topic on Weibo. His eyelids twitched and he immediately went to do it without hesitation.","He didn’t know much about the entertainment industry and did not know who Bai Lin was.","However, he quite admired her. She had stirred up Miss Qiao.","Looked like she had had enough of the entertainment industry!"]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 Did You See Wrong? My Name’s Not on the Hot Search","paragraphs":["1467 Did You See Wrong? My Name’s Not on the Hot Search","The artiste-only lounge of Star Glory Entertainment.","A strikingly beautiful woman was sitting on a stool in front of a makeup mirror, arranging her hair with her hands.","The person beside her who was putting on makeup for her did not dare to breathe loudly as he quietly did the foundation work.","Bai Lin was a famous beauty in the entertainment industry.","Every time she was on the red carpet, it would be in the headlines.","However, the makeup artist knew that Bai Lin’s beauty relied on makeup. Her skin was not good.","She smoked and drank all year round, and her routine was irregular.","Her skin was dark yellow, her skin color was uneven, and there were often pimples on her T-zone.","Therefore, the makeup artist paid the most attention to her foundation. It was much easier once the foundation was done well.","“Your mocha. I make a point of having the clerk remove the fat and not add sugar.” The manager pushed into the room at that moment, carrying two cups of coffee.","She smiled and handed one of the cups of coffee to the young woman sitting in front of the dressing table with her legs crossed. She said gently, “Bai Lin, your trending topic has reached the top.”","The woman took the paper cup from her and raised her eyes haughtily, looking quite arrogant. “Really?”","“It’s normal for me to be first. After all, with my current popularity, I’ll be on the trending searches in no time as long as you do a good job in marketing any topic.”","Her manager was used to her tone and laughed a little. She put down the coffee bag and dug her phone out of her bag for her. “Take a look.”","“I see that you’re very popular this time. Everyone is interested in this topic. We’ll talk to Weibo later and ask them to hang your topic for a while longer. We’ll slowly reduce the popularity after the traffic peak from 12 PM to 2 PM...”","The manager said with a faint smile, “By then, there should be a reaction from Manager Wen!”","There were only so many resources in the circle. The investors had the final say.","In fact, the investors still had to look at the popularity.","How many times did an artist get to work with a famous director in her lifetime?","Moreover, George Lucas was a famous director among famous directors. As long as Bai Lin successfully co-operated this time, it would not be a dream for her to rise to fame.","Bai Lin could at least be in the entertainment industry for a year and a half without worrying about popularity.","“You’re one of the most popular female artistes in the industry now, and you’re famous for being good at skating. You even won an urban skating award in high school. Who knows what Manager Wen is thinking? She actually didn’t look for you for the MV this time...” Bai Lin’s manager felt a little uncomfortable when she mentioned this.","However, she had been in the circle for a long time and had more or less heard of Wen Ruxia’s background.","Since the other party did not give them face, they had no choice but to take this path.","They were certainly not going to let go of their chance with George Lucas!","They had to snatch it by any means!","“Sister Xin, are you mistaken? Where is my name on the trending searches on Weibo?”","At this moment, Bai Lin suddenly spoke in an unhappy tone.","Her manager, Zhao Xin, was stunned for a moment and immediately said, “That’s impossible. I saw you at the top of the trending searches just now. The questions after that were even more explosive.”","“See for yourself!”","Bai Lin pulled a long face unhappily and returned the phone to her.","“I don’t see my name on the trending searches.”","Zhao Xin frowned as she took the phone and immediately scrolled through the trending searches."]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 Crazy Face Slap","paragraphs":["1468 Crazy Face Slap","She flipped from first to 20th place. The topics on the trending searches were no different from what she had seen previously. The only difference was that the topic that was originally at the top of the search rankings had disappeared for no reason!","“What’s going on?!”","Zhao Xin had been in the circle for a long time, but this was the first time she had seen such a thing.","The top trending search had disappeared for no reason!","What was the difference between that and seeing a ghost in broad daylight?","Bai Lin threw the powder compact on the dressing table in frustration. It made a noise, and she complained, “How would I know? You’re my manager. You don’t even know, so how should I know?”","“No one contacted you on Weibo?” she asked her manager, forcing down her anger.","Zhao Xin had always been one of the most capable managers in the industry. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been hired by the person behind Bai Lin.","At this moment, she shook her head with a rare look of confusion and her face darkened. “No.”","There were usually only two situations when a trending topic on Weibo suddenly disappeared.","Either the artist removed the trending topic themselves... or the officials removed it.","However, before that could happen, according to the rules, the staff would contact the artistes.","To put it bluntly, the staff would tell the artiste in advance that they wanted to remove the trending topic for some reason.","This was the first time her manager had encountered such a situation where an A-list celebrity was removed from the trending searches without any notice.","“Are we in some kind of trouble?” She was one of the recognized managers in the industry, so she reacted quickly. She instinctively sensed that something was wrong and asked Bai Lin worriedly.","“What can happen to us?” Bai Lin felt that she was a little too nervous. She sneered and looked at herself in the mirror, then said confidently, “Sister Xin, you’re thinking too much. I reckon this is an accident. Hurry up and contact the Weibo staff and ask them what’s going on.","“The trending topic is gone. Tell them to put it up again.","“I’ve got a commercial to shoot later. I’m going to draw my eyebrows now. I can’t talk to you anymore.”","The manager saw that she was resting with her eyes closed and leaning back. The makeup artist started to draw her eyebrows. She immediately frowned and couldn’t find the right words to say.","Just then, her phone lit up.","Seeing who was calling, she took a deep breath, composed herself, and answered. “Hello, President Qin.”","She paused for a moment as the other party spoke.","Her expression changed and she subconsciously turned to look at the young woman still putting on makeup. Her eyelids kept twitching. “... President Qin, we’ve already signed the contract. I’m afraid it’s not appropriate for you to cancel it now. Our Bai Lin has already reserved the schedule for you.”","The person on the other end of the line seemed to give her face.","The manager looked even more embarrassed. “I know. It’s not about the breach of contract. I... Okay, I understand.”","She hung up and walked over to the young woman. She said hesitantly, “Bai Lin, the commercial shoot for this morning was canceled.”","Bai Lin’s eyes flew open and she stared at her in shock. “What?”","Her manager rubbed her forehead and looked like she had an even bigger headache than she did. “The advertisers just got in touch with me to say they’re replacing you. They’re not shooting the commercial.”","“They want to replace me?!” Bai Lin was not only shocked but also seemed to have suffered great humiliation. Her fair face turned red for a moment.","“They’re crazy, aren’t they?! I’ve been putting on makeup, and they’re talking about replacing me now. Do they know that they were the ones who asked for me before, I’m not the one who begged them!”"]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 Now I’m Afraid","paragraphs":["1469 Now I’m Afraid","The manager wasn’t in the mood to humor her.","As they spoke, her manager received several more calls.","They were all cancellations.","The manager’s face turned completely green.","She hung up the sixth call and turned off her phone. She couldn’t care less and urged Bai Lin anxiously, “Quickly call Young Master Fu and ask if we’ve offended anyone.”","“At this hour?” Bai Lin was a little hesitant. “He’ll be angry if I call at this hour.”","“My little ancestor, at a time like this, you’re still afraid that Young Master Fu will be angry!” Her manager’s tone was anxious and fast.","She simply explained their current situation to her.","“The rest of your schedule has been canceled, including all the TV shows and movies we talked about, and all the investors just called me about replacing you. If we don’t settle this, you’re pretty much half-canceled!”","Bai Lin finally knew fear. Her beautiful oval face was pale from fear, and her throat was dry. “How, how did this happen?”","Her manager looked at her nervously and said seriously, “We must have offended someone! As for who we have offended, I don’t know yet, but the person’s actions are definitely not as powerful as someone in the entertainment industry. We must have offended someone in Young Master Fu’s circle!","“Bai Lin, hurry up and call Young Master Fu. Ask Young Master Fu to help us ask who we have offended.” Zhao Xin was having a headache and was not very confident. “If Young Master Fu finds out who we have offended, we might be able to salvage the situation. Otherwise...”","She didn’t say what would happen.","However, Bai Lin had been in the entertainment industry for a few years now. She paled. She already understood what she meant—otherwise, she would be ruined.","She took a deep breath and no longer cared if Fu Sinian would be unhappy if she called him.","She grabbed the phone from the table and quickly found Fu Sinian’s number. She called anxiously, “Hello.”","...","In the boys’ dormitory at Qing University.","There were basically no classes for juniors.","Zhou Yang had just returned from the basketball court when he saw Fu Ge on the phone in the corridor outside the dormitory. His expression was quite ugly as he said something to the other party intensely.","As a man, he was not interested in listening to gossip in other people’s corners, so he didn’t pay attention to who Fu Ge was talking to.","He turned and opened the dormitory door.","There were not many classes in the third year. Some people who had houses in Beijing had basically moved out. Wen Ziyu didn’t move out and would occasionally come back to school.","He had returned to the dormitory yesterday and the group had eaten outside that night.","“Brothers, I’m back!”","Zhou Yang opened the door with a smile. When he walked in, he saw Wen Ziyu sitting at the bookcase playing with his computer. His notebook was open.","Zhou Yang put the basketball back and walked forward to take a look.","As expected, he was searching for news about Qiao Nian again.","Zhou Yang sympathized with him when he saw the name on Wen Ziyu’s computer page. He patted him on the shoulder and teased him. “Young Master Wen, are you looking at your goddess again so early in the morning? If you really like her, why don’t you go all out and chase her? What if you succeed?”","“Then my parents will break my legs and kick me out of the house,” Wen Ziyu said expressionlessly.","Zhou Yang was stunned for a moment. “Uncle and Auntie are so ruthless?”","He remembered that Wen Ziyu’s parents looked refined and polite. They didn’t put on airs at all. They were much better than Fu Ge’s parents.","Why did Young Master Wen make such a friendly couple sound so ferocious?"]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 Begging Wen Ziyu","paragraphs":["1470 Begging Wen Ziyu","“Hehe.” Wen Ziyu smiled without saying anything. He didn’t want to explain it too clearly to him. After all, if he did, it would undoubtedly be rubbing salt into his wound.","He would never dare to snatch a girlfriend from the Ye family!","Wen Ziyu felt bitter.","Why was Qiao Nian’s boyfriend Master Wang?","He was fine as long as it wasn’t Master Wang!","Then, he could still fight for his goddess.","But Master Wang...","Wen Ziyu’s heart ached.","He didn’t dare.","He really did not dare to snatch her from Ye Wangchuan.","He was afraid that he would be beaten up by the entire family and his legs would be broken. In addition, his bank card would be confiscated and all his living expenses would be stuck.","He knew of his parents’ “brutality”, so he knew they would definitely do it.","He might even be chased out of the house. They would immediately end this “unfilial son” of theirs!","As soon as Wen Ziyu thought of this, he felt like there was a ball of cotton stuck in his chest. At the same time, he despised himself.","Zhou Yang was right. Actually, he could go all out to fight for her. What if the impossible happened?","For example, she was blind and didn’t want Master Wang. Instead, she was moved by him.","However, Wen Ziyu knew very well that it was impossible for him to do that. The success rate of such a thing was comparable to winning the lottery.","No, it was harder than winning the lottery!","But the price he had to pay was too high.","He didn’t have the courage.","When he realized that he did not have enough courage to fight for it, he would hate himself again.","He didn’t seem to like her that much, but he still really liked her.","These feelings were very complicated. At the very least, Wen Ziyu felt that he couldn’t understand the complicated emotions in his heart.","“Anyway, things aren’t as simple as you think. Besides, Qiao Nian already has a boyfriend.” After Wen Ziyu finished speaking, he didn’t want to speak anymore.","Zhou Yang nodded and scratched his head. At his age, he still didn’t know how complicated it was to woo girls. He didn’t know how to comfort Wen Ziyu, so he decided not to spout nonsense.","He glanced at Wen Ziyu’s computer and accidentally saw something. “Who’s Bai Lin? Why is she placed with God Qiao’s name?”","Wen Ziyu was reading a press release.","The headlines got eye-catching.","[Comparing popular female celebrity Bai Lin to Zhui Guang, Zhui Guang was completely defeated by a female celebrity!]","“Her?”","Wen Ziyu placed one hand on the mouse and clicked on the report next to it after crossing out the page. He chose the “Fake Advertisement” option and ticked it with a red tick.","Then, he replied unhurriedly, “A fool!”","Zhou Yang was speechless.","Fu Ge happened to come in from outside and heard their conversation.","His handsome face turned green. He walked behind Wen Ziyu with his phone and said with difficulty, “Young Master Wen, I have something to tell you.”","He wanted Zhou Yang to leave, but Wen Ziyu turned around and glanced at him. He said indifferently, “Go ahead.”","Zhou Yang saw through Fu Ge and immediately said, “I’ll go down and buy a bottle of water. You guys chat.”","After he left.","Fu Ge’s tense jaw relaxed a little. He looked at the sloppy Wen Ziyu and said slowly, “Young Master Wen, can you tell your aunt to stop making things difficult for Bai Lin?”","“?”","Wen Ziyu did not react immediately. “What’s wrong with you! My aunt doesn’t even know who she is. When have I ever made things difficult for her?”","With only the two of them around, Fu Ge stopped beating around the bush and said bluntly, “Bai Lin is my brother’s woman. He called me and said that Bai Lin offended President Wen and asked me to apologize to President Wen on his behalf. He hopes that President Wen can be magnanimous and let her off this time...”"]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 Master Wang Strikes, Crushed to Death!","paragraphs":["1471 Master Wang Strikes, Crushed to Death!","s","Wen Ziyu knew Fu Sinian.","Back then, Fu Sinian had a good life. Almost everyone in Beijing knew him.","He thought for a moment and finally understood the twists and turns in this matter. He immediately sneered and looked at Fu Ge disdainfully. “You still don’t know what this Bai Lin is doing, right?”","Fu Gee looked startled and said nothing.","He really didn’t know what Bai Lin was doing anymore.","!!","If his brother hadn’t called him, he wouldn’t even have known about Bai Lin’s existence.","It was just that it was normal for there to be a female celebrity in their circle.","Other than being dissatisfied that the other party could cause trouble, he didn’t have much desire to investigate the other party’s background.","However, from what Wen Ziyu said, it seemed that Bai Lin had caused more trouble than just offending Wen Ruxia.","“Let me tell you the truth. My aunt didn’t touch her. The person she offended isn’t my aunt.” Wen Ziyu said to him frivolously, “Don’t even think about getting her out. If your family still wants to maintain their dignity, I advise you to let your brother grow some brains. Don’t bring just about anything home.”","The Fu family had been able to strut around Rao City for so many years because of the dignity that the Ye family had left for their family because of Ye Qichen.","Wen Ziyu’s rude words made Fu Ge’s face turn red, but there was nothing he could do!","This was because Wen Ziyu refused to help. With his strength, he couldn’t reach the circle in Beijing at all. He could only stare.","Fu Ge was embarrassed, as if he had been slapped in the face.","After asking for a snub, he suppressed his anger and called Fu Sinian.","...","This time, Bai Lin was even faster than she and her manager had imagined.","In the morning, their trending topic was revoked.","Various schedules were canceled.","She had told Fu Sinian at noon to help smooth things over.","In the afternoon, the CEO of Star Glory Entertainment did not even meet them. Everyone in the company received an email notification—Star Glory Entertainment had canceled Bai Lin.","This time, it was without any prior notice.","In other words, the company might freeze her until her contract expired.","As one of the most popular female artistes in the entertainment industry, Bai Lin was definitely the company’s money tree. This situation could be said to be very rare in the circle.","Bai Lin and her manager were as anxious as ants on a hot pan, looking for connections everywhere.","But the circle they had access to was too limited.","Fu Sinian was already the person with the greatest and deepest contact with their background. It was easy to imagine what kind of people they could find.","It was just someone in the entertainment industry.","The big shots in the entertainment industry were not enough in the upper-class circle!","They treated her like a plague when they heard that she had offended someone from the upper circles. No one was willing to get involved.","...","4:30 PM.","Bai Lin and her manager had already contacted everyone they could. Everyone had rejected them.","They lay limp in the exclusive lounge, both of them too exhausted to say a word. Their throats had gone dry.","Finally, Fu Sinian, who had been silent, called her back.","Bai Lin reacted as if she was grabbing onto a life-saving straw. She suddenly regained her strength and grabbed her phone to answer the call. “Hello, Young Master Fu.”","The person on the other end of the phone spoke.","Her legs turned weak and she slumped onto the stool under her manager’s expectant gaze. Her face was as white as paper, as if it would break with a poke.","“I, I don’t know. I thought she...” Bai Lin took a deep breath and grabbed the phone until her knuckles turned white. Her eyes were red. She finally knew to be afraid. She whimpered, “I can apologize, Young Master Fu. I can apologize.”"]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 Now You Know Who You’ve Offended, It’s Too Late","paragraphs":["1472 Now You Know Who You’ve Offended, It’s Too Late","He hung up.","Bai Lin deeply understood that the other party had already given up on her.","Unable to contain her terror any longer, she covered her face with her hands and burst into tears.","Her manager watched her cry and felt anxious and uncomfortable. She finally coaxed her and quickly asked, “What did Young Master Fu say?”","Bai Lin’s washed eyes were red and swollen. It was impossible to tell that she was still a glamorous female celebrity in the morning.","She was in a sorry state. Her hair was a mess, and half of her makeup was ruined. Her eyeliner was mixed with tears.","She looked at her manager with tears in her eyes and said with a trembling voice, “Young Master Fu can’t help, either.","“Sister Xin, we’re in trouble.","“Qiao Nian isn’t just a student from Rao City like we found out. Her background is even more impressive than we thought.”","“... How could that be?” Zhao Xin had only decided to create hype after investigating Qiao Nian through her connections in the circle. Who knew that she would kick an iron plate and break her leg?","Bai Lin wiped her tears and could no longer cry. “The person we offended is none other than Zhui Guang herself.”","Her manager’s mouth opened, then fell silent.","...","Bai Lin and her manager were gloomy.","But Qiao Nian had no idea.","She didn’t even know what was happening online.","The shooting of the MV was simple. Wen Ruxia booked a competition-level ice rink specialized in filming missions. Director George Lucas was also very professional.","Qiao Nian followed their arrangements the entire time.","She was good-looking. Wen Ruxia and Director George had almost reached a consensus on this point—they wouldn’t let the makeup artist do Qiao Nian’s makeup.","The girl looked beautiful even without makeup. Her delicate skin was as flawless as a peeled egg under the lens. Her cold white skin looked very good on camera.","Her beauty was so natural that it was soul-stirring.","The next problem was that Qiao Nian didn’t know how to skate.","She had already told Wen Ruxia about this. Wen Ruxia had also found a professional athlete to teach her how to skate.","Qiao Nian was extremely talented in sports.","The professional athlete had only shown her a few times and she could already figure out simple skating moves herself, even some of the more professional and difficult moves. Wen Ruxia also knew that no matter how talented a person was, they couldn’t learn them in a short time.","She found a few substitutes who looked like Qiao Nian to complete the professional movements.","Three hours later, the shooting was over.","Director George Lucas sat in front of the camera examining the material he’d captured. The rest of the staff were gathered around.","The director was surrounded by people. It was very lively.","At the edge of the rink, the girl merely took off her skates and unzipped her professional team uniform. She took off her jacket, revealing a thin sweater and thin arms.","She set aside the skater team uniform she’d changed out of, found her purse nearby, and pulled her phone from it.","“Nian Nian, are you alright?” Wen Ruxia didn’t look at the director. Instead, she walked over to speak to Qiao Nian.","Seeing that it was her, Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow. Her raven-black eyelashes covered her dark eyes as she said lazily, “It’s alright.”","Wen Ruxia saw that she was fatigued and said softly, “You’ve worked hard.”","She had gone through three hours of shooting the mission. Time was tight and the mission was heavy.","After three hours of almost non-stop filming, any other delicate female celebrity would have kicked up a fuss.","Qiao Nian didn’t say a word. Only by cooperating with the filming could they complete the mission in advance."]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 Sister Nian: I’m Going Back to Rao City","paragraphs":["1473 Sister Nian: I’m Going Back to Rao City","The girl had found her phone in her bag and turned it on. Upon hearing what Wen Ruxia said, she glanced in her direction, lowered her eyelashes, and nodded casually. “Yes.”","“Shall we have dinner tonight?” Wen Ruxia invited with a smile. “I’ll ask Director George Lucas to join us. We’ll all go for hotpot.”","Qiao Nian liked hotpot. It was a secret she had learned from Nie Mi.","She had troubled her to film the MV, so she naturally had to express her gratitude.","She reckoned that Qiao Nian wouldn’t care if she paid.","Wen Ruxia thought about it and felt that treating her to a meal was the most practical.","Qiao Nian looked down at her phone, distracted. Her eyes narrowed slightly. It was unknown what she saw, but her expression suddenly turned serious.","Before Wen Ruxia could react, she saw the girl bend down to pick up her bag and put her phone in her pocket. She seemed to be in a hurry as she said to her, “Forget it. I have something on today. Next time.”","Wen Ruxia was confused and agreed repeatedly. “Ah, okay, it’s fine. I’ll wait for you to be free.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian seemed to be in a hurry and didn’t say much to her. After taking her things, she said directly, “I have something on. I’ll make a move first.”","“Okay.”","Wen Ruxia was regretful, but she didn’t insist that she stay.","Qiao Nian left in a hurry.","Her back disappeared from the rink in the blink of an eye.","Qiao Nian didn’t go far after saying goodbye to Wen Ruxia. She hailed a taxi by the roadside and got in. Her voice was hoarse as she spoke to the taxi driver.","“To the airport.”","“Okay.”","The cab headed toward the airport.","Qiao Nian sat in the back row, her eyes half-closed in frustration. She took out her phone again and scrolled through WeChat.","She sent a message to Ye Wangchuan.","[QN: I’m heading back to Rao City.]","She muted her phone and booked the nearest flight to Rao City after the message was sent.","...","Rao City.","At the city hospital.","Su Huaiyuan was in the intensive care unit. Almost everyone from the Su family was present.","As the first person to guard this place, Xu Jishen was immediately surrounded by everyone.","“Jishen, how is your grandfather’s health?” Su Peishan was the first to speak. He was anxious and his mouth was blistering. “What did the doctor say? Did the doctor tell you why your grandfather’s fever is not subsiding?”","“That’s right,” Third Aunt said anxiously. “When we left this morning, didn’t the old man’s fever subside? Why is he having a fever again and being transferred to the ICU? Jishen, stay here. What did the doctor tell you? Why does your grandfather have a recurring fever?”","Mother Su was calmer. She felt sorry for him upon seeing her son’s tired face. She stood in front of the others and said unhappily, “Don’t be anxious. Ask one by one. All of you are talking at once, who should he answer first?”","Mother Su was Old Master Su’s most beloved daughter, and she had a high status in the family.","As soon as she spoke, the few of them suppressed their anxiety and looked at each other. Third Aunt spoke as the representative. “We just want to know what the doctor said. How is Old Master’s health now!”","Su Huaiyuan was the family’s backbone.","If he fell, the Su family would also fall.","Therefore, the entire family was really anxious at this moment, afraid that something would happen to the old man."]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 Old Master Su Is Sick","paragraphs":["1474 Old Master Su Is Sick","Last night, Xu Jishen accompanied the old man for an IV drip and did not sleep the entire night. In the morning, Jiang Yao called him, then the nurse told him that his grandfather had a fever again...","Xu Jishen had spent the past two days in chaos.","He faced the pairs of anxious eyes staring at him, his expression grave. “Grandpa... isn’t doing well.”","“?”","!!","The family was in an uproar.","Mother Su’s heart skipped a beat, and her face was covered with worry. She also asked him worriedly, “Jishen, what did the doctor tell you? Tell us the truth!”","“It’s not that I won’t tell—”","Seeing that they all wanted to know, Xu Jishen simply told them what the doctor had told him. “The doctor said that Grandpa’s recurring high fever might be a problem with his immune system.","“They examined Grandpa and found a tumor near his maternal vessels. It’s too early to tell if the tumor is benign.","“But it’s more likely for the tumor to be malignant. Also, the tumor is pressing against Grandpa’s veins, so Grandpa is still unconscious.”","Xu Jishen’s voice was clear and melodious.","The more calmly he explained the situation to everyone, the more their hearts sank...","Even Mother Su looked flustered. “Your grandfather has always been healthy. Why did he suddenly...”","“It’s not all of a sudden.” Xu Jishen sighed and said in a heavy tone, “Grandpa has never been in good health. It’s just that we don’t usually care about him. He’s also stubborn. Even if he’s not feeling well, he won’t tell us.”","The Su family members lowered their heads in shame when they heard this.","The old man had a bad temper. His personality was smelly and hard. Everyone in the family was afraid of him.","They usually didn’t dare to wander under Su Huaiyuan’s nose, let alone care about the old man’s health.","Xu Jishen also knew the situation at home. He usually stayed in Tian Chen and rarely came back. He knew that there was nothing he could do about the situation at home.","Now he only regretted not taking more time to come back and spend time with the old man.","“The doctor also said that Grandpa’s body collapsed a long time ago. The reason why he didn’t collapse immediately is that Grandpa is often taking a medicine that can temporarily suppress the growth of the tumor near his blood vessels.","“It’s very likely that Grandpa has finished that medicine.”","Third Aunt immediately frowned and said in a panic, “Buy it if you’re done eating! Did the doctor say what medicine your grandfather took?”","Xu Jishen shook his head.","Third Aunt was as anxious as an ant on a hot pan. She paced back and forth and thought of another solution. “Your Grandpa...”","Before she could finish, Xu Jishen knew what she was about to say and said coldly, “Grandpa is still unconscious. He can’t have told you.”","“Then, what should we do?” Third Aunt stamped her foot anxiously. “We can’t just stand here and watch!”","After hearing her words, Xu Jishen sneered and did not give her any face. “What else can we do? Can you treat Grandpa?”","“You!”","Third Aunt’s face turned red from his retort. After a long time, she straightened her neck and said, “You child, I’m also worried about your grandfather’s health. I don’t mean anything else. Do you have to make things sound so ugly...”","“I’m just telling the truth. It’s useless for you to be anxious about me now. I can’t do anything about it.” Xu Jishen couldn’t be bothered with her. His brows were cold and his tone was not good."]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 Sister Nian Has Arrived","paragraphs":["1475 Sister Nian Has Arrived","He knew very well that his relatives were worried about his grandfather’s health or that the old man would not be able to hold on and affect his future.","Some things could be seen through but not exposed. It was fine as long as everyone looked good.","He walked past his Third Aunt to Mother Su. “Mom, don’t worry too much,” he said in a low voice.","Mother Su covered her face. She was so panicked that she couldn’t say a word.","!!","Xu Jishen gently took off his jacket and draped it over her shoulders. Then, he said to her in a low voice, “There’s a ‘Q’ saved on Grandpa’s phone. I remember him telling me that he knows a very skilled doctor. He never keeps unfamiliar numbers. That Q should be the miracle doctor Grandpa mentioned.","“I’ve already contacted the miracle doctor. He replied to my message two hours ago. He said he was on his way here. We’ll wait a little longer.”","Mother Su looked up at him worriedly. “Will waiting help?”","Xu Jishen’s throat was dry, and he was unable to answer her question.","He didn’t know if waiting would help, but they had no choice but to wait!","...","An hour later.","Qiao Nian’s flight landed at Rao City Airport.","She got off the plane, pulled on the hood of her sweater, and walked toward the road, her hands clasped behind her.","Qiao Nian hailed a taxi. After getting in, she gave the driver the address of the hospital. Only then did she take out her phone from her pocket.","Her phone clicked on.","Ye Wangchuan had called her seven or eight times.","Among them was a missed call from Qin Si.","She did not return anyone’s call. She only found her WeChat and sent a message to Ye Wangchuan, telling him that she had successfully arrived in Rao City and was preparing to visit Su Huaiyuan at the hospital.","The airport was a certain distance away from the city hospital. Coupled with the fact that it was close to the evening rush hour, there was a traffic jam on the way.","Qiao Nian was stuck in traffic all the way, so it was already eight in the evening by the time she arrived at the hospital.","It was long after dark outside.","The weather in Rao City had changed drastically in the past few days. It had rained for several days in a row, and it was the same tonight. The sky was so dark that not a star could be seen.","The day was sweltering, and it looked like it might rain.","Qiao Nian lowered her cap and walked straight into the hospital, towards the ICU ward.","...","“Xu Jishen, is the doctor you mentioned not here yet?” The entire Su family was waiting outside the intensive care unit.","Su Huaiyuan was still in danger. They didn’t dare to leave, nor could they. They were afraid that they would miss the last chance to see Old Master Su.","No one was willing to leave, but someone couldn’t hold back. “Is that doctor coming or not?”","Xu Jishen stayed up all day and night and waited outside like them.","Someone questioned him, and the other relatives of the Su family immediately followed suit.","“That’s right. Why isn’t that doctor here yet? Jishen, are you sure the other party won’t stand us up?” Third Aunt always had something to say. “Let’s transfer to another hospital if worst comes to worst!”","Xu Jishen suddenly frowned and his eyes flickered. He was about to say, “How can his grandfather be transferred to another hospital in his current condition?”","Suddenly, he saw a familiar figure out of the corner of his eye.","Xu Jishen was a little stunned. His mind was tense, but he also found it unbelievable. He opened his mouth and shouted, “Qiao Nian?!”","Why was Qiao Nian here?","He had never officially interacted with Qiao Nian before, but he had heard a lot about her in private because of Jiang Yao.","He felt that Jiang Yao’s cousin was quite impressive.","But now, Qiao Nian had suddenly appeared in Rao City and at the hospital at this critical moment.","And she was walking towards them."]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 Xu Jishen Is Stunned","paragraphs":["1476 Xu Jishen Is Stunned","Xu Jishen felt that his brain was not working well enough and he couldn’t react at all.","What was going on?","Something clicked in his brain.","But that thought was ridiculous, and yet he thought it possible!","He had heard from Jiang Yao that Qiao Nian studied Chinese Medicine at Qing University.","However, Qiao Nian had just entered university this year and was in her first year.","His grandfather had known ‘Q’ for a long time.","How old was Qiao Nian when his grandfather mentioned ‘Q’ to him?","Three years ago, Qiao Nian was still in her first year of high school!","How could a high school student be the ‘Q’ his grandfather said was better than a domestic authority expert?","Xu Jishen’s mind was filled with a jumble of thoughts that he had yet to sort out.","The girl in the black sweater and black cap had already stopped in front of him.","The girl was wrapped in the cold air that came in. She raised her head slightly and pulled down the brim of her cap to reveal an overly delicate face.","A pair of dark eyes looked at him and asked simply, “Where is Old Master Su?”","Xu Jishen: “?”","Xu Jishen: “!”","He was standing in front of her like a wooden stake, and when Qiao Nian asked him a question, he didn’t respond for a long time. She frowned impatiently, her clear eyes suppressing her frustration. She asked him again in a good-natured manner, “You sent me a message saying that your grandfather’s fever hasn’t subsided? Where is he?”","F*ck!","Was Jiang Yao’s cousin really ‘Q’?","Xu Jishen pinched his palm hard. He gasped upon feeling sharp pain. Cold air filled his head, and his mind buzzed. Only then did his eyes regain a hint of clarity. “My-my grandfather is in the intensive care unit.”","“Yes.” The girl nodded. She walked around him and was about to head for the ward.","Xu Jishen finally calmed down a little. He watched as the girl placed her hand on the door and was about to enter the ward.","His heart felt like it was being fried in hot oil. Feeling uneasy, he called out to her, “Qiao Nian.”","The girl stopped and looked back at him with her beautiful dark eyes, as if she wasn’t sure what he was going to do.","Xu Jishen’s mind was still buzzing. Actually, he didn’t even know why he had stopped her.","The girl looked at him.","He opened his mouth again and managed to squeeze out, “That Q on my grandfather’s phone is you?”","What Q?","Qiao Nian didn’t know what he was talking about. Her aura was quite restrained as she glanced at Xu Jishen casually. “Well, I guess so.”","Guess so?","Before the Su family could recover from their shock, they watched helplessly as a young girl opened the door to the intensive care unit.","He went in in the blink of an eye.","Mother Su was the first to react and grabbed Xu Jishen’s hand. “Jishen, is the doctor you were talking about the girl just now?”","“She—isn’t she too young!”","The others were thinking the same thing.","They all thought that the doctor Xu Jishen was talking about was at least in his 40s. Otherwise, how could he have the experience to save someone?","But Qiao Nian was too young.","None of them had expected her to be so young. She didn’t look very reliable...","Xu Jishen was still confused, let alone explain to them.","He calmed his mother down in frustration and said reluctantly, “Anyway, the experts from the city hospital are all inside. Let’s take a look first!”","Don’t ask him. He didn’t know.","After all, he would never have thought that the cousin that his friend had found was actually his grandfather’s very important friend, ‘Q’."]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 Su Huaiyuan’s Situation Is Not Looking Good","paragraphs":["1477 Su Huaiyuan’s Situation Is Not Looking Good","The Su family gathered in the corridor outside.","All of them looked grim.","Nine o’clock.","The ICU door opened and several specialists filed out.","Mother Su was the first to react. She immediately went up to them. “Doctor, how’s my father?”","A couple of doctors were holding the latest report from the examination and talking to each other.","The middle-aged man in the lead saw Mother Su from the corner of his eye. He spoke to a few experts and handed the test results to the person beside him.","Then, he turned to Mother Su with a solemn expression and said, “The results of Old Master Su’s examination are out. The situation is not optimistic.”","Mother Su swayed.","Fortunately, Xu Jishen quickly caught her and stopped her from falling.","She looked nervously at the doctor, her eyes gathering mist, her voice laced with tears. “Then my father...”","“I can only say that Old Master Su’s situation is not optimistic. I can’t conclude anything else yet.”","The doctor briefly explained Su Huaiyuan’s current physical condition to them.","“We did a comprehensive examination on Old Master Su and found that other than a malignant tumor growing on his aorta, his biggest problem is that he has a hemolytic immune disease.”","“Doctor, what’s a hemolytic immune disease?” Most of the Su family didn’t know medical professional terms and quickly asked him.","The middle-aged doctor raised his hand, pushed his glasses up his nose, and sighed. “How do I explain this to you?","“Let me put it this way. Healthy people have an immune system in their bodies. It’s precisely because of the existence of the immune system that we rarely catch a cold or have a fever. The problem with Old Master Su is that his immune system is sick. His body is very weak because his immune system has lost its effect. He has had a repeated high fever since the day before yesterday also because of this...”","Mother Su opened her mouth, but the question had not been asked.","Su Huaiyuan’s attending doctor seemed to know what she wanted to ask. “Immunity has always been a problem in the medical world. It’s very difficult to treat. We basically use targeted drugs.","“We’ve done CAR-T cell therapy on GD2 before, but it’s not working too well. The relevant research is still ongoing.","“In addition to GD2, some of the clinical targeted drugs for vascular formation have been relatively successful, but these two drugs have not been approved yet. They won’t be available until next month.”","The doctor said awkwardly, “This is only when it’s listed overseas. If it’s domestically, it still needs layers of approval. I reckon it’ll be difficult even next year!”","Su Huaiyuan obviously couldn’t wait that long!","Mother Su was really exhausted this time and couldn’t stand steadily.","Her face was white, and her mind was buzzing. “How can there be no medicine on the market?”","Without medicine, they couldn’t buy it even if they had money and connections!","For the first time, Mother Su realized how weak a person could be. A little storm could destroy a family.","She covered her face and tears streamed down her face. She turned around and hugged Xu Jishen, crying miserably. “Jishen, your grandfather, he... he...”","Xu Jishen took a deep breath. Cold air filled his mind, and he barely managed to keep his mind clear.","He did not give up as he patted his mother’s back. His gaze passed the group of experts and landed on the girl who was like the moon surrounded by stars.","“Qiao, Qiao Nian.”","Xu Jishen’s throat was dry and hoarse. There seemed to be rough sand and stones stuck in his throat, and the sounds he made were all broken."]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 Sister Nian: There’s a Targeted Medicine","paragraphs":["1478 Sister Nian: There’s a Targeted Medicine","The girl was wearing a large sterile gown. Hearing this, she silently took off her gloves and threw them into a medical trash can.","Her raven-black eyelashes drooped slightly as she restrained her aura.","Everyone couldn’t take their eyes off her.","Third Aunt reacted and said in a panic, “That’s right, aren’t you a Miracle Doctor? They have no way. What about you? You should have a way!”","Could it be that she was called a Miracle Doctor for nothing?!","She was going to say that.","Before she could say anything, a sharp gaze swept over her. She stopped abruptly, her old face turning red.","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze and slowly took off her sterile clothes and threw them into the trash can. Then, she said in a hoarse voice, “Your grandfather’s condition is similar to what Dr. Song said. He needs specific targeted medicine. That medicine isn’t sold on the market...”","Even she said that. Xu Jishen felt despair for the first time. “Is there no other way to save my grandfather...”","Qiao Nian glanced at him, her dark eyes shining. “There is.”","Her words lifted everyone’s heart.","“There is?” Xu Jishen was a little stunned. For a moment, he wondered if he had heard wrongly.","The rest of the Su family laughed and cried. They didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. All of them stared at the girl anxiously.","Su Huaiyuan’s attending physician was stunned for a moment. He turned to look at Qiao Nian and hesitated. “Miss Qiao, that medicine...”","The disease of the immune system was very complicated. Otherwise, the medical world would not have failed to produce good results even after studying it for hundreds of years.","All they could research now was targeted drugs.","For example, if a patient had a certain type of immune disease, a special medicine for this immune disease would be developed. That was why it was called “targeted” medicine.","However, there were still many immune diseases in the world that the medical world couldn’t overcome, such as lupus.","Su Huaiyuan was both unlucky and lucky this time. If he was unlucky, his immune system would have malfunctioned. If he was lucky, his hemolytic immune system would have targeted drugs.","However, Su Huaiyuan was unlucky. This targeted medicine was not officially launched yet. Only some authoritative medical journals had published academic papers.","The drug was still being studied.","It took time for a drug to be developed and marketed.","A long, long time.","At Su Huaiyuan’s age, and with his illness this time, he definitely wouldn’t be able to wait until CD-3 was promoted to the country.","“I can get that medicine.” Qiao Nian picked up her baseball cap and put it on her head. Her skin was fair, and it looked even fairer and more eye-catching when the light shone on her.","At this moment, what was more attractive than her appearance was what she said. Everyone’s hopes were pinned on her.","Even several experts were intrigued by her words.","The attending physician was stunned for a second before he realized what Qiao Nian had said. He couldn’t help but remind her, “Miss Qiao, the medicine isn’t out yet. Where can you find it... I’m afraid only the laboratory has this medicine.”","“There’s another place.” Qiao Nian turned her cap to the back of her head and put her hand down coolly. Her cold eyes narrowed slightly as she said, “The Pharmacy Association has this medicine.”","“Did you say the Pharmacy Association...?”","The experts gasped as if they’d seen a ghost.","They had heard of the Pharmacy Association, of course.","But that place wasn’t somewhere anyone could go just because they wanted to.","Did Qiao Nian mean that she was going to the Pharmacy Association to get the medicine?"]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 Seemed to Be Persuading Qiao Nian to Take a Dog Out","paragraphs":["1479 Seemed to Be Persuading Qiao Nian to Take a Dog Out","The doctors looked at each other. Their minds were blank. They had no idea what to say.","“Give me three days.”","Qiao Nian calculated the time. Three days was enough.","She picked up her bag. “I’ll bring the medicine back in three days,” she said simply.","Su Huaiyuan’s attending doctor could do nothing but nod.","Those who didn’t study medicine did not understand how sacred and difficult the Pharmacy Association was to enter.","The laymen watched the show, while the professionals knew the ropes.","They just understood the ropes.","They were shocked that not only did Qiao Nian know about the existence of the Pharmacy Association, but she also seemed to be very familiar with it.","At her age... she knew about the Pharmacy Association and was related to it. Her future was limitless!","When Xu Jishen heard her say that she could get medicine for his grandfather, he looked at Qiao Nian and suggested without thinking, “I’ll go with you!”","Qiao Nian had planned to leave after informing the doctor.","She raised her eyebrows and looked at him in surprise.","Xu Jishen saw her surprised gaze and recalled the countless times he had gotten the chance to get to know her. However, he had never spoken to Qiao Nian properly because of Jiang Yao. He felt a faint sense of regret.","Putting everything else aside, just the fact that Qiao Nian was looking for medicine for his grandfather this time...","He was definitely going to make this friend!","“Where’s the Pharmacy Association you mentioned?” Xu Jishen picked up his car keys. He thought that the Pharmacy Association was in a city in the country, somewhere like the Medical Association. Worried, he said, “I’ll go with you. It’s not safe for a girl like you to be outside.”","Mother Su wiped away her tears and a gentle smile appeared on her well-maintained face when she heard that her father could still be saved. She also agreed. “That’s right, young lady. Let Jishen accompany you. It’s dark outside. It’s not safe for you to go out alone. With him around, there’s finally one more man. If you need to carry anything, you can let him do it for you. It’s more convenient for you to bring him along.”","Xu Jishen’s lips twitched when he heard his mother’s words.","His heavy heart was suddenly amused.","Was he a dog?","From his mother’s words, it sounded like she was persuading Qiao Nian to bring a dog out.","Qiao Nian seemed to be amused by Mother Su’s words as well. The corners of her lips curled up casually, a little brash and arrogant. “He can’t enter.”","Mother Su: “... Why can’t he get in?”","“The Pharmacy Association won’t let strangers in, so it’s useless for him to follow me,” Qiao Nian explained politely.","After Mother Su was stunned, she immediately turned to look in Xu Jishen’s direction. Her sizing gaze seemed to be saying, “You’re actually so useless?”","Xu Jishen felt that his mother had been deeply hurt. He touched his nose bridge, feeling rather awkward. Without looking at Mother Su, he said to Qiao Nian, “The Pharmacy Association you mentioned isn’t in Rao City, right?”","Qiao Nian wasn’t as polite as she was to Mother Su as she casually said, “It’s not in Rao City.”","Xu Jishen smiled again as he held the car keys. “Then, I’ll take you to the airport. That’s fine, right?”","Qiao Nian didn’t answer him immediately. She pursed her lips and thought for two seconds before reluctantly agreeing. Her reaction was as if she was trying to suppress her impatience and give him some face.","Xu Jishen was speechless.","He wanted to die on the spot!","...","Beijing.","At the Jiang Residence.","It was nine in the evening and dark outside.","However, the Jiang family’s villa was brightly lit. Everyone was flustered."]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 Suddenly Changing the Time to Set Off Today","paragraphs":["1480 Suddenly Changing the Time to Set Off Today","Tang Wanru was helping Jiang Xianrou pack her luggage. As she helped her tidy up her clothes and put them into her luggage, she frowned and said, “What’s wrong with the Pharmacy Association? Didn’t they tell you this morning to change it to the day after tomorrow? Now they’re urging you to leave immediately.","“They’re making such a fuss that we’re scrambling. I was planning to go to the beauty parlor tomorrow to get my face done. We’ve got an appointment. It’s too late now.”","Jiang Xianrou was also busy putting her things into her luggage. “I don’t know. Chief suddenly called, informing me that his flight was at 11 o’clock. I didn’t have time to ask him why he changed the time.”","“It’s better if you don’t ask.” Tang Wanru thought for a moment and said, “The Pharmacy Association might have something urgent to tell him to go back. You’re a newcomer, so it’s not convenient for him to tell you some things. You’ll seem insensible if you ask...”","“Yes, that’s why I didn’t ask him.” Jiang Xianrou also thought so.","She just couldn’t understand why the other party would delay going back one moment and rush off the next. What exactly had happened?","Tang Wanru was going over with Jiang Xianrou this time. She had already packed her luggage and was mainly helping her unpack.","As she put in the daily necessities that Jiang Xianrou needed, she said, “Xianrou, keep a low profile when we get to the Pharmacy Association. We don’t know the situation there, so it’s not wrong to keep a low profile...”","Jiang Zongnan had also mentioned this to her this morning.","Jiang Xianrou frowned impatiently when she heard the same words now.","However, thinking that she was about to go to the Pharmacy Association, she quickly relaxed her frown.","Still in a good mood, she said, “I know. Don’t worry. I’m not a fool. I know the Pharmacy Association’s weight!”","Tang Wanru was slightly relieved upon seeing that she didn’t seem to be lying.","“That’s good.","“Normally, since you can’t enter the Pharmacy Association this time, the Qi family’s spot wasn’t originally reserved for you. At first, they wanted to give it to their own family member, but later...”","She trailed off, as if there were something she couldn’t say.","She changed the topic again. “In short, you have to be more careful when you reach Country M. We won’t be at home. It’s more or less inconvenient for us to do many things. Just bear with it and wait until you find a good teacher.”","The Pharmacy Association also had a laboratory and teachers who taught new students.","However, their lab was too awesome compared to Liang Lu’s laboratory at Qing University.","The world’s most cutting-edge medicine was always born in the Pharmacy Association’s laboratory. This was also the most terrifying thing about them!","Jiang Xianrou had a preliminary understanding of the Pharmacy Association from Qi Yan. She roughly knew that the Pharmacy Association existed in the form of a research institute in Country M.","However, Country M wasn’t the Association’s base camp.","Their true headquarters was on the independent continent.","However, in the past few years, the head of the Pharmacy Association, Zhong Yiliu, had moved the laboratory to Continent O. Only then did the active area of the Pharmacy Association transfer from the independent continent to the small Country M.","That was why Qi Yan had a precious spot in the Pharmacy Association.","Because Qi Yan had married the third successor of Country M, a member of the royal family.","Qi Yan had once helped Zhong Yiliu and had a deep relationship with the Pharmacy Association. At first, Zhong Yiliu promised Qi Yan a spot in the Pharmacy Association, but she never used it.","She originally wanted to leave it for her niece, Qi Lanyin, who was currently the most talented person in the Qi family.","Unexpectedly, this spot landed on Jiang Xianrou’s head."]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 Jiang Xianrou Leaves for the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["1481 Jiang Xianrou Leaves for the Pharmacy Association","Jiang Xianrou was slightly distracted, and all kinds of trivial matters appeared in her mind.","She didn’t want to find out why Qi Yan had taken a fancy to her and wanted to acknowledge her as her goddaughter.","She didn’t want to understand why Qi Yan would give her such a precious chance to enter the Pharmacy Association.","She only knew that she was about to enter a new level with the Qi family’s help and was about to get rid of the haze she had been feeling recently.","Jiang Xianrou’s heart beat faster as long as she thought about how she was about to set foot in the Pharmacy Association. She was so excited that she didn’t feel tired even as she packed her luggage.","She wished she could set off immediately!","“I heard that Qiao Nian caused trouble again.” Tang Wanru helped Jiang Xianrou put all the skincare products into a separate storage bag as she casually spoke. “She got someone to ban a female celebrity. That female celebrity even came to me through her connections.”","Fu Sinian had called her this afternoon.","However, Tang Wanru didn’t take the Fu family seriously, let alone Fu Sinian.","She rejected him without hesitation, not wanting to get involved before leaving for the Pharmacy Association.","Jiang Xianrou only nodded and was not interested in this matter.","Hearing this, she curled her red lips in disdain and said, “Isn’t that her personality? She can’t stand how anyone must make that person kneel down and beg for mercy. She’s too domineering and doesn’t give herself any leeway at all. One day, she’ll suffer because of her personality!”","Tang Wanru pursed her lips and said with a disdainful expression, “Who knows? Anyway, it has nothing to do with us.”","Jiang Xianrou thought about it and smiled.","That’s right. She wouldn’t be on the same level as Qiao Nian once she entered the Pharmacy Association.","She no longer cared about her.","Not to mention comparing herself to Qiao Nian. That would be lowering her status.","“Oh, yes.”","Tang Wanru packed all her things. Then, she thought of something.","“Didn’t your father ask you to ask Dean Zhong for medicine for your grandfather? Don’t be silly.","“You’ve just entered the Pharmacy Association. Now is the time to show off. Dean Zhong might be dissatisfied with you if you ask him about these trivial matters.”","Tang Wanru’s eyes were cold. “To put it bluntly, you don’t have to take the risk for your grandfather. In the past, I didn’t even persuade you when your grandfather treated you well. Now, he only has Qiao Nian in his heart and doesn’t even look at you anymore. He has already chased you out of the family tree. Why do you have to stand up for him?!”","Jiang Xianrou only agreed to Jiang Zongnan’s request on the surface. In fact, she had never thought of looking for Zhong Yiliu for Old Master Jiang.","She nodded and said obediently, “I know, Mom. Don’t worry. I know what I’m doing.”","“As long as you know what you’re doing.”","Tang Wanru more or less knew her personality. She was satisfied upon seeing that she didn’t get emotional over Old Master Jiang’s health.","Coincidentally, Jiang Yao came up from downstairs to ask if they had packed their things.","Tang Wanru stopped talking about it.","The flight was at 11. They gathered at the airport at 10.","The airport was as brightly lit as if it was the day. Passengers came and went.","Many cars were also parked outside waiting to pick someone up.","Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao were both there.","Even Jiang Li put on a baseball cap and came over to send Jiang Xianrou off.","Qi Yan and the others were definitely unwilling to be wrapped up with the Jiang family, so they chatted with the people from the Pharmacy Association not far away."]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 The First Time I’ve Seen Someone From the Pharmacy Association Being So Attentive","paragraphs":["1482 The First Time I’ve Seen Someone From the Pharmacy Association Being So Attentive","Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru bid farewell to the Jiang family.","“Dad, Brother. Mom and I are leaving.”","Along the way, Jiang Zongnan nagged them to pay attention to the weather and remember to put on more clothes.","Jiang Xianrou had been enduring all this while. When she finally heard the airport broadcast, she immediately interrupted Jiang Zongnan and pulled up her luggage, preparing to leave for the boarding gate.","!!","Jiang Li’s sunglasses were a little cold when he saw the impatience in her eyes when Jiang Zongnan spoke.","However, Jiang Xianrou was still his biological sister.","They had grown up together.","Jiang Xianrou was going out for half a month. As her brother, he had nothing to say.","Before Jiang Xianrou left, he stopped her and reminded her simply, “When you get there, restrain your temper. Don’t be competitive and insist on winning.”","Jiang Xianrou did not expect him to say this.","Her face darkened. Not acknowledging him, she looked past Jiang Li and smiled at Jiang Yao. “Brother, I’ll leave first. I’ll send you a message when I arrive.”","Jiang Li wasn’t offended by her obvious differential attitude. He shrugged and put his hands behind his head, ready to go back.","Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru actually had nothing to do at the Pharmacy Association this time. They just wanted to take a look and settle the procedures.","Even though she officially became a member of the Pharmacy Association, Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru’s biggest goal this time was to find a good teacher to guide Jiang Xianrou!","Jiang Li had no idea who their target was.","However, from what he knew of the two of them, the person they had their eyes on was definitely not an ordinary member of the Pharmacy Association.","Elder Zhong’s chief disciple also set off with them. He wondered if Jiang Xianrou would be able to get her wish this time!","Robert had no idea that someone was targeting him. He spoke distractedly to Qi Yan and Qi Lanyin.","During this period, Qi Lanyin had repeatedly shown her admiration and respect for him.","He didn’t pay much attention to it and didn’t even respond to Qi Lanyin. He was looking at his phone the entire time.","Qi Yan was angry that Qi Lanyin had made her thoughts too obvious, but her heart ached for her.","She could tell that Qi Lanyin wanted to enter the Pharmacy Association through Robert. Although she felt that her actions were a little demeaning, she did not dissuade her.","Until Robert was completely indifferent and kept checking his phone.","She gave Qi Lanyin a look and asked the blond man gently, “Chief Luo, what are you looking at?”","She thought for a moment and pursed her red lips again, then said elegantly, “Is Dean Zhong looking for you?”","The blond man was young, in his 30s. He was young in a place like the Pharmacy Association. However, he was Dean Zhong’s personal disciple.","His status was definitely different from ordinary members.","Qi Yan treated him kindly.","The blond man heard her question and found time to answer her. “No. I’m waiting for someone to reply to my message. I don’t know if she’s set off yet.”","Who was so important?","Qi Yan was a little confused.","The people from the Pharmacy Association were generally aloof and did not have much contact with the outside world.","Back then, she had relied on her connections in Country M to help Dean Zhong so that she could have some contact with these people from the Pharmacy Association.","Just this little connection was enough for her to gain a foothold in the royal family and make the members of the royal family think highly of her.","She had never seen anyone from the Pharmacy Association care about outsiders."]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 Waiting for Sister Nian’s News","paragraphs":["1483 Waiting for Sister Nian’s News","Qi Yan was very considerate. “Who is that person? ‘He’ hasn’t come yet? Why don’t we wait for him and set off together?”","But Robert glanced at her in surprise and shook his head. “She’s not with us,” he said helplessly. “And she’s not in Beijing.”","Not in Beijing?","Qi Yan keenly grasped the key information and relaxed a little.","!!","If Robert said she was not in Beijing, then she was not from Beijing!","Qiao Nian was quite strange.","Qi Yan had heard about what happened on the day of the filiation banquet. It seemed that Qiao Nian knew Lu Zhi.","Lu Zhi was not someone to be trifled with.","Even she didn’t even dare to provoke him.","“I see.” After Qi Yan relaxed, she thought for a moment and said considerately, “Where is he? I’ll get someone to pick him up.”","“No.” Robert didn’t accept her offer. “She’s withdrawn and used to being on her own. I asked her before if she wanted to come with us, but she said she didn’t want to. I’ll wait a little longer and see if she’s set off. Then, we’ll go.”","Qi Yan hummed in agreement. She was getting more and more confused about who Robert was referring to.","The Pharmacy Association had never valued anyone so much.","She listened to Robert. He seemed to have something to do with changing the course several times.","Robert was arranging the return time for the other man.","At this thought, Qi Yan became even more curious about that person.","She was so distracted that she didn’t notice the blond man’s phone ping.","He seemed to have received a text message.","Robert’s eyes lit up and he eagerly read the message.","Q did reply to his message.","[I’m on my way.]","The corners of Robert’s mouth shot up. He immediately turned to Qi Yan and the others. “Let’s go.”","...","Ten hours later.","In an airport terminal in Continent M, a tourist wearing a cap and carrying a shoulder bag walked out of the duty gate. She looked like an international student.","She had no suitcase with her.","When she got out, she bought a cup of hot coffee at the airport vending machine, pulled the tab on the can, took a sip to warm her hands, and headed outside.","In September, the summer was hot in Beijing.","It was unbearably stuffy at night.","Qiao Nian was only wearing a thin sweater and a pair of canvas shoes when she came out.","Her outfit was considered thick in Beijing, but the temperature in Country M was much lower.","Qiao Nian realized that she was wearing too little when she got off the plane. The temperature here was at most 10 degrees Celsius. The weather was cold, and the wind and sand were strong.","Fortunately, it was still daytime in Country M because of the time difference.","Qiao Nian used her phone to check the hotels nearby. She found one at random and took a taxi from the airport.","She took her ID with her out of habit.","As for the identification required for entry and exit, it was a piece of cake for her. At the Rao City airport, she hacked into the terminal system and changed her information.","Once outside, she was even more at home, booking hotels and looking for places with practiced ease.","Qiao Nian’s taxi left the airport.","Later, the flight from Beijing landed at the airport.","Tang Wanru’s group had more people, so it took them a lot of time just to get their luggage.","It took a full hour to get from the plane landing to their exit.","Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru had the most luggage.","Next were Qi Yan and Qi Lanyin."]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 Jiang Xianrou Thought That She Had Touched the Ceiling of Medicine","paragraphs":["1484 Jiang Xianrou Thought That She Had Touched the Ceiling of Medicine","Instead, the people from the Pharmacy Association did not bring much luggage. Everyone was holding a black handbag in their hands. The bag was light and carried all their luggage.","They trooped out of the airport.","Qi Yan had already arranged for a car to wait for them outside.","The extended black Bentley was particularly eye-catching outside the airport.","!!","As soon as Qi Yan came out, she immediately invited the blond man, “Chief Robert, are you going back to the Pharmacy Association? Let me send you back.”","Robert had brought a member of the Pharmacy Association with him this time. The man was dressed very plainly, as Robert himself was. In fact, he was rather inconspicuous.","Robert politely declined her invitation. “No, we can go back ourselves.”","He didn’t speak to Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru along the way.","It was only now that he seemed to have noticed them. He turned to look at Jiang Xianrou and said warmly, “You can report to the Pharmacy Association tomorrow.”","“Yes, okay.” Jiang Xianrou was very respectful in front of him.","Robert checked his phone again.","He estimated the time.","At this hour, Q’s plane should have arrived too.","He still had to go back and tell the dean.","He was thinking about something and did not have the energy to pay attention to Jiang Xianrou and the others. Hence, he nodded and hurriedly said, “You can send me a message after you arrive at the Association tomorrow. My phone number is XXXX.”","He rattled off a list of phone numbers.","Jiang Xianrou hurriedly wrote it down.","Robert was in a hurry. After telling her his phone number, he said, “Don’t call me if there’s nothing important. I’m usually at the lab, so my phone is almost always on silent. I can’t get you if you call me. So, try to text me if you need anything. I’ll get back to you when I see it.","“Just report to the Association by 10 tomorrow morning. Find a hotel for today.”","Jiang Xianrou was flattered and saved his number. She nodded obediently. “Okay, thank you.”","“You’re welcome.","“I have things to do, so I won’t be joining you. I’m going back to the Association.”","Robert gave her a few brief instructions and then left with the people from the Pharmacy Association.","Before leaving, he specially greeted Qi Yan.","Their car drove away.","Qi Yan retracted her gaze indifferently and called Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru over. “Let’s go. I’ve booked a room for you at a nearby hotel.”","Country M was indeed a small country, but it had a good geographical environment and many tourist attractions.","The per capita income was considerable.","The city was very developed.","Not to mention that they still had the Pharmacy Association. Country M had a small say in Continent O.","As a member of the royal family, the hotel Qi Yan booked was a very high-class five-star hotel nearby. The hotel was also one of the country’s famous attractions.","As for the price, it must be very expensive.","However, Qi Yan was rich and powerful. Of course, she could afford to stay there.","Jiang Xianrou followed behind her and saw her getting into a limousine. Then, she looked at the royal logo in front of the car and the Qi family’s chauffeur in a suit waiting at the side. She followed closely behind.","Country M, Pharmacy Association...","Jiang Xianrou was filled with yearning and anticipation.","Before she got into the car, she took a deep breath and felt relaxed.","Even though the message she sent to Ye Wangchuan before she left was like a stone sinking into the sea, it did not affect her joy at all.","Qiao Nian thought that she had touched the ceiling of the medical world just because she was with Mr. Huang.","But she was different.","She was about to enter the Pharmacy Association!"]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 Master Wang Called From a Thousand Miles Away","paragraphs":["1485 Master Wang Called From a Thousand Miles Away","In the Waldorf Hotel suite.","The girl swiped her room card to open the suite door.","Not long after she went in, the hotel management sent over the sweaters and coats she had requested.","Qiao Nian had just come out of the shower.","Her hair was wet and dripping. She wiped the drops from her bangs with a towel. “Just leave it there,” she instructed with a casual expression.","“Okay.”","The hotel manager followed her instructions and placed the change of clothes neatly on the sofa. Then, she bowed and said very politely, “Esteemed guest, I won’t disturb your rest anymore. I wish you a pleasant stay.”","She even closed the door behind her before she left.","Very sensible.","Qiao Nian was wearing a hotel bathrobe. The bathrobe was white, and the soft silk fabric was loosely tied around her body, revealing her fair skin.","The room was air-conditioned, and the temperature was maintained at 23 degrees Celsius.","Qiao Nian stepped onto the comfortable carpet. She had just taken a shower and felt cold. She pulled out a chair and sat down.","Crossing her legs in a rather cynical pose, she took the phone she’d left there to charge before going into the bathroom.","Qiao Nian hadn’t charged her phone last night.","During the day, she had sent Lu Zhi off and ran around the city. Now, she had come to the Pharmacy Association. Her phone had long run out of battery.","But it was charging fast.","Qiao Nian’s phone had run out of battery before she boarded the plane. It had only been charged for half an hour, but her phone was already half full.","She squinted, took off the phone’s charging cord, hooked her head, and pressed the ON button.","Soon, the screen lit up.","The phone was successfully turned on.","Qiao Nian’s phone started beeping non-stop the moment she turned it on.","Seven or eight messages flooded in.","Nie Mi, Jiang Li, Wen Ruxia... Several people were looking for her.","Qiao Nian flipped through them and first read Wen Ruxia’s message.","She passed her a folder.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and took out her tablet from her shoulder bag, then connected the tablet to her phone.","She clicked accept.","The file began to transmit.","She read the other messages while the file was being transmitted.","Other than Qin Si asking her why she was missing for a day, the rest of the people asked if she had arrived.","Qiao Nian sent a private message to Xu Jishen, telling him that she had arrived. She would go to the Pharmacy Association tomorrow to get the medicine.","She did not reply to the others.","She crossed her legs and replied unhurriedly.","She also sent a message back to Robert, telling him that there was no need to arrange accommodation. She was already staying at the hotel.","She had just returned the message from the Pharmacy Association when a video call popped up.","Qiao Nian’s fair fingers paused for a moment. She stretched her body backward and casually accepted the video call Ye Wangchuan sent her.","“Have you reached?”","Qiao Nian heard the man’s pleasant voice before the camera could stabilize.","She looked out the French windows at the night view. “Yeah,” she said rather wearily.","Qiao Nian thought for a moment and felt that her answer was too dry. In the end, she added, “I just arrived half an hour ago. My phone ran out of battery when I sent you the message. After telling you that, my phone was automatically turned off. I just charged it.”","The camera on the other end of the video shook and finally stabilized.","She saw Ye Wangchuan’s overly attractive face. Besides, he didn’t seem to be at home. The background was different from his apartment."]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 God Qiao, Which of Your Disguises Did You Lose?","paragraphs":["1486 God Qiao, Which of Your Disguises Did You Lose?","Qiao Nian asked him, “You didn’t go back?”","It should be three in the morning in Beijing now.","Ye Wangchuan’s smile was quite attractive. His thin lips curled up as if he was about to seduce her, and his eyes sparkled as he looked at her. “Are you afraid that I’ll go out and play while you’re not around?”","“?”","!!","Qiao Nian didn’t know how to answer him, so she simply ignored him.","The man stretched, causing the collar of his casual jacket to slightly open, revealing an attractive collarbone. “I’m not in Beijing.”","Qiao Nian looked over with her clear eyes.","Ye Wangchuan wished he could pull her over to him through the camera and give her a big kiss. It was just that he was far away and none of this was realistic.","His Adam’s apple bobbed as he restrained himself. He continued in a hoarse and charming voice, “Something happened in Shuangjiang City. I went over with Bo Jingxing. We’re in the car now.”","Qiao Nian nodded to show that she understood.","“You’re there?” Ye Wangchuan saw that she looked like she was in a hotel, so he thought for a moment and said, “I’ll give you a number. You can call this number if you need anything. Someone will take care of you.”","Qiao Nian hadn’t expected him to have someone in Continent O. She raised her eyebrows and a surprised expression on her face.","However, she pressed her hand between her eyebrows and lowered it. She said lazily, “No need. I’ll go back immediately after I get what I came for. I won’t stay here for long.”","Although Qiao Nian said that there was no need, Ye Wangchuan was still worried. He sent her the phone number.","Qiao Nian saw the number he had sent on WeChat and felt a surge of warmth in her heart. She said to him, “I’ll go back as soon as possible.”","Before she left, she sent a message to Ye Wangchuan, briefly explaining Su Huaiyuan’s situation and that he needed the CD-3 targeted medicine.","Ye Wangchuan knew why she had specially made a trip to the Pharmacy Association. However, when Qiao Nian mentioned it herself, his eyes still looked deeply at the face of the girl in the video, whose bathrobe was slightly open and who was exquisite and eye-catching. He chuckled softly and asked, “God Qiao, which of your disguises did you lose this time?”","There was some silence.","Qiao Nian’s ears felt a little hot from his words. She got up and found the air-conditioning remote control to adjust the temperature by two degrees. Then, she coughed dryly. She felt a little unconfident under his gaze. “I don’t think so. I don’t have any aliases.”","Which identity?","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were filled with an intoxicating smile. His burning gaze seemed to want to envelop her.","Qiao Nian was silent for two seconds after being stared at by his half-smile. Perhaps because she was a little frustrated by his stare, she looked up self-righteously and met his eyes. “I really don’t have any disguises!”","Q probably didn’t count as a disguise.","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan chuckled at her reaction and reminded her, “Remember to call the number I gave you if you need anything.”","Qiao Nian nodded. Although she didn’t think she could use it, she didn’t refuse.","“Be careful since you’re outside alone. Also...” Ye Wangchuan rubbed his eyebrows. If it wasn’t for the fact that he had something on and couldn’t leave, he would already be on the plane to Country M. “I’ve checked the weather over there. It’s colder than Beijing. Remember to wear more clothes. Don’t catch a cold.”","This was the first time Qiao Nian realized that he was so talkative, but she was not impatient. Her eyelashes covered the warmth in her black eyes. “I know.”","Bo Jingxing seemed to be calling his name on the other end of the video call.","Ye Wangchuan looked at his phone again and reminded her briefly before hanging up.","Seeing that the video had dimmed, Qiao Nian crossed her legs and casually picked up her phone to send Zhong Yiliu a message.","[Q: I’m here.]"]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 I’ll Take You to See Dean Zhong","paragraphs":["1487 I’ll Take You to See Dean Zhong","The following day.","Jiang Xianrou woke up early.","After washing up, she waited outside the hotel with Tang Wanru for Qi Yan to bring them to the Pharmacy Association.","Qi Yan’s car arrived at half-past nine.","The Qi family’s driver opened the door for them respectfully. “Madam Jiang, Miss Jiang, please get in.”","Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru got into the car one after another.","The car moved slowly in the direction of the Pharmacy Association.","Along the way, Jiang Xianrou pursed her lips and almost did not speak. She kept looking out of the window with a tense expression. It was obvious that she was very nervous.","Qi Yan chatted with Tang Wanru for a while. When she turned around and saw that she was so nervous, she smiled and said casually, “Xianrou, don’t be nervous. Follow me when we reach the Pharmacy Association later. I’ll bring you to report.”","Jiang Xianrou looked at her with her beautiful eyes and pretended to be calm. “Thank you, Godmother.”","Qi Yan did not reply. She only looked at her with a faint smile, and disdain flashed across her eyes.","To be honest, if it weren’t for the Qi family, she wouldn’t have given Jiang Xianrou a spot in the Pharmacy Association.","Lanyin was far, far more talented in medicine than her.","She had originally planned to leave this precious spot to her family. Unfortunately, God’s plan worked. The Qi family had offended the Red Alliance, so she had no choice but to find external help.","She could only give up the spot in the Pharmacy Association.","After all, Qi Yan was not Qi Lanyin. She was in her 40s and had long experienced the baptism of society. No matter how dissatisfied she was, she could do it flawlessly on the surface and not let anyone see any dissatisfaction.","“I called Dean Zhong on the way. He’s here today. I’ll take you to him after you finish the paperwork.”","Jiang Xianrou didn’t expect Qi Yan to bring her to meet Dean Zhong. Her eyes lit up and she could no longer hide her joy. She said excitedly, “Thank you, Godmother.”","This time she said it far more truthfully than the last time.","Qi Yan pursed her lips and smiled again. She waved her hand and said considerately, “You don’t have to be so polite with me.","“But when you see Dean Zhong later, remember to perform well and be sensible. This way, you can increase your favorability with him. It will be beneficial for your stay in the Pharmacy Association in the future.”","Even without her reminder, Jiang Xianrou understood the twists and turns. She nodded solemnly and said, “I know. Godmother, don’t worry. I won’t disappoint you.”","Qi Yan adjusted her shawl and smiled elegantly, as if she trusted her. “Child, seriously, I already said that you don’t have to be so polite with me. Of course, I’m at ease with your words~”","...","Half an hour later.","The car arrived at a very quaint building and found a place to stop.","Qi Yan glanced outside, opened the door, and said to the two of them, “We’re here.”","Jiang Xianrou was still immersed in the joy of meeting Zhong Yiliu. She only looked outside when she saw Qi Yan unbuckle her seatbelt and get out of the car.","What came into view was a very simple and unadorned building with a European style. It was not very eye-catching from the outside, but the simple aura stood there quietly.","She immediately felt a strong visual impact and an invisible pressure pressing down on her, making her heart beat faster.","Was this the Pharmacy Association?","Jiang Xianrou’s breathing quickened and her pupils constricted. She opened the door and got out with Qi Yan.","She didn’t even dare breathe."]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 Waiting for Jiang Li and Master Jiang to Regret That Day","paragraphs":["1488 Waiting for Jiang Li and Master Jiang to Regret That Day","Tang Wanru was similar. The two of them were clearly nervous from the beginning.","Qi Yan glanced at them and led the way. “Xianrou, let’s go in.”","“Okay.” Jiang Xianrou’s mind was still buzzing. She clenched her fists nervously and took a deep breath before letting go. She was so nervous that her tense face relaxed a little, then she followed her.","Tang Wanru followed beside her. The two of them followed Qi Yan and were very unfamiliar with their surroundings.","On the other hand, Qi Yan seemed very familiar with the Pharmacy Association. She led them in and even greeted some people.","After being nervous for a few minutes, Tang Wanru’s expression relaxed a little. As she walked, she whispered to the girl beside her, “Is this the Pharmacy Association? I didn’t expect the Association to be like this.”","Jiang Xianrou was quite nervous and answered her casually.","Tang Wanru saw the Association’s laboratory along the way. She also saw people dressed in lab coats walking past them hurriedly.","She couldn’t help but raise her eyebrows again. “We should really get your grandfather and Qiao Nian to come over and see what the highest level of medicine looks like!”","Jiang Xianrou was originally nervous. Hearing this, a trace of arrogance and coldness flashed across her face. She said coldly, “Heh, she might not be able to come to such a place in her entire life.”","Tang Wanru thought for a moment. “That’s true. What kind of place is the Pharmacy Association? How could Qiao Nian possibly come here?”","When she thought of this, her face relaxed and she revealed a happy expression. “So what if she follows Mr. Huang? She’ll never have the chance to see a place like the Pharmacy Association in her life! Your grandfather even treated her as a treasure and thought that she could bring glory to the family by winning a few wild chicken awards. Tsk! He’s old and muddle-headed. In the future, he’ll know who he can rely on to earn face for the family!”","Jiang Xianrou smiled without saying anything, but her eyes revealed a strong sense of superiority.","She didn’t say much, but she wanted to see Jiang Li and Old Master Jiang regret not choosing her back then.","She couldn’t wait for that day to come!","...","“Yeah.”","The Pharmacy Association had a total of ten floors. The place where the new members reported was on the first floor, not far from the entrance.","Qi Yan led Jiang Xianrou there and communicated with staff about Jiang Xianrou’s situation.","The staff quickly entered Jiang Xianrou’s information into the system and asked her to fill in a set of basic information.","After about 40 minutes, they were finally done.","Qi Yan was not someone who liked to waste time.","After she successfully completed the procedures with Jiang Xianrou, she smiled and said to them, “I’ve contacted Dean Zhong’s disciple. He said that Dean Zhong is receiving a very important friend and asked us to go over ourselves. He’ll meet us when Dean Zhong is done. Let’s go over and wait.”","Jiang Xianrou felt nervous again when she heard that Qi Yan was about to bring her to see Zhong Yiliu. Her back stiffened and she nodded hurriedly. “Yes, sorry to trouble you, Godmother.”","Seeing her petty look, Qi Yan straightened her clothes and smiled gently. “It’s no trouble at all. I already said that I wanted to introduce you to Dean Zhong.”","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t say anything else.","Qi Yan led them over calmly.","“Come on, let’s go over and wait.”"]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 Sister Nian Is Also Here","paragraphs":["1489 Sister Nian Is Also Here","The most difficult place to get into the Pharmacy Association was not on the 10th floor, but in a nondescript laboratory in the farthest corner of the sixth floor.","In the lab.","An old man with white hair was showing a pile of experimental data to a girl. “Look at this.”","He stuffed a stack of A4 papers that recorded the drug’s data into the girl’s hands. He was more anxious than anyone else and spoke quickly and eloquently. “After I saw the prescription you sent me the other day, I did a few more experiments. This is the data record of those trials.”","The girl was wearing a black hoodie. The hoodie was pulled up, and her face under the hood was exquisite and eye-catching.","Who else could it be but Qiao Nian?","At this moment, she was sitting in Zhong Yiliu’s computer chair. Her eyes were casual as her slender white hand held the stack of documents that Zhong Yiliu stuffed into her hands.","She flipped through the pages quickly.","It was so fast that it was as if she wasn’t looking at them seriously.","Qiao Nian finished reading what Zhong Yiliu had given her in less than five minutes. She placed the stack of experimental data on the computer desk and sat down lazily. “I’m done.”","“Did you see the data I sent last time?”","Zhong Yiliu walked around and said, “I added jaundice according to your prescription several times before. The last time I replaced jaundice with Ganoderma, the composition of the medicine clearly improved. Do you want to...”","However, before he could finish speaking.","Qiao Nian raised her hand and flipped through the experimental data on the table. Without thinking, she interrupted him. “I want to promote this medicine so that even ordinary people can afford it. This way, the cost of Ganoderma will be too high. It’s not worth it.”","There were as many precious medicinal herbs in the Pharmacy Association as there were hairs on an ox. In the storeroom, there were even ginseng and Ganoderma that were so moldy that no one used them.","The ginseng used for Zhong Yiliu’s experiment was not an ordinary lingzhi, but the Ganoderma that she had bought for Uncle Chen at the underground auction.","This kind of meat Ganoderma that was hundreds of years old was hard to come by!","It would definitely be enough if she used it normally.","However, it was clearly unrealistic for her to promote it on a large scale.","Even if it could be realized in the end, only the upper class could afford this medicine.","Then, what was the difference between this improved little pill and the little pills she had given Wei Lou to circulate on the black market?","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and placed her fingers on the paper. She pursed her lips and said in a slightly hoarse voice, “I promised my grandfather that I would promote this medicine to everyone. Since I’ve promised him, I have to keep my word.","“If you change the meat Ganoderma to ordinary Ganoderma, the effect will be similar to jaundice, so there’s not much difference between using ordinary jaundice and Ganoderma.”","Zhong Yiliu opened his mouth at her words. For a moment, he was speechless.","He was too intent on the potion to be interested in anything else.","More than whether he could promote a drug that would benefit the country and the people, he focused on getting the effects of a drug to the extreme, preferably to perfection.","However, he didn’t insist since Qiao Nian had said so.","Zhong Yiliu thought about the girl’s words for a moment. In his mind, he simulated the effect of replacing jaundice with ordinary Ganoderma in the market. He had to admit that Qiao Nian was right. This effect was actually not much different from the effect of the prescription Qiao Nian had given him.","He felt bad at the thought of his month-plus study of loneliness, but he let it go more than he felt bad.","He had studied that prescription for a month but had yet to come up with a better one. This meant that the prescription Qiao Nian had given him was already the best."]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 A Slap in the Face, Two Forces Coincidentally Met!","paragraphs":["1490 A Slap in the Face, Two Forces Coincidentally Met!","“You make me feel like I’ve got a higher space to explore on the potion every time you visit. Sigh.”","Zhong Yiliu smiled bitterly. He had been defeated by Qiao Nian.","“As expected, I still have to cultivate!”","After saying this, he knew what Qiao Nian was here for. Without wasting any time, he said to the girl sitting on the computer chair, “Come with me. I’ll bring you to get the medicine.”","CD-3 was a targeted drug he’d developed last year.","As many as the Pharmacy Association wanted.","If Qiao Nian wanted this medicine, he would bring her to the place where he had placed it.","Qiao Nian stood up, tugged at the brim of her cap, and followed behind him. “Mm.”","Zhong Yiliu led the way. She walked a short distance away from Zhong Yiliu, about two steps apart.","As they walked out of the laboratory, Zhong Yiliu chatted with Qiao Nian about potions.","Until they walked out of Zhong Yiliu’s laboratory and met a young man with blond hair and blue eyes.","The young man also had three people with him. He happened to see them come out.","The young man greeted Zhong Yiliu skillfully and said respectfully, “Director, the Countess is here.”","Zhong Yiliu stopped and let out an “Oh” in surprise, as if he had just remembered that Qi Yan had called him. “You guys are here.”","Qiao Nian lowered the brim of her cap with one hand in her pocket, revealing only her chin.","But her skin was very fair, and her temperament was outstanding.","Zhong Yiliu stopped to talk to someone, and Qiao Nian stopped as well. She had no intention of responding.","Robert, on the other hand, was stunned to find a young girl with his teacher. His eyes lit up as he reacted.","Q?","He was thrilled.","After all, Zhong Yiliu had mentioned Q many times, but this was the first time he had seen her in person.","He hadn’t expected her to be so young.","However, Robert had been in the Pharmacy Association for so long and had often been outside himself, after all. His mental fortitude was much stronger than that of the average person.","Even though he was very excited, he temporarily restrained himself. He turned to Qi Yan and the other two and said, “Let me introduce you to Dean Zhong.”","Robert looked at Qiao Nian, who was standing beside Zhong Yiliu, and said in a low voice, “... The other one is a very important friend of our dean. She came to our Pharmacy Association today because she had something on.”","Qi Yan didn’t recognize the girl standing beside Zhong Yiliu at first glance, so she could still smile. “I didn’t expect Dean Zhong to have such a young friend.”","However, Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou’s expressions changed when they walked out of the laboratory and heard that she was Dean Zhong’s ‘important friend’.","At this moment, Jiang Xianrou looked as if she had been struck by lightning after they saw each other clearly. Her beautiful face was snow-white, and her lips were trembling. She couldn’t believe her eyes.","Qiao... Qiao Nian?","Why had she come to Continent O and appeared beside the Pharmacy Association’s dean?","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t describe her current mood. It was as if she had flown into the clouds and fallen into the abyss.","A kind of shock and pressure pressed down on her so hard she could barely lift her head.","Jiang Xianrou stood there in a daze. Zhong Yiliu was clearly in front of her, but she couldn’t even greet him normally.","Her gaze was fixed on the girl beside Zhong Yiliu who had her head lowered and was acting nonchalant. Her gaze was so scorching that it was as if she wanted to chisel her apart!","It was Qiao Nian. That person was clearly Qiao Nian!"]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 You Know Each Other?","paragraphs":["1491 You Know Each Other?","“Chief Robert, why don’t you introduce everyone?” Qi Yan had yet to realize that the person standing beside Zhong Yiliu was Qiao Nian. She spoke with a smile.","“Well...” A momentary hesitation crossed Robert’s face, then he looked at the girl, who was looking down at her phone, clearly undecided.","Qiao Nian lowered her head and sent messages to Ye Wangchuan.","She had just told him that she had gone to the Pharmacy Association and was about to go to the storeroom with Zhong Yijie to get the medicine... Ye Wangchuan seemed to be very busy and had yet to reply to her message.","!!","Qiao Nian wasn’t in a hurry. She slowly put her phone back into her pocket and looked up. She immediately saw the four people blocking her way.","She had never met Robert and Qi Yan, but she saw Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou.","Qiao Nian frowned slightly, and her head started aching. There was no emotion in her dark eyes. However, Zhong Yiliu could feel that she was getting impatient. He whispered to her, “I met a few people I know. Wait for me.”","Qiao Nian lowered her long eyelashes, as if she didn’t know Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru. She looked away from them, put one hand in her pocket, and replied in a low voice, “Yes.”","Qi Yan also saw the girl’s face.","Qiao Nian was too eye-catching.","Although she had never met Qiao Nian properly, she had heard a lot about her from Qi Lanyin and her brother, Qi Rongguang.","She had gotten someone to investigate Qiao Nian herself.","She didn’t find out much, but Qiao Nian usually had to go to school and participate in some competitions. There were many photos and videos online.","She had seen Qiao Nian’s photos and videos of the competition. She had a deep impression of her.","She recognized her as soon as Qiao Nian looked up. “It’s you?”","Qi Yan’s voice was too surprised, and her expression clearly cracked. She wasn’t as smooth as before, and she almost couldn’t control her expression, revealing disgust and hatred.","However, she quickly wiped the emotion from her face and put on a surprised expression. At least, it was impossible to tell that she was hostile.","Zhong Yiliu was stunned for a moment before asking curiously, “Do you know each other?”","Qi Yan didn’t know what to say.","She didn’t know Qiao Nian personally. At least, this was the first time they had met in real life.","But it would be a lie to say that she didn’t know Qiao Nian. The Qi family had almost been destroyed because they had bumped into this girl in the illegal district...","The hatred could not be explained in one or two sentences.","Besides, she still didn’t know how close Zhong Yiliu was to Qiao Nian!","“We...” She was still formulating the words, her mind quickly weighing the pros and cons, trying to think how she would answer the question.","Robert was also quite surprised. He didn’t expect them to know Q. Qi Yan was fine, but Jiang Xianrou was just an ordinary new member of the Pharmacy Association. He asked Jiang Xianrou enviously, “You know the dean’s friend?”","He thought that Jiang Xianrou was introduced to the Pharmacy Association by Qi Yan.","Qi Yan knew Q.","Therefore, Jiang Xianrou must also know Q.","“...” Jiang Xianrou’s mind went blank. Her fingernails were about to be broken as she clenched her fists. Her face was pale, and even her lips couldn’t be seen. She stared fixedly at the girl not far away. She seemed to be strangled, and she couldn’t say a word.","Robert was still looking at her expectantly, unaware of how uncomfortable she felt at that moment."]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 Sister Nian Slapped Her Backhand","paragraphs":["1492 Sister Nian Slapped Her Backhand","Jiang Xianrou wished she could find a place to hide. She opened her mouth with difficulty and let out a dry and unpleasant note.","“I...”","Robert looked at her intently, as if he wanted her to introduce him to Qiao Nian.","Jiang Xianrou’s mind was a mess. Her breathing was rapid and nervous, and she didn’t know how to answer.","She kept glancing in Qiao Nian’s direction.","The other party’s expression was arrogant and very lazy, as if she had no intention of paying attention to her.","Jiang Xianrou retracted her gaze in humiliation and bit her lip. Her eyes flickered as if 10,000 ants were crawling on her heart.","She weighed the loss quickly. In spite of her utter humiliation, she intended to admit it.","“We know each other—”","The girl’s lazy voice sounded at the same time. “No.”","Robert was listening to her at first, but the moment Qiao Nian spoke, his attention was immediately drawn to her. He didn’t hear what Jiang Xianrou had said at all.","“You don’t know them?” Robert wasn’t surprised. He nodded in sudden understanding and explained, “I thought you knew them.”","This did not include Qi Yan.","However, Qi Yan still felt embarrassed.","Needless to say, Jiang Xianrou’s face turned pale. Not long after, her face turned red. Her fingernails were about to pierce into her palm, but she didn’t feel any pain. She only felt as if Qiao Nian’s words had slapped her in the face. Her face turned red and green. Her humiliation doubled when she thought of how she had said ‘We know each other’ at the same time.","Qiao Nian did it on purpose!","She deliberately embarrassed her!","Jiang Xianrou was no longer willing to say another word. She even wanted to leave immediately.","However, she didn’t dare to leave. She had just reported to the Pharmacy Association. She didn’t dare to be impudent at all in front of Zhong Yiliu...","Qiao Nian didn’t look at Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru’s reactions as she replied calmly, “No.”","Qi Yan’s lips twitched. Not to mention anything else, she felt embarrassed for the Jiang mother and daughter.","However, she was quite embarrassed herself at this moment and could not be bothered to feel embarrassed for others.","Robert exclaimed in disappointment when he heard that she didn’t know Jiang Xianrou and the others. His enthusiasm for them had obviously decreased.","But after a moment’s thought, he made a brief introduction for both sides.","“Let me introduce you! This is the new member of our Pharmacy Association, Jiang Xianrou. Beside her is her mother, and the other is the Countess, surnamed Qi. Speaking of which, they are also from Country Z.”","Robert immediately turned back to Qi Yan and the others. “This is the dean’s friend, Q.”","Zhong Yiliu wasn’t interested in socializing. He didn’t have much patience when he heard that Qiao Nian didn’t know these people. It was obvious that he was quite impatient.","Qi Yan had never been humiliated like this before, but she was much better at socializing than Jiang Xianrou and the others. She immediately put away the complicated feelings in her heart and smiled. “Hello, Miss Qiao. It’s our first time meeting. Please take care of me in the future.”","Qiao Nian had no intention of being polite to her. She said coldly, “I’m not in the position to take care of you.”","This meant... they weren’t that close!","Qi Yan’s smile froze. She hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to not give her any face. She held it in and didn’t show it.","“Hehe. Miss Qiao, you’re too polite. You’re young and promising. We still need you to take care of us in the future.”"]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 Jiang Xianrou Is Mr. Huang’s Disciple?","paragraphs":["1493 Jiang Xianrou Is Mr. Huang’s Disciple?","After she finished speaking, Qiao Nian had no intention of responding. Qi Yan tidied her hair awkwardly to hide her embarrassment.","Robert noticed Jiang Xianrou and turned to Qiao Nian. “Q, you’re usually in Country Z. Have you heard of Huang Bin?”","Huang Bin was Mr. Huang’s name.","Foreigners didn’t have so many formalities. Perhaps he wanted Qiao Nian to know who he was talking about, so he directly mentioned Mr. Huang’s name.","Then, he introduced Jiang Xianrou to Qiao Nian.","“This new member of our Pharmacy Association used to be Mr. Huang’s disciple. She studied with Mr. Huang for a period of time, but because Mr. Huang’s health wasn’t good, he didn’t continue to teach her.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows in surprise, her expression intrigued.","She had never heard of Jiang Xianrou learning from Mr. Huang. She only knew that Jiang Xianrou had always been learning from Liang Lu.","Later on, Liang Lu was dealt with by the Wei family because of Old Master Wei’s matter. Now, her life was a mess. Not to mention being an authoritative expert in the country, she was almost unable to survive after being dealt with by Wei Lou. She was just short of going to jail...","After Liang Lu was down on her luck, Jiang Xianrou, Liang Lu’s favored student, couldn’t wait to cut ties with her.","Forget helping Liang Lu.","In any case, she had never heard of Jiang Xianrou contacting Liang Lu.","In other words, before Liang Lu’s accident, Jiang Xianrou was still close to Liang Lu. After Liang Lu’s accident, the two of them were no different from strangers.","“She’s Mr. Huang’s disciple?” Qiao Nian’s voice was slightly hoarse, and she sounded very interested.","Robert still didn’t know that his so-called ‘Mr. Huang’s disciple’ was just a lie that Qi Yan made up because Country Z was far away from Country M. Her goal was to make Jiang Xianrou look good. Therefore, he nodded and said solemnly, “Yes, but Mr. Huang’s health is not good, so he won’t take in disciples.”","The people of the Pharmacy Association only cared about strength.","Mr. Huang wasn’t a medicine expert, but he still had outstanding achievements in the medical world. Everyone in the Pharmacy Association had heard of his name and respected this Chinese medicine master very much.","Jiang Xianrou bit her lip so hard that it almost broke. She was afraid that Qiao Nian would expose her lie. On the other hand, she felt as if she had been fried in oil. It was humiliating and embarrassing.","“I...”","Afraid that Qiao Nian would expose their lies, Tang Wanru’s back tensed up as well. She looked at Qiao Nian warily, ready to lie for Jiang Xianrou at any moment.","She had already thought it through. If Qiao Nian exposed their lies, she would say that Qiao Nian had only been in Beijing for less than half a year. It was normal for her not to know about the past.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian had no intention of exposing them. She only gave an ambiguous “Oh,” her eyes filled with interest. She didn’t say anything else.","But just one “oh” made Jiang Xianrou’s face burn. She wished she could find a hole to hide in.","“Q, well...” Robert had wanted to chat more with Qiao Nian.","Beside Qiao Nian, Zhong Yiliu interrupted him impatiently. “Alright, that’s it. You don’t usually talk so much!","“I’ve got things to do with her. Enjoy yourselves. We’ll see ourselves out.”","Robert touched the bridge of his nose and glanced in Qiao Nian’s direction. He was quite reluctant to part with her, but he didn’t dare to snatch her away from his teacher. He could only watch helplessly as Zhong Yiliu led the girl towards the medicine storage room...","Zhong Yiliu had a good relationship with Qi Yan. He ignored Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru, but he gave Qi Yan face and bade her farewell before leaving.","However, she only greeted him and did not take it to heart."]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 My Sister Is in the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["1494 My Sister Is in the Pharmacy Association","Qi Yan watched the two of them leave and couldn’t calm down for a long time. She retracted her gaze and looked at the mother and daughter. Their faces were each paler than the other. She found some balance in her heart and relaxed her brows, then said, “Let’s go back.”","Jiang Xianrou had yet to recover from the shock of meeting Qiao Nian in Country M’s Pharmacy Association. She nodded haphazardly, her heart in a mess.","Tang Wanru seemed to have thought of something. She grabbed the strap of her bag tightly, her eyes filled with ruthlessness!","“Your godmother is right. Let’s go back.”","!!","“Yeah, sure.”","The three of them were in high spirits when they came to the Pharmacy Association, but they left in a sorry state.","...","Two hours later.","Qiao Nian received the medicine that Su Huaiyuan urgently needed and returned to the hotel.","She contacted Xu Jishen first and told him that she had obtained the CD-3 targeted drug from the Pharmacy Association.","If nothing unexpected happened tomorrow, she would land at the Beijing International Airport at night. Then, she would immediately rush to Rao City.","After making this call, Qiao Nian put the medicine Zhong Yiliu had given her into her shoulder bag, zipped it up, and picked up her phone to check the messages.","Ye Wangchuan still hadn’t replied to her.","She was in no hurry. After booking a flight back, she put her phone on the table to charge and went to shower.","...","On the other side, in Rao City hospital.","Mother Su had been taking care of Su Huaiyuan for the past few days.","Xu Jishen would occasionally come over to replace her, lest she tired herself out and fall ill.","As soon as the news of Su Huaiyuan’s illness spread, many people who were on good terms with the Su family came to visit them. Xu Jishen was exhausted and had to deal with these people. He had not rested well for the past few days, and his handsome face was visibly tired. His dark circles were thick and heavy.","Fortunately, Qiao Nian’s call gave him a shot of adrenaline.","Xu Jishen couldn’t hide his joy. He walked back briskly, ready to tell Mother Su the good news.","He had just reached the door of the ward when he bumped into Jiang Yao, who had rushed over from Beijing.","Jiang Yao was travel-worn. He immediately called out upon seeing him, “Young Master Xu.”","Xu Jishen stopped in his tracks and finally noticed him. “Why are you here?”","“I heard about Old Master Su.” Jiang Yao quickly walked up to him and patted his shoulder comfortingly. He asked with a serious expression, “Are you alright? Old Master Su is... old, after all. Don’t think too much.”","Ever since Xu Jishen found out that Qiao Nian had received the CD-3 targeted drug, he had been in an extremely good mood. He smiled in high spirits upon hearing Jiang Yao’s comforting words. “I’m fine. Don’t worry, I’m fine now. I can’t be any better!”","He had thought that his grandfather could only accept his fate this time. He hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to have a way to get her hands on the medicine. Everything had taken a turn for the better...","“You...” Jiang Yao didn’t expect him to be so ‘concerned’. Old Master Su was lying in the intensive care unit, but Xu Jishen was still fine.","He was momentarily at a loss. He was stunned for a moment before he composed himself. Then, he pursed his lips and said seriously, “Young Master Xu, feel free to let me know if you need any help. We’re friends, and your grandfather is my elder. Old Master Su is currently staying in the hospital, so I want to do my best.”","He thought for a moment and thought of Jiang Xianrou. Then, he looked at Xu Jishen and frowned. “My sister went to the Pharmacy Association. She’s now a member. If you need anything, I can ask her to ask if there’s any medicine that Old Master Su can use.”"]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 Face Slapping, Thanks to Your Sister!","paragraphs":["1495 Face Slapping, Thanks to Your Sister!","Xu Jishen had been busy with Su Huaiyuan for the past few days and did not pay attention to the situation in Beijing. He didn’t know that Jiang Xianrou had also gone to the Pharmacy Association.","Xu Jishen mistakenly thought that Jiang Yao was referring to Qiao Nian when he mentioned the Pharmacy Association. He couldn’t hide his joy and replied with a smile, “I know. I just spoke to her on the phone. She’s already got the medicine.”","Jiang Yao was a little confused. “Young Master Xu, you said you talked to my sister on the phone?”","Xu Jishen placed his hand on his shoulder and patted him twice. He was very grateful. “Yes, it’s all thanks to your sister this time.”","!!","Jiang Yao was speechless.","He had no idea what Xu Jishen was talking about.","This was because, in his memory, Xu Jishen and Jiang Xianrou had added each other on WeChat, but they did not seem to be familiar with each other. Xianrou had never mentioned this to him at all.","What the hell was going on?","Jiang Yao was confused.","Mother Su came out of Old Master Su’s ward and quietly closed the door.","She was dressed in a light-colored modified Chinese traditional suit with a shawl over her shoulders. She wasn’t in the mood to style her hair, so she looked disheveled. There were also very heavy bags under her eyelids, and he could tell that she looked haggard and tired.","“Hello, Auntie.” Jiang Yao greeted her politely.","Mother Su rarely interacted with Xu Jishen’s friends. When she suddenly saw the young man standing beside him, she was stunned and looked at her son. “This is?”","“Mom, let me introduce you. This is my friend, Jiang Yao.” Xu Jishen introduced Jiang Yao to Mother Su and added with a smile, “Jiang Yao is Miss Qiao’s brother. Miss Qiao is Old Master Jiang’s granddaughter. She has always lived in Rao City, so not many people in Beijing know about this.”","At first, Mother Su’s attitude towards Jiang Yao was very casual and not very enthusiastic.","Until Xu Jishen mentioned Qiao Nian.","“Ah, so you’re Miss Qiao’s brother. Hello, hello.”","She immediately looked at Jiang Yao and spoke to him warmly and gently. “I’m Xu Jishen’s mother, Su Hui. You can call me Auntie Su.”","Jiang Yao was still wondering why Xu Jishen had specifically mentioned Qiao Nian, but he still smoothly greeted her. “Auntie Su.”","Mother Su nodded, pulling him along. “It’s all thanks to Miss Qiao this time. Otherwise, our family wouldn’t know what to do! Thank you so much. I thank you on my father’s behalf.”","Jiang Yao’s mind was a mess. He didn’t know how to respond because he didn’t know what Xu Jishen and Su Hui were talking about. He only forced a smile and said politely, “No, no, you’re too polite.”","“I’m not being polite. I’m...” Su Hui wanted to say something.","Xu Jishen called to her, “Mom.”","Su Hui immediately turned to look at him.","Xu Jishen did not pay much attention to Jiang Yao. He couldn’t wait to tell her the good news. “Miss Qiao called me just now and said that she has already gotten the medicine from the Pharmacy Association!”","“... Miss Qiao got the medicine?” Mother Su’s eyes lit up. Her haggard face instantly transformed.","Xu Jishen nodded. “Yes, she said that she will arrive in Beijing tomorrow night and then grab a flight to Rao City.”","Mother Su couldn’t hide her joy. She spun around in circles to digest this good news.","Then, she looked at her son and said without thinking, “Miss Qiao especially went to the Pharmacy Association for us. How could you let her fly here alone to deliver medicine?”"]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 Miss Qiao, Our Madam Wants to See You","paragraphs":["1496 Miss Qiao, Our Madam Wants to See You","“No, you have to pick her up at the airport.”","She pondered for a moment and immediately decided. “I’ll take care of your grandfather. Buy the earliest plane to Beijing and wait for her at the airport tomorrow.”","Xu Jishen did not expect this. He lowered his eyes and thought about it. He felt that what Mother Su said made sense and nodded. “Alright.”","After Mother Su arranged everything, a nurse came over to take Su Huaiyuan’s blood pressure.","!!","She bade Jiang Yao farewell and followed the nurse into the ward.","Jiang Yao waited for her to enter. Then, he looked at this friend with a complicated expression and asked in a low voice, “Young Master Xu, is the person you were talking about Qiao Nian?”","“Who else?”","Xu Jishen was quite surprised. He glanced at him and said with a smile, “It’s all thanks to Miss Qiao for helping us get medicine from the Pharmacy Association this time. Our family owes her a big favor!”","Jiang Yao’s mind was in a mess.","He really hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to be related to the Pharmacy Association. She could even obtain medicine from them.","One had to know that the Pharmacy Association’s medicine was very precious. Not everyone could get it just like that.","Previously, when he mentioned Jiang Xianrou, he didn’t dare to guarantee that she would be able to help him. However, Qiao Nian easily obtained Old Master Su’s medicine from the Pharmacy Association.","Jiang Yao’s emotions were indescribably complicated.","He was finding it harder and harder to understand his cheap cousin.","He felt that Qiao Nian had an unfathomable network of connections. Those people were not people he could come into contact with.","“By the way, Jiang Yao, remember to tell me if she needs anything in the future.” Xu Jishen looked at him and said solemnly, “As long as it’s something I can do, no matter what it is, as long as Miss Qiao asks, I will definitely do my best to help!”","Jiang Yao saw his serious expression and opened his mouth. After a long while, he squeezed out an “Okay.”","The Waldorf Hotel, Country M.","Qiao Nian had just returned to the hotel with the medicine when a car stopped by the road, blocking her way.","There was a golden logo in front of the black car. The golden logo shone brightly under the sunlight arrogantly.","Qiao Nian glanced at the conspicuous logo and pulled down the brim of her cap. Her half-squinted eyes were cold and dry.","She recognized the logo. It was the logo of the royal family of Country M.","Soon the occupants of the car got out.","It was a man in his prime. He was tall and burly, and he was wearing a black suit that was engraved on a plate. He walked up to her expressionlessly and said, “Miss Qiao, our Madam wants to see you.”","Qiao Nian had earphones on. The wires were still hanging outside her sweater.","She took off her headphones very calmly. Her slender fingers were fair and slender. She looked at him with her beautiful black eyes and almost without thinking, she said, “No!”","The same blank expression, the same arrogance!","However, her aura was far superior to the Qi family’s chauffeur.","With that, Qiao Nian ignored the other party’s stunned reaction and made to bypass the person in front of her.","After a moment of surprise, the Qi family driver reacted and did not dare to let her go. He reached out to block her again and said seriously, “Miss Qiao, please come with me!”","Qiao Nian didn’t want to argue with him.","Seeing that he was blocking her way again and that there was a strong threat in his tone, she looked up, revealing an exquisite and eye-catching face.","Her voice was low and hoarse but also inadvertently cold. “What if I don’t go?”"]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 No Wonder Master Wang Likes Her","paragraphs":["1497 No Wonder Master Wang Likes Her","“This...” The Qi family driver was used to being domineering in Country M. He didn’t expect a young girl to speak to him like this.","He thought of Qi Yan’s instructions and his eyes turned cold. “If Miss Qiao doesn’t cooperate, I’ll have to invite Miss Qiao to go!”","He emphasized the word ‘invite’.","Although he said that he was inviting Qiao Nian, he was actually coercing her.","!!","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow, her dark eyes cold.","It had been a long time since she’d seen anyone threaten her so openly.","Qiao Nian was about to ask him how he planned to “invite” her when a clear voice suddenly interrupted.","“Miss Qiao, you’re finally back.”","Qiao Nian looked in the direction of the voice and saw a man in a suit walking over. The man was tall, with a high nose bridge and deep facial features. From his appearance, he seemed to be of mixed race.","The other party walked in their direction and stopped in front of her as if he was very familiar with her. “Master Wang said that you went to the Pharmacy Association and asked me to wait for you here at the hotel.”","Qiao Nian roughly understood what was going on when Ye Wangchuan was mentioned.","After saying this, the other party looked at the Qi family’s driver and asked her softly, “This is? Do you know each other?”","The Qi family’s driver seemed to recognize him. He revealed a fearful expression. Without waiting for Qiao Nian to speak, he said, “Since Miss Qiao has an appointment today, I won’t disturb you anymore. I’ll come and look for you another day.”","With that, he didn’t dare make eye contact with the man and immediately ran off.","Previously, the Qi family’s car had driven over arrogantly. Now, it drove away again. There was no sign of its previous arrogance.","...","The other party waited until the Qi family’s car had completely driven away before heaving a sigh of relief. He turned to Qiao Nian and asked, “Are you alright?”","He thought for a moment and was afraid that Qiao Nian would misunderstand. He immediately explained, “I’m under Master Wang. He should have given you my phone number.”","“He did give me a phone number,” Qiao Nian said unhurriedly.","Seeing that she was not frightened, Ji Lin was slightly relieved and explained, “Master Wang guessed that you might encounter someone ignorant, so he instructed me to keep watch here. Fortunately, you’re fine.”","His facial features were tough, and he looked to be of mixed blood. He was very outstanding. He introduced himself gently. “Hello, Miss Qiao. My name is Ji Lin. I’m Master Wang’s subordinate. I’m mainly in charge of the matters in Continent O.”","Ji Lin had received news from Ye Wangchuan asking him to protect Qiao Nian during her time in Country M.","This was the first time he had seen Master Wang so concerned about someone.","Seeing that the other party was a young girl, he didn’t understand why Master Wang wanted him to put down what he was doing and her.","It was only at this moment that Ji Lin saw Qiao Nian’s striking face clearly. He finally understood.","Miss Qiao was really good-looking. No wonder Master Wang liked her.","Ji Lin smiled and extended his hand politely. “Nice to meet you.”","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow. Seeing the other party’s gaze on her face, she lowered her cap lazily.","She shook Ji Lin’s hand and retracted her hand. “Qiao Nian.”","“I know. Master Wang told me your name.”","Ji Lin then looked at the time on his watch and then at her shoulder bag. He thought for a moment and asked, “Miss Qiao, you haven’t eaten anything, have you? Why don’t I take you to dinner first?”"]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 Master Wang, Your Identity Has Fallen","paragraphs":["1498 Master Wang, Your Identity Has Fallen","Pointing to a Lamborghini parked on the curb nearby, he said, “My car’s over there.”","Qiao Nian looked in the direction he was pointing at. With just one glance, she retracted her gaze and tugged at the strap of her shoulder bag, declining his good intentions.","“There’s no need for that. I ordered takeout. The hotel staff should have sent it up by now.”","Ji Lin still had things to do, but because of Ye Wangchuan’s instructions, he had no choice but to stay outside the hotel to protect Qiao Nian.","He didn’t really want to eat with her. Seeing that she had rejected him, he slid down the ladder. “I see. I won’t disturb you anymore.”","In the end, Ji Lin didn’t dare to disobey Ye Wangchuan’s orders. Thinking about how the Qi family’s car had blocked Qiao Nian’s path, he thought about it and said, “Miss Qiao, if you need anything, remember to call me. I’ll be nearby.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian agreed readily.","Reassured, Ji Lin left after reminding her of a few things.","After he left, Qiao Nian took out her phone from her pocket. She didn’t know what Ye Wangchuan was doing, but he still hadn’t replied to her on WeChat.","Qiao Nian tapped her slender fingers on the screen. She lowered her eyes, hiding the interest in them.","Ji Lin...","She seemed to have heard of this name before.","...","At the Qi Residence.","Qi Yan had just sent Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru off when she asked the servant to make her a new cup of earl grey black tea.","“Madam.”","The servant quickly placed the tea and exquisite snacks on the table in front of her.","The Qi family’s chauffeur rushed in.","“What are you doing? Why are you so impatient?” Qi Yan frowned. Seeing that there was no one behind him, she asked unhappily, “What’s going on? Where’s the person I asked you to invite over?”","She was talking about Qiao Nian.","She had been feeling uneasy ever since she saw Qiao Nian beside Zhong Yiliu at the Pharmacy Association. She wanted to call her over to investigate and see what Qiao Nian’s relationship with the Association was.","Hence, while dealing with the Jiang mother and daughter, she instructed the driver to invite her over.","Who knew that she would not come?","Seeing that she was angry, the chauffeur hurriedly lowered his head and said softly, “Madam, I wanted to invite Miss Qiao over, but someone from the Bright Gate suddenly appeared.”","“The Bright Gate?” Qi Yan’s expression changed.","The exquisite tea set clattered on the table.","Her expression was uncertain, and her charming eyes shook violently. She could hardly believe what she was hearing.","The Bright Gate was similar to Tian Chen and was also a force in the illegal district.","However, compared to Tian Chen, the Bright Gate was even more low-key and mysterious. No one knew who was behind it.","The Bright Gate also rarely appeared in public.","However, those who knew the distribution of forces in the illegal zone and the independent continent knew that the Bright Gate was an existence that could not be underestimated. They had many advanced weapons in their possession.","Strictly speaking, the person behind the Bright Gate was considered a very powerful person in the illegal district and the independent continent.","At the very least, he was not someone Qi Yan could afford to offend.","She was a little confused. “How does Qiao Nian know someone from the Bright Gate?”","The Qi family driver lowered his head and did not dare to say a word. After all, he was just a small fry who didn’t know anything.","How could a small fry like him know what Qi Yan didn’t know?","Qi Yan wasn’t asking him. She was just too shocked, so she couldn’t help but ask. She didn’t expect the driver to answer her."]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 The Other Party Is Warning Her, A Clear Slap in the Face","paragraphs":["1499 The Other Party Is Warning Her, A Clear Slap in the Face","Qi Yan stood up from the sofa in frustration and picked up her phone, planning to find someone to investigate.","Her brother’s call came in at this moment.","Qi Yan immediately picked it up. “Hello.”","Her mind was still on that person from Bright Gate, and she couldn’t wait to ask Qi Rongguang.","“Brother, do you know what the Red Alliance has to do with the Bright Gate?”","Not many people knew that Qiao Nian was Sun of the Red Alliance.","She only knew about this because the Qi family had suffered a setback in the illegal district. However, she didn’t tell anyone about it. She kept this information for herself.","She had originally thought that Qiao Nian was only able to become the number one hacker in the Red Alliance because of her astonishing talent in hacking.","Now it seemed that things were not as simple as she had thought.","Qiao Nian wasn’t as ordinary as she looked...","Qi Yan gritted her teeth indignantly. Her sharp eyes were cold as she gripped her phone tightly. Her heart was racing. She really couldn’t understand how an ordinary girl from Rao City could turn the country upside down. She couldn’t see through her now.","“The Red Alliance and the Bright Gate?” Qi Rongguang had something to tell her, but she posed a question before he could say anything. He was obviously confused. “What connection can the Red Alliance have with the Bright Gate... The Red Alliance’s power is mainly in the illegal area, and the Bright Gate’s power is mainly in the independent continent. I’ve never heard that the Red Alliance is related to the Bright Gate.”","Weren’t the two unrelated?","Qi Yan’s tense heart sank. She frowned, clearly not believing him.","Qi Rongguang asked, “Why are you suddenly asking this? What’s wrong?”","Qi Yan was troubled and did not want to tell him. “I just suddenly thought of asking you. It’s fine.”","“I thought something happened to you. I’m relieved that you’re fine.”","Qi Yan adjusted her mood and asked, “By the way, Brother, why are you looking for me?”","She walked back and picked up the black tea from the table again. She sipped it and composed herself.","Before Qi Yan could put down her teacup, she heard Qi Rongguang’s heavy tone. He said, “I got into a small accident. The other party forced my car to stop on the main road. Then, two burly men got out. I don’t know who they are. They told me that if you ‘invite’ her over again, it won’t be so simple next time.","“I had no idea what they were talking about. I asked them, but they didn’t explain to me what they meant...”","Qi Yan’s fingers holding the teacup turned white. She was so angry that her face turned red and her voice trembled. “You said that someone stopped you on the road and threatened you?”","“... It’s not really a threat. I suspect they’ve got the wrong person. I don’t even know what they mean.” Qi Rongguang’s tone was relaxed. He was still in the dark.","Qi Yan wondered about the interlude that had happened in Country M an hour ago.","She knew that this was not an accident.","The other party was warning her!","It was an open slap to the face!","Her lips were pale and the veins on her forehead were bulging. She tried her best to calm down and said to Qi Rongguang, “Yes, it should be an accident.”","After Qi Yan finished speaking, she reminded him worriedly, “Brother, be careful these days. Arrange a few more bodyguards for yourself.”","Qi Rongguang listened to his sister and smiled gently. “Okay, take care of yourself. I’ll hang up first.”","Qi Yan nodded and waited for him to hang up.","The smile she was barely maintaining instantly turned cold. She could barely suppress her anger as she slammed the phone to the ground."]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 Qi Yan Trembled in Anger","paragraphs":["1500 Qi Yan Trembled in Anger","“I only invited her over for tea and they dared to stop my brother on the road!”","The flip phone was immediately smashed to pieces.","A portion of the phone fragments splattered on the chauffeur, scaring him. However, the chauffeur lowered his head and did not even dare to breathe loudly.","“Ah!”","!!","Qi Yan was about to go crazy from anger.","Her fair face was flushed red, and her eyes were cold. “Qiao Nian is really amazing.”","She hadn’t eaten such a huge loss since she had successfully married into the royal family.","Qiao Nian was practically slapping her face.","How arrogant!","None of the servants and drivers in the living room dared to speak. They all lowered their heads in fear and trembled.","Qi Yan paced around in frustration.","She was so angry that her face turned pale, but she did not dare to act rashly because she still didn’t know who had made a move on Qi Rongguang.","The Red Alliance or... the Bright Gate?’","Qi Yan considered for three minutes. She looked up and instructed with a faint sinister voice, “Find out what happened to my brother.”","“Yes, Madam.”","The chauffeur rushed out to get things done.","...","On the other side.","Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru had just returned to the hotel.","They looked at each other in silence for the rest of the journey.","After they arrived at the hotel, Jiang Xianrou locked herself in her room, took out her phone from her bag, pulled out a chair, and sat down.","Ever since she had met Qiao Nian at the Pharmacy Association, her face had been pale and green. She had bitten her lip so hard that it had left a row of teeth marks.","[Xianrou, have you reached the Pharmacy Association? Have you seen Dean Zhong?]","After Jiang Xianrou turned on her phone, she only saw that Jiang Zongnan had sent her a message. The others ignored her completely.","Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and the others all knew that she had come to the Pharmacy Association this time, but no one paid attention to her.","Even Zhang Yang did not congratulate her.","Jiang Xianrou felt even more humiliated.","She opened WeChat and scrolled through the contacts. She recalled how pathetic she had been at the Pharmacy Association, then she thought of how high-spirited she had been before she left.","Her heart seemed to be crushed in the dust, and her chest was so stifled that she could barely breathe.","Qiao Nian...","Why had Qiao Nian appeared in the Pharmacy Association and become an important friend of the dean?","What was she doing there?","Jiang Xianrou’s mind was in a mess.","She stared at her phone again. On impulse, she found Qiao Nian’s number and called her.","“I’m sorry, but the number you have dialed cannot be reached.”","Jiang Xianrou lowered her hand with a dark expression.","She had almost forgotten.","Qiao Nian had already blacklisted her.","She couldn’t get through at all.","Jiang Xianrou flipped over the things on the table in frustration and looked at the person in the mirror. She bit her lip and her eyes flickered. She picked up her phone again and sent a message to Robert.","She carefully edited the message.","A few minutes later.","Her phone vibrated.","Jiang Xianrou quickly picked up her phone, unlocked it, and opened the latest message.","She sent a message asking him about Qiao Nian’s relationship with the Pharmacy Association.","The reply was short and to the point.","Jiang Xianrou took a deep breath and looked at the message.","The other party’s tone was extremely rude.","Just one sentence.","[Why do you care? This is not something you ordinary members can know.]","The words “ordinary member” deeply pierced Jiang Xianrou’s heart."]}]);
